c-40bc-583e-8388-344b4bdc08a2'}, {'abstract': 'Failure to provide proper rehabilitation for young offenders has led to a deal that could bring change to the system there and provide a model for the nation.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/01/opinion/juvenile-court-reform-in-tennessee.html', 'snippet': 'Failure to provide proper rehabilitation for young offenders has led to a deal that could bring change to the system there and provide a model for the nation.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The juvenile justice system in the United States is supposed to focus on rehabilitation for young offenders. But for generations, it has largely been a purgatory, failing to protect them or give them the help and counseling they need to become law-abiding adults. Children who end up in juvenile courts often do not get due process protections like written complaints presenting the charges against them, adequate notice about legal proceedings or meaningful assistance of counsel. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Juvenile Court Reform in Tennessee', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Juvenile Court Reform in Tennessee', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Tennessee', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Juvenile Delinquency', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Courts and the Judiciary', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Justice Department', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-01T00:23:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/d7b9409c-a09e-5e39-8206-d95b76da4cab', 'word_count': 344, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d7b9409c-a09e-5e39-8206-d95b76da4cab'}, {'abstract': 'Once king of Iowa’s nearly half-a-billion-dollar hunting industry, the pheasant is vanishing from the state, and the loss is both economic and cultural.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/01/us/as-pheasants-disappear-hunters-in-iowa-follow.html', 'snippet': 'Once king of Iowa’s nearly half-a-billion-dollar hunting industry, the pheasant is vanishing from the state, and the loss is both economic and cultural.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ELKHART, Iowa — Mike Wilson glared dejectedly through the mist on his silver-frame glasses at the soggy field of tall, dense brush, tilting the barrel of his 12-gauge shotgun toward the gray clouds.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/01/us/PHEASANT-1/PHEASANT-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 324, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/01/01/us/PHEASANT-1/PHEASANT-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 324}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/01/us/PHEASANT-1/PHEASANT-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 552, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/01/us/PHEASANT-1/PHEASANT-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1104, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/01/us/PHEASANT-1/PHEASANT-1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/01/01/us/PHEASANT-1/PHEASANT-1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight':