 that the drop in class of a stakes-caliber racehorse may have looked suspicious but insisted he sent a sound horse to the track.', 'lead_paragraph': 'After a former stakes-caliber racehorse was euthanized following an injury sustained in a cheap claiming race at Santa Anita Park, his Hall of Fame trainer, Bob Baffert, acknowledged that the precipitous drop in class might have looked suspicious, but insisted that he had sent a sound horse to the racetrack.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/01/sports/01racing-1/01racing-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 657, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/01/sports/01racing-1/01racing-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1314, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/01/sports/01racing-1/01racing-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/01/01/sports/01racing-1/01racing-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/01/sports/01racing-1/01racing-1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Baffert’s Horse Is Euthanized After Claiming Race, but Some Wonder Why It Was Running', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Baffert’s Horse Is Euthanized After Claiming Race, but Some Wonder Why It Was Running', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name'