tps://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/02/realestate/commercial/commercial-real-estate-web-sites-increase-in-popularity.html', 'snippet': 'The marketing teams behind New York office buildings are starting to employ the type of stylish Web sites once used only by developers of luxury condominiums.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In terms of marketing tone, the commercial real estate industry has long played the quiet cousin to the brasher residential business. While apartments are routinely sold using splashy, multifaceted ad campaigns, commercial brokers and developers have favored lower-key, brochure-based approaches. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/02/business/WEBSITES/WEBSITES-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/01/02/business/WEBSITES/WEBSITES-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/02/business/WEBSITES/WEBSITES-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 614, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/02/business/WEBSITES/WEBSITES-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1229, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/02/business/WEBSITES/WEBSITES-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/01/02/business/WEBSITES/WEBSITES-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/02/business/WEBSITES/WEBSITES-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'New York’s Office Builders Raise Their Online Voices', 'kicker': 'Square Feet', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'New York’s Office Builders Raise Their Online Voices', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Real Estate (Commercial)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hughes, C J', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ADVERTISING AND MARKETING', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Computers and the Internet', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Manhattan (NYC)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-01T23:46:43+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Real Estate', 'subsection_name': 'Commercial Real Estate', 'byline': {'original': 'By C. J. Hughes', 'person': [{'firstname': 'C.', 'middlename': 'J.', 'lastname': 'Hughes', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1848e8ae-2168-55d1-bf5c-39ef34681822', 'word_count': 1269, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1848e8ae-2168-55d1-bf5c-39ef34681822'}, {'abstract': 'Editors of Glamour, Allure and other magazines aimed at female audiences say using vulgar words in print does not seem to ruffle feathers.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/02/books/womens-magazine-editors-allow-more-printed-vulgarities.html', 'snippet': 'Editors of Glamour, Allure and other magazines aimed at female audiences say using vulgar words in print does not seem to ruffle feathers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Cindi Leive, editor in chief of Glamour, was searching for the best way to draw readers’ attention to an article in the November 2011 issue about how women could better organize their closets and bank accounts. “12 ways to get your act together” didn’t have much punch. “12 ways to get your stuff together” also fell flat. So she decided to substitute “act” with a word unprintable here and waited for the angry letters to pour in. They never came.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/02/arts/02CURSING/02CURSING-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 749, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/02/arts/02CURSING/02CURSING-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1250, 'width': 1710, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/02/arts/02CURSING/02CURSING-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/01/02/arts/02CURSING/02CURSING-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/02/arts/02CURSING/02CURSING-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '50 Shades of Vulgarity', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '50 Shades of Vulgarity', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Magazines', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Haughney, Christine', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Women and Girls', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'va