ealth is being revealed in large gifts to the New York Public Library and the Central Park Conservancy.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/02/nyregion/after-modest-life-huge-gift-to-library-and-central-park.html', 'snippet': 'Nearly two years after Mary McConnell Bailey’s death, the depth of her wealth is being revealed in large gifts to the New York Public Library and the Central Park Conservancy.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Mary McConnell Bailey died as quietly as she lived. At her request, no services were held. No obituary was written. Even one of her closest friends cannot say for sure where she is buried.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'After Modest Life, Huge Gift to 2 Charities', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'After Modest Life, Huge Gift to 2 Charities', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rivera, Ray', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Philanthropy', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Central Park Conservancy', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Public Library', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Wills and Estates', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-02T03:53:10+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ray Rivera and Al Baker', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ray', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rivera', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Al', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Baker', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/303b8df8-e591-521a-bf68-058b800f4703', 'word_count': 643, 'uri': 'nyt://article/303b8df8-e591-521a-bf68-058b800f4703'}, {'abstract': 'After a long day of talks on Tuesday, the players’ association said it would study the league’s offer, with more negotiations expected on Wednesday.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/02/sports/hockey/nhl-responds-to-unions-proposal.html', 'snippet': 'After a long day of talks on Tuesday, the players’ association said it would study the league’s offer, with more negotiations expected on Wednesday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Instead of spending New Year’s Day at the Winter Classic with more than 100,000 fans at Michigan Stadium, the men who run the N.H.L. and its players union spent the day trying to negotiate a labor deal at the league’s Midtown Manhattan office. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/02/sports/hockey/02bettman/02bettman-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 773, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/02/sports/hockey/02bettman/02bettman-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1546, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/02/sports/hockey/02bettman/02bettman-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/01/02/sports/hockey/02bettman/02bettman-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/02/sports/hockey/02bettman/02bettman-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'N.H.L. Responds to Union’s Pr