earning.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/02/news-quiz-january-2-2013/', 'snippet': 'See what you know about the news of the day.', 'lead_paragraph': 'See what you know about the news below. To prepare, you might scan the articles or summaries on today’s paper. Good luck!', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'News Quiz | January 2, 2013', 'kicker': 'The Learning Network', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-01-02T06:30:06+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Education', 'byline': {'original': 'By Anastasia Economides', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Anastasia', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Economides', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3bc8fd28-4037-5892-92cb-88391ac1a34e', 'word_count': 22, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3bc8fd28-4037-5892-92cb-88391ac1a34e'}, {'abstract': 'Congress passes fiscal deal; Latvia as case study in austerity; tragedy in Abidjan; Paul Klee in Rome.', 'web_url': 'https://rendezvous.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/02/iht-quick-read-jan-2/', 'snippet': 'Congress passes fiscal deal; Latvia as case study in austerity; tragedy in Abidjan; Paul Klee in Rome.', 'lead_paragraph': 'NEWS Ending a climactic showdown in the final hours of the 112th Congress, the House sent to President Obama legislation to avert big income tax increases on most Americans. Jennifer Steinhauer reports from Washington.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/02/world/JP-LATVIA-2/JP-LATVIA-2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 396, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/01/02/world/JP-LATVIA-2/JP-LATVIA-2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight'