y-is-hard-to-come-by/', 'snippet': 'Lack of open spaces leave residents with few options.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On Marine Drive, a popular seafront area in Mumbai, you will invariably find a few couples cuddling on the wall facing the sea, seemingly oblivious to the blazing afternoon sun and the endless stream of cars just behind them. In this city of cramped homes and crowded public spaces, these couples will take whatever time alone that they can get, even if it’s in full view of others.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'In Mumbai, Privacy Is Hard to Come By', 'kicker': 'India Ink', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fear (Emotion)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Privacy', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sexual Harassment', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Women and Girls', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Aisha', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Bayerische Motorenwerke AG', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Mumbai (India)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-02T08:33:31+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Neha Thirani', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Neha', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Thirani', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/17eae25c-a017-5916-bc6c-d6f466b93f18', 'word_count': 976, 'uri': 'nyt://article/17eae25c-a017-5916-bc6c-d6f466b93f18'}, {'abstract': 'Can you calculate the difference in per-pupil spending between the New Hampshire school district that spends the least and the state average?', 'web_url': 'https://learning.blogs.nytimes.com/