 her poetic way with mediums like drawing, photography, video, film and sound art.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/03/arts/design/trisha-donnelly-in-momas-artists-choice-series.html', 'snippet': 'The Artist’s Choice torch at the Museum of Modern Art has been passed to Trisha Donnelly, a Conceptual and performance artist known for her poetic way with mediums like drawing, photography, video, film and sound art.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Museum of Modern Art’s Artist’s Choice exhibitions rarely disappoint. There have been nine such shows since the series was initiated in 1989, each with its own flashes of imagination, excavations of neglected artworks and subversions of the curatorial status quo.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/03/arts/03TRISHA1/03TRISHA1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 875, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/03/arts/03TRISHA1/03TRISHA1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1749, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/03/arts/03TRISHA1/03TRISHA1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/01/03/arts/03TRISHA1/03TRISHA1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/03/arts/03TRISHA1/03TRISHA1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Ambushed by Sundry Treasures', 'kicker': 'Art Review', 'conte