ow you know — but how do I ask others the question I just answered?', 'web_url': 'https://parenting.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/02/talking-to-other-parents-about-guns/', 'snippet': 'There are no guns in this house. There, I said it, and now you know — but how do I ask others the question I just answered?', 'lead_paragraph': 'There are no guns in this house. There, I said it, and now you know: while I’m positive there are other dangers lurking around my disorganized household, you can send over your kids to play and know they will not find a gun, locked away or otherwise, anywhere. Not here.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Talking to Other Parents About Guns', 'kicker': 'Motherlode', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Children and Childhood', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Gun Control', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Newtown, Conn, Shooting (2012)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Parenting', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'School Shootings', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-02T17:18:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Holly Korbey', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Holly', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Korbey', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/00b45ee6-3af2-5c56-af1d-14c0cd34bd05', 'word_count': 1152, 'uri': 'nyt://article/00b45ee6-3af2-5c56-af1d-14c0cd34bd05'}, {'abstract': 'The following YouTube clip shows the aftermath of an airstrike at a Syrian gas station on Jan. 2.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/world/middleeast/100000001983538/airstrike-at-a-syrian-gas-station-.html', 'snippet': 'The following YouTube clip shows