 Plains, which drew anger after naming handgun permit holders in two New York counties, received a large amount of negative correspondence, a police report said.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/03/nyregion/putnam-officials-keep-gun-permit-records-from-journal-news.html', 'snippet': 'The Journal News in White Plains, which drew anger after naming handgun permit holders in two New York counties, received a large amount of negative correspondence, a police report said.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A newspaper based in White Plains that drew nationwide anger after publishing the names and addresses of handgun permit holders last month is being guarded by armed security personnel at two of its offices, the publisher said Wednesday.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Newspaper That Put Gun Permit Map Online Hires Armed Guards', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Newspaper That Put Gun Permit Map Online Hires Armed Guards', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Gun Control', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Journal News, The', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'White Plains (NY)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Putnam County (NY)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ball, Greg', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hasson, Janet', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sant, Dennis J', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Newtown, Conn, Shooting (2012)', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Names, Geographical', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Maps', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Firearms', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Westchester County (NY)', 'rank': 13, 'major':