835, 'uri': 'nyt://article/816375d3-0ba0-586c-b67e-87620217fc34'}, {'abstract': 'Three memorable television characters who dressed for success (and sometimes to excess).', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/03/fashion/to-thine-own-character-be-true-before-girls-there-were-mary-ally-and-carrie.html', 'snippet': 'Three memorable television characters who dressed for success (and sometimes to excess).', 'lead_paragraph': 'THE women of “Girls” are hardly the first ones for whom the outfits they wear are an essential part of their characters’ makeup. Here are three memorable characters from past television shows in which clothes very much helped to make the woman.\xa0', 'print_section': 'E', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/03/fashion/03GSIDE_SPAN/03GSIDE_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/01/03/fashion/03GSIDE_SPAN/03GSIDE_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/03/fashion/03GSIDE_SPAN/03GSIDE_SPAN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/03/fashion/03GSIDE_SPAN/03GSIDE_SPAN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/03/fashion/03GSIDE_SPAN/03GSIDE_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/01/03/fashion/03GSIDE_SPAN/03GSIDE_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thum