1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Al Jazeera Seeks a U.S. Voice Where Gore Failed', 'kicker': 'Media Decoder', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Al Jazeera Seeks a U.S. Voice Where Gore Failed', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'News and News Media', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gore, Al', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'AL JAZEERA', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Current TV', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-02T21:42:30+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By Brian Stelter', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Brian', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Stelter', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/74968460-c711-5fd6-a01d-e8482fac1cf1', 'word_count': 974, 'uri': 'nyt://article/74968460-c711-5fd6-a01d-e8482fac1cf1'}, {'abstract': 'The act of replacing the pages in a coveted day planner is more than a practical task; it’s a ritual.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/03/fashion/a-yearly-date-with-the-planner.html', 'snippet': 'The act of replacing the pages in a coveted day planner is more than a practical task; it’s a ritual.', 'lead_paragraph': 'THE night before the world was supposed to implode as foretold by a creative interpretation of the Mayan calendar, I replaced my own calendar. I do this every year. I’m not talking about the three seconds it takes to tear the plastic from a mollusk-of-the-month calendar and nail it to the wall. I wouldn’t bore you with that story. Open, bang-bang, throw-out 2012. End of article. What I do requires extended physical and mental fortitude. I shut myself in a room for an hour, turn on the Fleetwood Mac, release the springs of my day planner, and hope for the best.', 'print_section': 'E', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/03/fashion/03SUBFIRST1_SPAN/03zSUBFIRST1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 384, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/01/03/fashion/03SUBFIRST1_SPAN/03zSUBFIRST1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 384}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/03/fashion/03SUBFIRST1_SPAN/03zSUBFIRST1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 701, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/03/fashion/03SUBFIRST1_SPAN/03zSUBFIRST1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1403, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/03/fashion/03SUBFIRST1_SPAN/03zSUBFIRST1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/01/03/fashion/03SUBFIRST1_SPAN/03zSUBFIRST1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/03/fashion/03SUBFIRST1_SPAN/03zSUBFIRST1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Yearly Date With Fleetwood Mac and the Planner', 'kicker': 'First Person', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Yearly Date With Fleetwood Mac and the Planner', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': 