216-53ef-5184-a50f-39fa25503920', 'word_count': 520, 'uri': 'nyt://article/75ee6216-53ef-5184-a50f-39fa25503920'}, {'abstract': 'The dominant social network has updated its smartphone interfaces to bring them more into line with the features available to desktop browsers, assuming you know where to look.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/03/technology/personaltech/facebooks-latest-mobile-interface-expands-features.html', 'snippet': 'The dominant social network has updated its smartphone interfaces to bring them more into line with the features available to desktop browsers, assuming you know where to look.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The only thing constant about Facebook is that it keeps changing. Just when you think you’ve figured out the interface to the world’s biggest social network, the engineers there update it again.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/03/business/TOOLKIT1/TOOLKIT1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 755, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/03/business/TOOLKIT1/TOOLKIT1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1510, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/03/business/TOOLKIT1/TOOLKIT1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/01/03/business/TOOLKIT1/TOOLKIT1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/03/business/TOOLKIT1/TOOLKIT1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thum