ry (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/072a026c-d541-5e8a-8099-19f2733cbc9b', 'word_count': 566, 'uri': 'nyt://article/072a026c-d541-5e8a-8099-19f2733cbc9b'}, {'abstract': 'As civilian deaths drop, firefighters continue to be killed or wounded inside burning buildings where no civilians are killed.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/03/nyregion/58-fire-deaths-in-new-york-city-in-2012-record-low.html', 'snippet': 'As civilian deaths drop, firefighters continue to be killed or wounded inside burning buildings where no civilians are killed.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There were 58 fire deaths in New York City in 2012, a record low that city officials attributed to faster response times, more intensive firefighter training, and extensive public contacts that included teaching schoolchildren what to do in a fire and distributing smoke detectors: more than 22,000 were handed out in 2012. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '21', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'City’s 58 Fire Deaths in ’12 Are Lowest on Record', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'New York’s 58 Fire Deaths in 2012 Are Lowest on Record; Many Victims Were 70 or Older', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fires and Firefighters', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Fatalities)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Fire Department (NYC)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-03T03:07:16+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Joseph Goldstein', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Joseph', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Goldstein', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c9a383fe-809f-5075-91f3-aaa749f71a7e', 'word_count': 438, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c9a383fe-809f-5075-91f3-aaa749f71a7e'}, {'abstract': 'Amar’e Stoudemire, at Knicks practice on Wednesday, took a swipe at his former coach, Mike D’Antoni, saying that he had never been properly taught how to play defense.', 'web_url': 'https://offthedribble.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/02/stoudemire-takes-a-shot-at-dantoni/', 'snippet': 'Amar’e Stoudemire, at Knicks practice on Wednesday, took a swipe at his former coach, Mike D’Antoni, saying that he had never been properly taught how to play defense.', 'lead_paragraph': 'GREENBURGH, N.Y. — For much of Amar’e Stoudemire’s N.B.A. career, his coach was Mike D’Antoni, and he generally thrived in D’Antoni’s offensive-oriented system. Stoudemire was also viewed as a D’Antoni ally during his ill-fated tenure in New York.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Stoudemire Takes a Shot at D’Antoni', 'kicker': 'Off the Dribble', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Stoudemire Takes Shot at D’Antoni', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Basketball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Coaches and Managers', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': "D'Antoni, Mike", 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': "Stoudemire, Amar'e", 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Knicks', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-03T03:23:25+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Basketball', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/bee16f72-f9f2-534d-a16a-51a81b4540d0', 'word_count': 184, 'uri': 'nyt://article/bee16f72-f9f2-534d-a16a-51a81b4540d0'}, {'abstract': 'Lawyers for three men whose murder conviction of a livery-cab driver was reversed in October are asking a judge to set aside a second murder conviction or grant them a new trial.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/03/nyregion/three-still-jailed-for-95-killing-seek-a-second-reversal.html', 'snippet': 'Lawyers for three men whose murder conviction of a livery-cab driver was reversed in October are asking a judge to set aside a second murder conviction or grant them a new trial.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For three imprisoned men, having a murder conviction reversed recently was something of a limited victory. Two others cleared in the case were freed from prison in October, after two former members of a street gang claimed responsibility for the crime, the killing of a livery-cab driver in 1995.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '21', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/03/nyregion/OVERTURN/OVERTURN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/03/nyregion/OVERTURN/OVERTURN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Cleared in One ’95 Killing, 3 Seek Reversal in Another', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Cleared in One ’95 Killing, 3 Seek Reversal in Another', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cosme, Michael', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Glisson, Eric', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Vega, Gilbert', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rodriguez, Jose', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Murders and Attempted Murders', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 