mes.com/2013/01/03/pageoneplus/quotation-of-the-day-for-thursday-jan-3-2013.html', 'snippet': 'Quotation of the day for Thursday, Jan. 3, 2013.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It’s gotten to the point, unfortunately, where something as significant as a funeral is subject to gang violence, and I can’t even believe that we’re having this conversation.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Quotation of the Day for Thursday, Jan. 3, 2013', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Quotation of the Day', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-01-03T04:09:42+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Summary', 'section_name': 'Corrections', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Quote', '_id': 'nyt://article/76e5417a-e917-5299-a2d7-49968b7bacef', 'word_count': 41, 'uri': 'nyt://article/76e5417a-e917-5299-a2d7-49968b7bacef'}, {'abstract': 'Ms. Cooper, who is credited with turning around the dilapidated Flushing Meadows-Corona Park, stepped down last year amid charges that she stole over $50,000 from a nonprofit group.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/03/nyregion/estelle-cooper-former-park-administrator-accused-of-theft-dies-at-82.html', 'snippet': 'Ms. Cooper, who is credited with turning around the dilapidated Flushing Meadows-Corona Park, stepped down last year amid charges that she stole over $50,000 from a nonprofit group.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Estelle Cooper, the former top administrator of Flushing Meadows-Corona Park in Queens who retired last January amid accusations that she had stolen more than $50,000 meant for the park from a nonprofit group she founded, died on Saturday in Stony Brook, N.Y. She was 82.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Estelle Cooper, Queens Park Chief Accused of Theft, Dies at 82', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Estelle Cooper, Queens Park Chief Accused of Theft, Dies at 82', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cooper, Estelle', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Flushing Meadows-Corona Park (Queens, NY)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Obituaries)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-03T04:44:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sarah Maslin Nir', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sarah', 'middlename': 'Maslin', 'lastname': 'Nir', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Obituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/c8d389b0-7bcc-5f36-b8a1-fbb1c2ff3efb', 'word_count': 293, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c8d389b0-7bcc-5f36-b8a1-fbb1c2ff3efb'}, {'abstract': 'As killings rise on the streets of Chicago, the homicides, most of which the authorities described as gang violence, have not been spread evenly across the city.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/03/us/a-soaring-homicide-rate-a-divide-in-chicago.html', 'snippet': 'As killings rise on the streets of Chicago, the homicides, most of which the authorities described as gang violence, have not been spread evenly across the city.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CHICAGO — This city’s 471st homicide of 2012 happened in the middle of the day, in the middle of a crowd, on the steps of the church where the victim of homicide 463 was being eulogized. Sherman Miller, who was 21, collapsed amid gunfire not far from the idling hearse that was there to carry away James Holman, 32, shot to death a week earlier.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/03/us/Chicago/Chicago-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 392, '