est private bank, Wegelin & Company, admitted to helping Americans to evade United States taxes, the first time a foreign financial institution has pleaded guilty to tax-law violations.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2013/01/03/swiss-bank-pleads-guilty-to-tax-law-violations/', 'snippet': 'In Federal District Court in Manhattan, Switzerland’s oldest private bank, Wegelin & Company, admitted to helping Americans to evade United States taxes, the first time a foreign financial institution has pleaded guilty to tax-law violations.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Switzerland’s oldest private bank on Thursday admitted to helping Americans evade United States taxes, the first time a foreign financial institution has pleaded guilty to tax law violations.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Swiss Bank Pleads Guilty to Tax Law Violations', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Swiss Bank Pleads Guilty to Helping American Tax Dodgers', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Banking and Financial Institutions', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Federal Taxes (US)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fines (Penalties)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tax Evasion', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Taxation', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Internal Revenue Service', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Justice Department', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Treasury Department', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'UBS AG', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Manhattan (NYC)', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Switzerland', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-03T18:34:47+0000