ct': 'New investors may be hard pressed to duplicate the success that the Blackstone Group has had with the operator of theme parks.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2013/01/03/can-seaworld-make-a-splash-in-its-i-p-o/', 'snippet': 'New investors may be hard pressed to duplicate the success that the Blackstone Group has had with the operator of theme parks.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SeaWorld’s next investment splash might be smaller than its last. The Blackstone Group is ready to take public the amusement parks operator it bought in 2009 from Anheuser-Busch InBev. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Weighing the Outcome of SeaWorld’s I.P.O.', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'AMUSEMENT AND THEME PARKS', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Initial Public Offerings', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Anheuser-Busch InBev NV', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'SeaWorld Adventure Parks', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Six Flags Great Adventure', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'The Blackstone Group', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-03T20:11:30+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Antony Currie', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Antony', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Currie', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/71c14755-7c7b-5a57-846a-65a3df2a4a15', 'word_count': 352, 'uri': 'nyt://article/71c14755-7c7b-5a57-846a-65a3df2a4a15'}, {'abstract': 'At Murray’s Cheese Bar, the star attraction comes in the perennial dichotomy of raw and cooked: curated cheese plates versus permutat