 'nyt://article/2e47f10c-574f-54e4-b5c4-42f822e4177e'}, {'abstract': 'Charlie’s Calypso City is a place beyond commerce — a necessary destination for visiting musicians, where there are chairs waiting for regulars and arguments to be joined, especially on Friday nights.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/06/nyregion/charlies-calypso-city-the-caribbean-cheers-of-brooklyn.html', 'snippet': 'Charlie’s Calypso City is a place beyond commerce — a necessary destination for visiting musicians, where there are chairs waiting for regulars and arguments to be joined, especially on Friday nights.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SINCE Rawlston Charles opened Charlie’s Calypso City, on Fulton Street in Bedford-Stuyvesant, in July 1972, the store has been a hub for Brooklyn’s Caribbean community, reinventing itself for each era. ', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/06/nyregion/06JOINT2/06JOINT2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/01/06/nyregion/06JOINT2/06JOINT2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/06/nyregion/06JOINT2/06JOINT2-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/06/nyregion/06JOINT2/06JOINT2-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/06/nyregion/06JOINT2/06JOINT2-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_nam