article/4d2d186e-0085-5a15-bb16-4725c4f93d8a'}, {'abstract': 'The Securities and Exchange Commission has decided not to file insider trading charges against David L. Sokol, a onetime top lieutenant at Berkshire Hathaway and aide to Warren E. Buffett, according to Mr. Sokol’s lawyer, Barry Wm. Levine.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2013/01/03/s-e-c-ends-scrutiny-of-former-top-aide-to-buffett/', 'snippet': 'The Securities and Exchange Commission has decided not to file insider trading charges against David L. Sokol, a onetime top lieutenant at Berkshire Hathaway and aide to Warren E. Buffett, according to Mr. Sokol’s lawyer, Barry Wm. Levine.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Securities and Exchange Commission has decided not to file insider trading charges against David L. Sokol, a onetime top lieutenant at Berkshire Hathaway, Mr. Sokol’s lawyer said Thursday.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'S.E.C. Ends Scrutiny of Former Top Aide to Buffett', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'S.E.C. Ends Scrutiny Of Ex-Aide To Buffett', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mergers, Acquisitions and Divestitures', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Buffett, Warren E', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sokol, David L', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Berkshire Hathaway Inc', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-04T02:13:05+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ben Protess', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ben', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Protess', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/cd871bb8-528d-57e2-9dbb-b57108347f36', 'word_count': 692, 'uri': 'nyt://article/cd871bb8-528d-57e2-9dbb-b57108347f36'}, {'abstract': 'Although no one rose up to challenge him, 12 Republicans rejected Speaker John A. Boehner’s leadership, a warning of further challenges ahead.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/04/us/politics/boehner-liked-but-not-feared-keeps-a-job.html', 'snippet': 'Although no one rose up to challenge him, 12 Republicans rejected Speaker John A. Boehner’s leadership, a warning of further challenges ahead.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — “Public service was never meant to be an easy living,” Representative John A. Boehner lamented Thursday, moments after he overcame a Republican insurrection to win re-election as speaker of the House. For Mr. Boehner, it may only get tougher from here.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/04/us/BOEHNER/BOEHNER-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/01/04/us/BOEHNER/BOEHNER-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/04/us/BOEHNER/BOEHNER-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 667, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/04/us/BOEHNER/BOEHNER-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1333, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/04/us/BOEHNER/BOEHNER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/01/04/us/BOEHNER/BOEHNER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwid