iosk as part of Smorgasburg at Whole Foods Market Bowery, 95 East Houston Street, a collaboration between the store and the Brooklyn Flea. Hugh Mangum, the pit master, will be making pulled pork shoulder, smoked turkey breast and sides of edamame and sweet pea salad. Situated on the second floor, it will be open for lunch and dinner through Jan. 30.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Weekend Fare', 'kicker': 'Diner&#039;s Journal', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-01-04T17:28:45+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bao Ong', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bao', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ong', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/62c94ccb-b924-5e52-aad6-51ee99df9449', 'word_count': 276, 'uri': 'nyt://article/62c94ccb-b924-5e52-aad6-51ee99df9449'}, {'abstract': 'For the first time in more than six years, the unemployment rate for adult women exceeds that for men.', 'web_url': 'https://economix.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/04/womens-unemployment-surpasses-mens/', 'snippet': 'For the first time in more than six years, the unemployment rate for adult women exceeds that for men.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For the first time in more than six years, the unemployment rate for adult women (those over age 20), seasonally adjusted, has surpassed that for adult men. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Women’s Unemployment Surpasses Men’s', 'kicker': 'Economix', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Labor and Jobs', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Men and Boys', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Unempl