axes (US)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Law and Legislation', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Wills and Estates', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-04T18:20:21+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Your Money', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bucks Editors', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bucks', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Editors', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/687a256e-52bf-537f-b005-2e3958d514ca', 'word_count': 149, 'uri': 'nyt://article/687a256e-52bf-537f-b005-2e3958d514ca'}, {'abstract': 'President Obama said he would not get into another fight over the debt ceiling.', 'web_url': 'https://takingnote.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/04/passive-resistance/', 'snippet': 'President Obama said he would not get into another fight over the debt ceiling.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Following the fiscal cliff deal, President Obama declared that he would not get into another fight over the debt ceiling.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Passive Resistance', 'kicker': 'Taking Note', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'National Debt (US)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McConnell, Mitch', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-04T18:28:54+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andrew Rosenthal', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andrew', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rosenthal', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/30856255-b9a9-59a1-807e-0e217f2ec7a2', 'word_count': 438, 'uri': 'nyt://article/30856255-b9a9-59a1-807e-0e217f2ec7a2'}, {'abstract': 'The Transportation Security Administration is letting some travelers keep their shoes on, why you shrink as you age, more guns were confiscated at airports last year and other consumer-focused news from The New York Times.', 'web_url': 'https://bucks.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/04/friday-reading-some-travelers-can-keep-their-shoes-on/', 'snippet': 'The Transportation Security Administration is letting some travelers keep their shoes on, why you shrink as you age, more guns were confiscated at airports last year and other consumer-focused news from The New York Times.', 'lead_paragraph': '', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Friday Reading: Some Travelers Can Keep Their Shoes On', 'kicker': 'Bucks', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-01-04T18:33:30+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Your Money', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ann Carrns', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ann', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Carrns', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1d5b6a7f-2399-5872-a454-a29ea740c2b5', 'word_count': 65, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1d5b6a7f-2399-5872-a454-a29ea740c2b5'}, {'abstract': '“Blood Lad,” by Yuuki Kodama, is at No. 2 on the manga list.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/04/graphic-books-best-sellers-a-curious-vampire/', 'snippet': '“Blood Lad,” by Yuuki Kodama, is at No. 2 on the manga list.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It’s a sleepy start to the new year, with only one newcomer among graphic books best-sellers this week. That honor goes to Volume 1 of “Blood Lad,” by Yuuki Kodama (Yen Press), which is at No. 2 on the manga list. The series is about Staz, a vampire whose tough exterior hides a love for and curiosity about human culture, especially all things Japanese. When he meets a Japanese girl, he thinks he’s finally found someone he can ask questions, but her life is tragically cut short. His new mission becomes restoring her ghostly form to human life. The first volume was released in December. Volume 2 follows in March and Volume 3 in May.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/04/books/04bloodlad/04bloodlad-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 391, 'width': 260, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/04/books/04bloodlad/04bloodlad-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 391, 'width': 260, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/04/books/04bloodlad/04bloodlad-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/01/04/books/04bloodlad/04bloodlad-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/04/books/04bloodlad/04bloodlad-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 92, 'width': 92, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Graphic Books Best Sellers: A Curious Vampire', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Books and Literature', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Graphic Novels', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Adair, Torsten', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-04T18:35:12+0000', 'doc