n-commack-li-sensible-even-on-scarlett-drive-and-rhett-court.html', 'snippet': 'Shopping and affordable real estate are in abundant supply in Commack, a Suffolk County community not far from the North Shore beaches.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WHEN Maria Diomataris and her husband, Tony, moved to Commack seven years ago from Old Bethpage, they were looking for good schools and a larger property. “The prices were ridiculous in our area,” Ms. Diomataris said. They bought a two-story contemporary on half an acre for about $625,000, she said. ', 'print_section': 'RE', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/06/realestate/06LIVINGCOMM_SPAN/06LIVINGCOMM_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/01/06/realestate/06LIVINGCOMM_SPAN/06LIVINGCOMM_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/06/realestate/06LIVINGCOMM_SPAN/20130106-LIVING-slide-Y5FI-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 750, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/06/realestate/06LIVINGCOMM_SPAN/20130106-LIVING-slide-Y5FI-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1501, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/06/realestate/06LIVINGCOMM_SPAN/06LIVINGCOMM_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/01/06/realestate/06LIVINGCOMM_SPAN/06LIVINGCOMM_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'r