t://article/62babe51-ec1e-50e9-8e37-14c6250a3b28'}, {'abstract': 'The day when vehicle owners never have to pump air into their tires may be coming. Several companies are developing tires that drivers will no longer have to fuss with.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/06/automobiles/removing-the-need-to-refill-tires.html', 'snippet': 'The day when vehicle owners never have to pump air into their tires may be coming. Several companies are developing tires that drivers will no longer have to fuss with.', 'lead_paragraph': 'THE steady flow of reminders to keep tires at the automaker’s suggested inflation levels — even President Obama chimed in — demonstrates just how far the demands of auto maintenance have diminished. With spark plugs that seem to last forever and oil-change intervals stretching to 10,000 miles and more, many owners continue to slack off when it comes to looking after tire pressures. ', 'print_section': 'AU', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/06/automobiles/06AIR1/06AIR1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 222, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/01/06/automobiles/06AIR1/06AIR1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 222}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/06/automobiles/06AIR1/06AIR1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 379, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/06/automobiles/06AIR1/06AIR1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 758, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/06/automobiles/06AIR1/06AIR1