 procedures.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/05/business/us-settles-accusations-that-doctors-overtreated.html', 'snippet': 'A hospital in Ohio agreed to pay $3.9 million over allegations that doctors billed Medicare for unneeded heart procedures.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A group of doctors who performed unusually high rates of heart procedures on patients at a community hospital in Ohio settled with the Justice Department over accusations that some of the procedures were medically unnecessary, federal regulators announced on Friday. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'U.S. Settles Accusations That Doctors Overtreated', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'U.S. Settles Accusations That Doctors Overtreated', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'EMH Regional Medical Center', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Abelson, Reed', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'North Ohio Heart Center', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Stents (Medical Devices)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hospitals', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Medicare', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Health Insurance and Managed Care', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Heart', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Justice Department', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Elyria (Ohio)', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-05T00:45:22+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Reed Abelson', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Reed', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Abelson', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'o