the culinary touch of chef Bobby Flay.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/06/nyregion/a-review-of-bar-americain-at-mohegan-sun-in-uncasville.html', 'snippet': 'Bar Americain, inside the Mohegan Sun Casino, offers a variety of American foods with the culinary touch of chef Bobby Flay.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I’ve never liked dining in a casino setting. Parking nightmares, disorienting treks through cacophonous gambling halls — and all too often, when you arrive, prices to make the low-roller quake. Bobby Flay’s Bar Americain, at Mohegan Sun, isn’t cheap. Eating thriftily will challenge the craftiest diner.', 'print_section': 'CT', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/06/nyregion/06DINECT1/06DINECT1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/01/06/nyregion/06DINECT1/06DINECT1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/06/nyregion/06DINECT1/06DINECT1-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/06/nyregion/06DINECT1/06DINECT1-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/06/nyregion/06DINECT1/06DINECT1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/01/06/nyregion/06DINECT1/06DINECT1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge'