ally incriminating communications that he said have nothing to do with the charges against the defendant.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/05/nyregion/lawyers-fight-admissibility-of-messages-in-liu-fund-raising-case.html', 'snippet': 'As the case into John C. Liu’s fundraising continues, a defense lawyer wants to block potentially incriminating communications that he said have nothing to do with the charges against the defendant.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On July 10, 2011, Jia Hou, the treasurer for the presumptive mayoral campaign of John C. Liu, the city comptroller, warned a colleague that auditors would closely scrutinize donor forms.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Messages Are in Dispute in Liu Fundraising Case', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Messages Are in Dispute In Liu Fund-Raising Case', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Office of the Comptroller (NYC)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Chen, David W', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Liu, John C', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hou, Jia', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Pan, Xing Wu', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Campaign Finance', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Frauds and Swindling', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elections, Comptrollers', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-05T01:49:20+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Benjamin Weiser and David W. Chen', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Benjamin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Weiser', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organizatio