 'nyt://article/b55f137f-8ea4-5cc8-819e-b6c71e252544'}, {'abstract': 'An important part of the military budget bill will provide female service members with insurance coverage for abortions in cases of rape and incest.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/05/opinion/a-barrier-drops-for-military-women.html', 'snippet': 'An important part of the military budget bill will provide female service members with insurance coverage for abortions in cases of rape and incest.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A small but important provision of the military budget bill just signed by President Obama ends a longstanding act of discrimination against women who serve in America’s military.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Barrier Drops for Military Women', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Barrier Drops for Military Women', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ABORTION', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sex Crimes', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Incest', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Law and Legislation', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Health Insurance and Managed Care', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Discrimination', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gillibrand, Kirsten E', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Slaughter, Louise M', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Shaheen, Jeanne', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-05T02:32:57+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/c0ff8b5e-7d09-54ac-aa0d-661c4be2dc5f', 'word_count': 303, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c0ff8b5e-7d09-54ac-aa0d-661c4be2dc5f'}, {'abstract': 'Lance Armstrong, now barred from competing in all Olympic sports, reportedly has told associates that he may admit he used performance-enhancing drugs during his cycling career.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/05/sports/cycling/lance-armstrong-said-to-weigh-admission-of-doping.html', 'snippet': 'Lance Armstrong, now barred from competing in all Olympic sports, reportedly has told associates that he may admit he used performance-enhancing drugs during his cycling career.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Lance Armstrong, who this fall was stripped of his seven Tour de France titles for doping and barred for life from competing in all Olympic sports, has told associates and antidoping officials that he is considering publicly admitting that he used banned performance-enhancing drugs and blood transfusions during his cycling career, according to several people with direct knowledge of the situation. He would do this, the people said, because he wants to persuade antidoping officials to restore his eligibility so he can resume his athletic career.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/05/sports/05armstrong3_337/05armstrong3_337-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 395, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/01/05/sports/05armstrong3_337/05armstrong3_337-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 395}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/05/sports/05armstrong3_337/05armstrong3_337-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'he