ber of murders, residents in certain areas of the city say they do not feel any safer.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/06/nyregion/violent-crime-fell-tell-it-to-east-harlem.html', 'snippet': 'Though New York City announced a record low number of murders, residents in certain areas of the city say they do not feel any safer.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The passing of the previous year was greeted, in recent days, by the announcements that New York City had broken various records in 2012, achieving the lowest annual number of murders — just over 414 — since the city started keeping a comparable count in 1963, and receiving more tourists — 52 million — than ever in its history. Though the city witnessed an increase in crime over all, a rise of 3.3 percent over the past 12 months, this was attributed by the mayor’s office to the enduring appeal of Apple products among thieves in thrall to consumer voyeurism. If only the iPhone could tamp down its hotness; if only it would stop going out and getting drunk in short skirts and heels.', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/06/nyregion/06BIGCITY1_SPAN/06BIGCITY1_SPAN-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 377, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/01/06/nyregion/06BIGCITY1_SPAN/06BIGCITY1_SPAN-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 377}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/06/nyregion/06BIGCITY1_SPAN/06BIGCITY1_SPAN-jumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 643, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/06/nyregion/06BIGCITY1_SPAN/06BIGCITY1_SPAN-superJumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 1286, 'width': 2048, 'subTy