, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/06/world/06missoniweb1/06missoniweb1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Fashion Boss From Italy Lost in Flight Off Venezuela', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Fashion Boss From Italy Lost in Flight Off Venezuela', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Aviation Accidents and Safety', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Wilson, Eric', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Venezuela', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Missoni', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-05T11:55:11+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Eric Wilson', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Eric', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Wilson', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/47ad3914-16c7-5588-85f8-9e34923c6e0a', 'word_count': 636, 'uri': 'nyt://article/47ad3914-16c7-5588-85f8-9e34923c6e0a'}, {'abstract': 'The Giants’ quarterback, general manager and coach pointed to the impact of receiver Hakeem Nicks’s injuries in a disappointing 2012 season.', 'web_url': 'https://fifthdown.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/05/hakeem-nicks-and-giants-lament/', 'snippet': 'The Giants’ quarterback, general manager and coach pointed to the impact of receiver Hakeem Nicks’s injuries in a disappointing 2012 season.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Coach Tom Coughlin said this week that it was an indescribable feeling not to be in the playoffs. The Giants outscored their opponents by a healthy number, 429-344. (It’s easy to overlook this statistic from their 2011 Super Bowl season, but the Giants were outscored in the regular season, 400-394.)', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Hakeem Nicks and Giants’ Lament', 'kicker': 'The Fifth Down', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Nicks, Hakeem', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Giants', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-05T12:21:47+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Football', 'byline': {'original': 'By Toni Monkovic', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Toni', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Monkovic', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/35a7ccaf-4048-56f3-95eb-c405d22aacfd', 'word_count': 465, 'uri': 'nyt://article/35a7ccaf-4048-56f3-95eb-c405d22aacfd'}, {'abstract': 'First Gérard Depardieu. Now Brigitte Bardot. France’s most famous movie icon is threatening to flee to Russia. But this time it’s not about taxes — it’s about elephants.', 'web_url': 'https://rendezvous.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/05/french-screen-diva-threatens-to-join-russia-exodus/', 'snippet': 'First Gérard Depardieu. Now Brigitte Bardot. France’s most famous movie icon is threatening to flee to Russia. But this time it’s not about taxes — it’s about elephants.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — Brigitte Bardot, the fifties-to-sixties movie icon, is the latest celebrity to announce plans to flee to Russia to escape her native France.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/05/blogs/05rdv-bardot/05rdv-bardot-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 729, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_na