ing back Arian Foster and a defense that didn’t allow a touchdown, Houston beat Cincinnati in an A.F.C. wild-card game to earn a meeting with the Patriots.', 'lead_paragraph': 'HOUSTON — All week, the Houston Texans spoke of momentum as if it were an easily obtained commodity. Arian Foster suggested that the idea of momentum might not even exist, saying each game had its own identity. Perhaps that was the attitude the Texans needed to shake off a late-season slide that cost them a chance at home-field advantage and an opening round bye in the playoffs.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/06/sports/JPAFC/JPAFC-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 370, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/01/06/sports/JPAFC/JPAFC-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 370}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/06/sports/JPAFC/JPAFC-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 708, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/06/sports/JPAFC/JPAFC-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1416, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/06/sports/JPAFC/JPAFC-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/01/06/sports/JPAFC/JPAFC-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/06/sports/JPAFC/JPAFC-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'widt