0 points — 16 in the fourth quarter — to help the Knicks improve to 23-10.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/06/sports/basketball/anthonys-40-points-send-knicks-past-magic.html', 'snippet': 'Carmelo Anthony accepted Arron Afflalo’s challenge in the final minutes and poured in 40 points — 16 in the fourth quarter — to help the Knicks improve to 23-10.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ORLANDO — The one-on-one shootout inside Amway Center on Saturday night featured a strange pairing. In the fourth quarter, Carmelo Anthony, the league’s second-leading scorer, was being challenged by a career-long role player, a former teammate and a friend, the Orlando Magic’s Arron Afflalo.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/06/sports/y-nba/y-nba-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 370, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/01/06/sports/y-nba/y-nba-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 370}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/06/sports/y-nba/y-nba-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 679, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/06/sports/y-nba/y-nba-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1359, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/06/sports/y-nba/y-nba-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/01/06/sports/y-nba/y-nba-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': 