 {'abstract': 'The extension will keep Universal’s films off Netflix through 2022 and gives HBO the rights to about half of Hollywood’s big releases until then.', 'web_url': 'https://mediadecoder.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/06/universal-pictures-renews-deal-with-hbo/', 'snippet': 'The extension will keep Universal’s films off Netflix through 2022 and gives HBO the rights to about half of Hollywood’s big releases until then.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Universal Pictures on Sunday announced a lucrative renewed pact with HBO that will keep the studio’s films on the cable system — and off Netflix — into the next decade.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Universal Pictures Renews Deal With HBO', 'kicker': 'Media Decoder', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Universal Renews Deal With HBO', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Home Box Office', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Netflix Inc', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Universal Pictures', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-07T01:14:45+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By Brian Stelter', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Brian', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Stelter', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/49c4feca-804e-5041-83a5-58d0e9b246b3', 'word_count': 329, 'uri': 'nyt://article/49c4feca-804e-5041-83a5-58d0e9b246b3'}, {'abstract': 'The Kulluk, a drilling rig owned by Shell Oil, was grounded along Sitkalidak Island, about 300 miles south of Anchorage.', 'web_url': 'ht