ountry Club was not just a golf course, it was an extension of his office. Most weeks, Mr. Horn, a financial adviser at Wells Fargo, chatted up potential clients between holes at the upscale club set against the backdrop of the Santa Monica Mountains.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Madoff Aside, Financial Fraud Defies Policing', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Madoff Aside, Financial Fraud Defies Policing', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Banking and Financial Institutions', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Frauds and Swindling', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Ponzi and Pyramid Schemes', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Regulation and Deregulation of Industry', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Horn, Philip', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Wells Fargo & Company', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Los Angeles (Calif)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-07T02:30:08+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jessica Silver-Greenberg and Susanne Craig', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jessica', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Silver-Greenberg', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Susanne', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Craig', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/62491569-8c4d-5797-ba4b-2b97a658e272', 'word_count': 1065, 'uri': 'nyt://article/62491569-8c4d-5797-ba4b-2b97a658e272'}, {'abstract': 'Marshawn Lynch, who had a third-quarter fumble that probably cost the Seahawks a touchdown, put Seattle ahead with a 27-yard run midway through the fourth quarter.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/07/sports/football/seahawks-marshawn-lynch-atones-for-fumble-with-decisive-touchdown.html', 'snippet': 'Marshawn Lynch, who had a third-quarter fumble that probably cost the Seahawks a touchdown, put Seattle ahead with a 27-yard run midway through the fourth quarter.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LANDOVER, Md. — Marshawn Lynch was the N.F.L.’s third-leading rusher this season, but he was only a shade more than an afterthought in the frenzied weeklong buildup to Sunday’s N.F.C. wild-card game at FedEx Field between the Seattle Seahawks and the Washington Redskins.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/07/sports/YJPNFC/YJPNFC-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 368, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/01/07/sports/YJPNFC/YJPNFC-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 368}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/07/sports/YJPNFC/YJPNFC-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 629, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/07/sports/YJPNFC/YJPNFC-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1257, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/07/sports/YJPNFC/YJPNFC-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/01/07/sports/YJPNFC/YJPNFC-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption':