arge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/01/07/us/OILRIG/OILRIG-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 563}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/07/us/OILRIG/OILRIG-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 961, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/07/us/OILRIG/OILRIG-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1742, 'width': 1856, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/07/us/OILRIG/OILRIG-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/01/07/us/OILRIG/OILRIG-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/07/us/OILRIG/OILRIG-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Troubled Oil Rig in Alaska Reaches Safer Waters', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Alaska: Beached Rig Is Towed to Sheltered Bay', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Royal Dutch Shell Plc', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'ALASKA', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Offshore Drilling and Exploration', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-07T16:12:10+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Environment', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Henry Fountain', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Henry', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fountain', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/eeb39831-18d3-563f-be39-b04eea9cf2ea', 'word_count': 420, 'uri': 'nyt://article/eeb39831-18d3-563f-be39-b04eea9cf2ea'}, {'abstract': 'Ford is joining with Amazon to offer a free cloud music player for the car.', 'web_url': 'https://wheels.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/07/ford-debuts-in-car-voice-commands-for-amazons-cloud-music/', 'snippet': 'Ford is joining with Amazon to offer a free cloud music player for the car.', 'lead_paragraph': 'At the Consumer Electronics Show in Las Vegas, Ford and Amazon will announce on Monday afternoon a new music storage system that joins the automaker’s Sync AppLink with the Amazon Cloud Player to enable in-vehicle voice commands. While that sounds techie, in fact it points to a safe way forward to permanently replacing CDs as a way of listening music in the car.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Ford Announces In-Car Voice Commands for Amazon’s Cloud Music', 'kicker': 'Wheels', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobiles', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cloud Computing', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Smartphones', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Amazon Cloud Player', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Ford Motor Co', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Las Vegas (Nev)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-07T16:26:12+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Automobiles', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jim Motavalli', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jim', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Motavalli', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6b71ffea-f948-5183-b0d9-6810663b2c09', 'word_count': 526, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6b71ffea-f948-5183-b0d9-6810663b2c09'}, {'abstract': 'The International Kite Festival in Mumbai, Maharashtra.', 'web_url': 'https://india.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/07/image-of-the-day-jan-7/', 'snippet': 'The International Kite Festival in Mumbai, Maharashtra.', 'lead_paragraph': '', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Image of the Day: Jan. 7', 'kicker': 'India Ink', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-01-07T16:30:14+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1e62a999-81ba-5893-b930-d8bb35b52e49', 'word_count': 1, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1e62a999-81ba-5893-b930-d8bb35b52e49'}, {'abstract': 'Though the writer-director Ben Lewin had polio as a child, that’s not why he was drawn to “The Sessions,” a film about a writer with polio as a child.', 'web_url': 'https://carpetbagger.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/07/a-cynical-writer-director-goes-for-an-emotional-ride/', 'snippet': 'Though the writer-director Ben Lewin had polio as a child, that’s not why he was drawn to “The Sessions,” a film about a writer with polio as a child.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Though he may be a long shot as an Oscar contender, the writer-director Ben Lewin, who made “The Sessions,” is a favorite of the Bagger for his uncommon directness and emotional candor. Mr. Lewin wrote the screenplay for the film, about the polio-stricken writer Mark O’Brien, after reading his account of trying to lose his virginity while being mostly confined to an iron lung. (O’Brien, a poet who lived in Berkeley, Calif., died in 1999.) John Hawkes, who endured weeks of discomfort and damage to his spine to play O’Brien, and Helen Hunt, as the sex surrogate he hires, are both nominated for Golden Globes and Critics’ Choice awards, to be handed out this week.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A ‘Cynical’ Writer-Director Goes for an Emotional Ride', 'kicker': 'Carpetbagger', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lewin, Ben', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-07T16:32:56+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Melena Ryzik', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Melena', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ryzik', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/43c8fc2d-2ee7-5f4f-8901-0b0d63cdb9c6', 'word_count': 852, 'uri': 'nyt://article/43c8fc2d-2ee7-5f4f-8901-0b0d63cdb9c6'}, {'abstract': 'High-profile college coaches should not leap to trade their cushy thrones for the bed of nails that is an N.F.L. position.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/08/sports/best-advice-think-twice-about-that-nfl-job.html', 'snippet': 'High-profile college coaches should not leap to trade their cushy thrones for the bed of nails that is an N.F.L. position.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As college football’s national championship game gets ready to kick off Monday night, you will hear ad nauseam about the two coaches, including why they will, or won’t, and should, or shouldn’t, parlay their big moment into a stab at an N.F.L. job — and in Nick Saban’s case another stab at an N.F.L. job, even though he may still be bleeding from the last one. But if Saban or Notre Dame’s Brian Kelly needs any further confirmation of why this is a bad idea — and they shouldn’t: even Chip Kelly is apparently choosing an N.C.A.A. gangplank at Oregon instead of an N.F.L. job — they need only to have watched Sunday night’s fiasco involving Redskins Coach Mike Shanahan and the latest, most egregious example of how N.F.L. coaching makes you lose your mind.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/08/sports/football/08leadingpic/08leadingpic-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/08/sports/football/08leadingpic/08leadingpic-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/08/sports/football/08leadingpic/08leadingpic-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/01/08/sports/football/08leadingpic/08leadingpic-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/08/sports/football/08leadingpic/08leadingpic-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Think Twice About That N.F.L. Job', 'kicker': 'Leading Off', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'College Athletics', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Washington Redskins', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Seattle Seahawks', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'