ut to clubs late Sunday advised teams that it is going to take longer than initially thought for owners and players to vote on the proposed collective bargaining agreement.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In the initial euphoria after the N.H.L. and its players’ association reached a tentative deal to end the lockout early Sunday morning, league officials said that training camps could open as early as Wednesday. That has turned out to be overly optimistic. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'N.H.L. Camps May Not Open Until Saturday', 'kicker': 'Slap Shot', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Hockey League', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Rangers', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-07T17:00:15+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Hockey', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jeff Z. Klein', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jeff', 'middlename': 'Z.', 'lastname': 'Klein', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/adb30a0d-3ca9-55f9-b1bb-0d8aa6a5d7a9', 'word_count': 221, 'uri': 'nyt://article/adb30a0d-3ca9-55f9-b1bb-0d8aa6a5d7a9'}, {'abstract': 'A puzzle from the Julia Robinson Math Festival.', 'web_url': 'https://wordplay.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/07/trapezoid/', 'snippet': 'A puzzle from the Julia Robinson Math Festival.', 'lead_paragraph': 'We often think of math as being rather dry. Memorizing formulas. Calculating things. A race to a single right answer.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Trapezoidal Number Puzzle', 'kicker': 'Wordplay', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Creativity