42e-5149-9f49-c308c5c889c2', 'word_count': 718, 'uri': 'nyt://article/36d32cf2-842e-5149-9f49-c308c5c889c2'}, {'abstract': 'As the film “56 Up” shows, closeness is important to our generation, whether here or in Britain.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/07/booming/56-up-shows-generations-commitment-to-family.html', 'snippet': 'As the film “56 Up” shows, closeness is important to our generation, whether here or in Britain.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On Sunday I went to see the film “56 Up.” It’s the latest installment of the remarkable British documentary project that in 1964 began chronicling the lives of several 7-year-olds from a variety of economic backgrounds and has re-interviewed them every seven years since.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/07/booming/07winerip-booming-apted/07winerip-booming-apted-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/01/07/booming/07winerip-booming-apted/07winerip-booming-apted-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/07/booming/07winerip-booming-apted/07winerip-booming-apted-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1007, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/07/booming/07winerip-booming-apted/07winerip-booming-apted-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1830, 'width': 1800, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/07/booming/07winerip-booming-apted/07winerip-booming-apted-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name'