mer Republican senator, and John O. Brennan, his chief counterterrorism adviser, as his picks for two top national security posts.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/08/us/politics/obama-picks-hagel-as-defense-secretary-brennan-for-cia.html', 'snippet': 'President Obama named Chuck Hagel, a former Republican senator, and John O. Brennan, his chief counterterrorism adviser, as his picks for two top national security posts.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — Risking a potentially rancorous battle with Congress at the start of his second term, President Obama on Monday nominated Chuck Hagel, a former Republican senator from Nebraska whom Mr. Obama hailed as “the leader that our troops deserve,” to be secretary of defense.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/07/us/07hagel_cnd/07hagel_cnd-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/01/07/us/07hagel_cnd/07hagel_cnd-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/07/us/07hagel_cnd/07hagel_cnd-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/07/us/07hagel_cnd/07hagel_cnd-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/07/us/07hagel_cnd/07hagel_cnd-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/01/07/us/07hagel_cnd/07hagel_cnd-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbna