back Eddie Lacy made it look easy as he knifed through Notre Dame’s defense for 140 yards rushing and 2 touchdowns.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/08/sports/ncaafootball/in-their-nightmares-notre-dame-fans-will-see-42-in-red.html', 'snippet': 'Alabama running back Eddie Lacy made it look easy as he knifed through Notre Dame’s defense for 140 yards rushing and 2 touchdowns.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MIAMI GARDENS, Fla. — The Notre Dame Golden Domers had waited 24 years, and then the better part of six weeks, to flock here in anticipation of cheering their team onto a national title. Instead they sat with their arms folded, their caps lowered, slouched in their seats, despondent.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/08/sports/TIDE/TIDE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 401, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/01/08/sports/TIDE/TIDE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 401}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/08/sports/TIDE/TIDE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 685, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/08/sports/TIDE/TIDE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1369, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/08/sports/TIDE/TIDE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/01/08/sports/TIDE/TIDE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'capti