'lead_paragraph': 'Mumbai and New York both teem with the hustle and bustle of urban life but are bordered by the profound stillness that only water could provide. While New York City is made up of three islands — Manhattan, Staten Island and Long Island — Mumbai was once an archipelago of seven islands, which were joined together by land reclaimed from the sea by 1838.In both of these coastal cities, the waterfronts provide residents a respite from chaos, as well as a providing living for some. New York City has 578 miles of coastline, while Mumbai’s coastline measures 149 kilometers, or roughly 93 miles.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Mumbai/New York Photo Project: On the Waterfront', 'kicker': 'India Ink', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-01-08T16:38:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nisha Sondhe and Neha Thirani', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nisha', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sondhe', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Neha', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Thirani', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d9a0ca55-51ae-597c-9ac6-c70e662d3f5b', 'word_count': 379, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d9a0ca55-51ae-597c-9ac6-c70e662d3f5b'}, {'abstract': 'Myrlie Evers-Williams, a former chairwoman of the N.A.A.C.P. who is also the widow of the slain civil rights activist Medgar Evars, will deliver the invocation at President Obama’s second inaugural this month, Mr. Obama’s inaugural planners said.', 'web_url': 'https://thecaucus.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/08/widow-of-slain-civil-rights-leader-to-deliver-invocation-at-inauguration/', 'snippet': 'Myrlie Evers-Williams, a former chairwoman of the N.A.A.C.P. who is also the widow of the slain civil rights activist Medgar Evars, will deliver the invocation at President Obama’s second inaugural this month, Mr. Obama’s inaugural planners said.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Myrlie Evers-Williams, a former chairwoman of the N.A.A.C.P. who is also the widow of the slain civil rights activist Medgar Evars, will deliver the invocation at President Obama’s second inaugural this month, Mr. Obama’s inaugural planners said Tuesday.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Widow of Slain Civil Rights Leader to Deliver Invocation at Inauguration', 'kicker': 'The Caucus', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Inaugurations', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Evers-Williams, Myrlie', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-08T16:39:52+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sheryl Gay Stolberg', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sheryl', 'middlename': 'Gay', 'lastname': 'Stolberg', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3523b549-69b8-55a0-8ac9-8ee607d47851', 'word_count': 181, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3523b549-69b8-55a0-8ac9-8ee607d47851'}, {'abstract': 'Five killed from police fire and over 200 injured during riots in Dhule city, Maharashtra.', 'web_url': 'https://india.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/08/in-maharashtra-fight-over-restaurant-bill-erupts-into-riot/', 'snippet': 'Five killed from police fire and over 200 injured during riots in Dhule city, Maharashtra.', 'lead_paragraph': 'What started out as a skirmish over a restaurant bill escalated into riots that left five p