abstract': 'Ralph de la Vega, the chief executive of AT&T’s wireless unit, says the company’s new wireless home security system, Digital Life, would become available in March. And it plans major expansions for its fourth-generation LTE networks. He also has high hopes for Windows phones.', 'web_url': 'https://bits.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/08/c-e-s-2013-interview-with-ralph-de-la-vega-of-atampt-mobility/', 'snippet': 'Ralph de la Vega, the chief executive of AT&T’s wireless unit, says the company’s new wireless home security system, Digital Life, would become available in March. And it plans major expansions for its fourth-generation LTE networks. He also has h...', 'lead_paragraph': 'AT&T, the phone carrier, has a lot in store for the coming year. On Monday at the International Consumer Electronics Show in Las Vegas, it said that its new wireless home security system, Digital Life, would become available in March. And it plans major expansions for its fourth-generation LTE networks for cellphones.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/08/technology/08bits-vega/08bits-vega-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 661, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/08/technology/08bits-vega/08bits-vega-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1322, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/08/technology/08bits-vega/08bits-vega-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/01/08/technology/08bits-vega/08bits-vega-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'c