h bacon, but not aggressively so. Bacon strips dipped in chocolate, sandwiches like peanut butter and bacon, and even pig-shaped dog biscuits all come from the kitchen of the chef Edison Julien, center. Bacon from producers across the country, including Brooklyn Cured, Edwards, Nueske’s, Benton’s and Mosefund, is sold by the pound and sliced to order. Mr. Klein said he would expand the menu and planned to sell items like red velvet bacon cake balls for Valentine’s Day.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/09/dining/09STUFF1_BACONSPAN/09STUFF1_BACONSPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/01/09/dining/09STUFF1_BACONSPAN/09STUFF1_BACONSPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/09/dining/09STUFF1_BACONSPAN/09STUFF1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 925, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/09/dining/09STUFF1_BACONSPAN/09STUFF1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1850, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/09/dining/09STUFF1_BACONSPAN/09STUFF1_BACONSPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/01/09/dining/09STUFF1_BACONSPAN/09STUFF1_BACONSPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/09/dining