d balance it with a sweet component like yuzu jelly, a less exotic marmalade or a fig jam. You might think of it as a stinky cheese for vegans. The tofu, made in Belmont, Calif., comes nestled in a little bamboo cradle from which it can be served.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/09/dining/09STUFF3_TOFUSPAN/09STUFF3_TOFUSPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 380, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/01/09/dining/09STUFF3_TOFUSPAN/09STUFF3_TOFUSPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 380}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/09/dining/09STUFF3_TOFUSPAN/09STUFF3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 732, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/09/dining/09STUFF3_TOFUSPAN/09STUFF3-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1464, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/09/dining/09STUFF3_TOFUSPAN/09STUFF3_TOFUSPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/01/09/dining/09STUFF3_TOFUSPAN/09STUFF3_TOFUSPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/09/dining/09STUFF3_TOFUSPAN/09STUFF3_TOFUSPAN-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Tofu and Crackers, Anyone?', 'kicker': 'Food Stuff', 'content_k