 'nyt://article/359b4725-6a57-5b52-b056-a308f62fcd33'}, {'abstract': '“Enlightened,” HBO’s acclaimed comedy of sorts about a would-be activist played by Laura Dern, returns on Sunday even as other cult series fall by the wayside.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/09/arts/television/hbo-gives-low-rated-enlightened-a-second-shot.html', 'snippet': '“Enlightened,” HBO’s acclaimed comedy of sorts about a would-be activist played by Laura Dern, returns on Sunday even as other cult series fall by the wayside.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In the second season of HBO’s “Enlightened,” Amy Jellicoe, a self-involved do-gooder played by Laura Dern, joins Twitter. “Follow me. Follow me,” Amy repeats in the languid voice-over of her internal dialogue.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/09/arts/enlightened/enlightened-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 583, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/01/09/arts/enlightened/enlightened-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 583}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/09/arts/enlightened/enlightened-jumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 995, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/09/arts/enlightened/enlightened-superJumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 1988, 'width': 2045, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/09/arts/enlightened/enlightened-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/01/09