he moment when lawmakers would finally act on Illinois’s drastically underfinanced pension systems, but the moment came and went without a deal.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/09/us/illinois-tries-and-fails-to-fix-its-pensions.html', 'snippet': 'It seemed the moment when lawmakers would finally act on Illinois’s drastically underfinanced pension systems, but the moment came and went without a deal.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SPRINGFIELD, Ill. — If ever there was a moment when Illinois’s drastically underfinanced pension systems had a real shot at being repaired, some state leaders thought it would be this week.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Illinois Tries, and Fails, to Fix Its Pensions', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Illinois Tries, and Fails, to Fix Its Pensions', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Illinois', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Reform and Reorganization', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Pensions and Retirement Plans', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'State Legislatures', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Drivers Licenses', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Illegal Immigrants', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Same-Sex Marriage, Civil Unions and Domestic Partnerships', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Quinn, Patrick J', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-09T03:19:31+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Monica Davey', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Monica', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Davey', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'n