a18c14', 'word_count': 203, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b208ff73-af3a-556f-8778-5c7596a18c14'}, {'abstract': 'An unprecedented heat wave has sparked raging bushfires across some of the country’s most populated regions, pushing firefighters to their limits.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/10/world/asia/record-heat-fuels-widespread-fires-in-australia.html', 'snippet': 'An unprecedented heat wave has sparked raging bushfires across some of the country’s most populated regions, pushing firefighters to their limits.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SYDNEY, Australia — Bush fires raging across some of the most populous parts of Australia — feeding off widespread drought conditions and high winds — pushed firefighters to their limits and residents to their wits’ end on Wednesday as meteorologists tracked the country’s hottest spring and summer on record into uncharted territory.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/08/world/08aussie2_cnd/08aussie2_cnd-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/01/08/world/08aussie2_cnd/08aussie2_cnd-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/08/world/08aussie2_cnd/08aussie2_cnd-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/08/world/08aussie2_cnd/08aussie2_cnd-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/08/world/08aussie2_cnd/08aussie2_cnd-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 7