, {'abstract': 'A third of small businesses say there are few or no qualified applicants for open jobs, even though more than 12 million people are looking for work. What gives?', 'web_url': 'https://economix.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/09/are-there-really-no-good-job-applicants-out-there/', 'snippet': 'A third of small businesses say there are few or no qualified applicants for open jobs, even though more than 12 million people are looking for work. What gives?', 'lead_paragraph': 'The latest Small Business Optimism Index data from the National Federation of Independent Business — a major industry group for small businesses that surveys a sample of its members each month — is very disappointing. The report, issued Tuesday, showed business optimism to be near recessionary levels in December. Hiring plans in particular weakened substantially. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Are There Really No Good Job Applicants Out There?', 'kicker': 'Economix', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Labor and Jobs', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Small Business', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-09T17:15:30+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Economy', 'byline': {'original': 'By Catherine Rampell', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Catherine', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rampell', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/443cf9bd-11d6-5258-bf4d-7f6c910aae7a', 'word_count': 468, 'uri': 'nyt://article/443cf9bd-11d6-5258-bf4d-7f6c910aae7a'}, {'abstract': 'Drought and grass fires have pushed the price of hay to near records, making it an increasingly irresistible target for thieves or desperate peers.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.