athed her estate to the J. Paul Getty Trust in Los Angeles. The bequest followed the trust’s purchase of her archives in December; at the same time, she donated to the trust the archives of her husband, Garth Huxtable, an industrial designer. The archives will be housed at the Getty Research Institute.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Ada Louise Huxtable Leaves Estate to Getty Trust', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Huxtable Leaves Archives And Estate to Getty', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ARCHITECTURE', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Archives and Records', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Huxtable, Ada Louise', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Getty Research Institute', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Times', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Los Angeles (Calif)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-09T17:18:45+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Patricia Cohen', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Patricia', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cohen', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/48998259-ba43-54ca-ae74-ded3c4a9a631', 'word_count': 185, 'uri': 'nyt://article/48998259-ba43-54ca-ae74-ded3c4a9a631'}, {'abstract': 'Younger Americans die earlier and live in poorer health than their counterparts in 16 other developed countries, according to a new analysis of health and longevity in the United States.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/10/health/americans-under-50-fare-poorly-on-health-measures-new-report-says.html', 'snippet': 'Younger Americans die earlier and live in poorer health than their counterparts in 16 other developed countries, according to a new analysis of health and longevity in the United States.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Younger Americans die earlier and live in poorer health than their counterparts in other developed countries, with far higher rates of death from guns, car accidents and drug addiction, according to a new analysis of health and longevity in the United States.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'For Americans Under 50, Stark Findings on Health', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'For Americans Under 50, Stark Findings on Health', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Tavernise, Sabrina', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Medicine and Health', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Fatalities)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Institute of Medicine', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United States National Research Council', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Longevity', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-09T17:24:00+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Science', 'section_name': 'Health', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sabrina Tavernise', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sabrina', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Tavernise', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/56f9f395-59dc-55c5-b584-c5f68f12388d', 'word_count': 941, 'uri': 'nyt://article/56f9f395-59dc-55c5-b584-c5f68f12388d'}, {'abstract': 'States propose to add solar installations at such a frenetic pace that doubts have arisen over the projects’ viability.', 'web_url': 'https://green.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/09/in-india-solar-ambitions-are-suddenly-outsize/', 'snippet': 'States propose to add solar installations at such a frenetic pace that doubts have arisen over the projects’ viability.', 'lead_paragraph': 'After years of lagging behind China and the West in the adoption of solar power, some states in India are proposing to build solar farms at a galloping pace that leaves them at risk of falling short of electricity (a familiar problem here) or of paying higher prices for it.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'In India, Solar Ambitions Are Suddenly Outsize', 'kicker': 'Green', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Auctions', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Electric Light and Power', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Solar Energy', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'India', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Rajasthan (India)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Tamil Nadu (India)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-09T17:25:51+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Science', 'subsection_name': 'Environment', 'byline': {'original': 'By David Ferris', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ferris', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/62c05448-a441-5a2f-91a8-d2f4ce04937b', 'word_count': 603, 'uri': 'nyt://article/62c05448-a441-5a2f-91a8-d2f4ce04937b'}, {'abstract': 'Producers are promising a nostalgic production full of Mr. Manilow’s greatest hits.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/09/barry-manilow-returns-to-broadway/', 'snippet': 'Producers are promising a nostalgic production full of Mr. Manilow’s greatest hits.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Barry Manilow’s return to Broadway for a limited engagement at the St. James Theater has been extended for an additional 10 nights because of a strong demand for tickets, the producers have announced.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Barry Manilow’s Return to Broadway Is Extended', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '‘Manilow on Broadway’ Extends Before It Starts', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Manilow, Barry', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'St James Theater', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-09T17:29:49+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By James C. McKinley Jr', 'person': [{'firstname': 'James', 'middlename': 'C.', 'lastname': 'McKinley', 'qualifier': 'Jr', 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f1b25fdf-d55b-5dff-bbc1-22479b64f377', 'word_count': 212, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f1b25fdf-d55b-5dff-bbc1-22479b64f377'}, {'abstract': 'A protest in Srinagar, Jammu and Kashmir.', 'web_url': 'https://india.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/09/image-of-the-day-jan-9/', 'snippet': 'A protest in Srinagar, Jammu and Kashmir.', 'lead_paragraph': '', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Image of the Day: Jan. 9', 'kicker': 'India Ink', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-01-09T17:32:47+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9cc17d97-c736-52d4-8a8f-1a88353bf3f9', 'word_count': 1, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9cc17d97-c736-52d4-8a8f-1a88353bf3f9'}, {'abstract': 'The number of doctors planning to become geriatricians has fallen again. At this point, it’s likely there will never be enough of them.', 'web_url': 'https://newoldage.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/09/even-fewer-geriatricians-in-training/', 'snippet': 'The number of doctors planning to become geriatricians has fallen again. At this point, it’s likely there will never be enough of them.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Toward the end of each year, Christopher Langston, program director of the Hartford Foundation, undertakes a discouraging task. He wades through the statistics on graduate medical education, published annually in The Journal of the American Medical Association, and digs out the bad news about geriatrics.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Even Fewer Geriatricians in Training', 'kicker': 'The New Old Age', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Doctors', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elder Care', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-09T17:35:01+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Health', 'byline': {'original': 'By Paula Span', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Paula', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Span', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1b39ccf5-d725-5ad4-b793-7c4f782d8f31', 'word_count': 487, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1b39ccf5-d725-5ad4-b793-7c4f782d8f31'}, {'abstract': 'A local weather buff has been reviewing past numbers, and he has many observations about 2012.', 'web_ur