', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andrew C. Revkin', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andrew', 'middlename': 'C.', 'lastname': 'Revkin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/73298dc2-0998-5b35-aca5-0cead4ce384f', 'word_count': 991, 'uri': 'nyt://article/73298dc2-0998-5b35-aca5-0cead4ce384f'}, {'abstract': 'The new cocktail lounge at the Public Theater looks as if it has been there for years.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/10/fashion/boite-the-library-at-the-public.html', 'snippet': 'The new cocktail lounge at the Public Theater looks as if it has been there for years.', 'lead_paragraph': 'AS part of the Public Theater’s renovation, a cocktail lounge called the Library was added that harkens back to the building’s bookish past as the Astor Library. Tucked into the new mezzanine level, the Library looks as if it has been there for years but is, in fact, an entirely new space designed by David Rockwell. ', 'print_section': 'E', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/10/fashion/10zSUBBOITE/10zSUBBOITE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 683, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/10/fashion/10zSUBBOITE/10zSUBBOITE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1367, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Library at the Public', 'kicker': 'Boîte', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Library At the Public: East Village', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bars and Nightclubs', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cocktails', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ALCOHOLIC BEVERAGES', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Restaurants', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Public Theater', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Library at the Public (Manhattan, NY, Restaurant)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-09T22:09:06+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Brian Sloan', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Brian', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sloan', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/67895af2-eef4-5a96-a02f-5a83591c985b', 'word_count': 384, 'uri': 'nyt://article/67895af2-eef4-5a96-a02f-5a83591c985b'}, {'abstract': 'A view of the day in sports, which included regional soccer tournaments and Australian Open qualifying matches.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2013/01/09/sports/20130109photoreplay.html', 'snippet': 'A view of the day in sports, which included regional soccer tournaments and Australian Open qualifying matches.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A view of the day in sports, which included regional soccer tournaments and Australian Open qualifying matches.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/09/sports/20130109photoreplay-slide-Z12X/20130109photoreplay-slide-Z12X-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/09/sports/20130109photoreplay-slide-Z12X/20130109photoreplay-slide-Z12X-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank':