t': 'Australian temperatures reach uncharted territory; new concerns about Boeing’s Dreamliner; French ambivalence about gay marriage; Obama’s inaugural poet.', 'web_url': 'https://rendezvous.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/10/iht-quick-read-jan-10/', 'snippet': 'Australian temperatures reach uncharted territory; new concerns about Boeing’s Dreamliner; French ambivalence about gay marriage; Obama’s inaugural poet.', 'lead_paragraph': 'NEWS Bush fires raging across some of the most populous parts of Australia — feeding off widespread drought conditions and high winds — pushed firefighters to their limits and residents to their wits’ end on Wednesday as meteorologists tracked the country’s hottest spring and summer on record into uncharted territory. Months of record-breaking temperatures have produced what the government calls “catastrophic” conditions. Matt Siegel reports from Sydney. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/10/blogs/australia-rdv/australia-rdv-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 768, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/10/blogs/australia-rdv/australia-rdv-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1536, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/10/blogs/australia-rdv/australia-rdv-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/01/10/blogs/australia-rdv/australia-rdv-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/10/blogs/australia-rdv/australia-rdv-thumbLarge.jpg', 