g time,” Ms. Field said this morning, from a hotel in Los Angeles. But as a newly minted best supporting actress nominee, playing the wife to Daniel Day-Lewis’s Lincoln, she can relive her performance for weeks to come.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Sally Field, on Texting With Abraham Lincoln', 'kicker': 'Carpetbagger', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Academy Awards (Oscars)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Field, Sally', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-10T15:45:49+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Melena Ryzik', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Melena', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ryzik', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3bee8d93-0fa0-5eb5-b682-023e899b89a7', 'word_count': 387, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3bee8d93-0fa0-5eb5-b682-023e899b89a7'}, {'abstract': 'A parliamentary panel denounced the former UBS bankers for expressing ignorance of the Libor manipulation during the financial crisis.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2013/01/10/former-ubs-executives-are-grilled-over-libor/', 'snippet': 'A parliamentary panel denounced the former UBS bankers for expressing ignorance of the Libor manipulation during the financial crisis.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — Several former senior executives at UBS were labeled negligent and incompetent on Thursday for failing to detect illegal activity that caused the Swiss bank to pay a $1.5 billion fine to global regulators.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'British Panel Castigates Ex-UBS Officials at Hearing', 'ki