with-the-comic-desiree-burch.html', 'snippet': 'In “Tar Baby,” Desiree Burch, an African-American comic and actress, has a neat solution for when she doesn’t want to do a show about race.', 'lead_paragraph': 'At the start of “Tar Baby,” Desiree Burch, an African-American comic and actress, says she doesn’t want to do a show about race and then tells the audience members that they don’t really want to see one. “You want to say you saw a really important show about race,” she says, a sneaky smile emerging, “And I want to say I did that show.”', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/11/arts/11TARBABY_SPAN/11TARBABY_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 390, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/01/11/arts/11TARBABY_SPAN/11TARBABY_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 390}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/11/arts/11TARBABY_SPAN/TARBABY-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 809, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/11/arts/11TARBABY_SPAN/TARBABY-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1327, 'width': 1680, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/11/arts/11TARBABY_SPAN/11TARBABY_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/01/11/arts/11TARBABY_SPAN/11TARBABY_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'image