 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/11/opinion/progress-on-mortgage-regulations.html', 'snippet': 'New rules should help prevent predatory lending, but more protections are needed for low-income borrowers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Consumer Financial Protection Bureau has issued long-awaited rules on mortgage lending that should help protect home buyers and the global financial system from a repeat of the subprime disaster. But the rules, which were announced on Thursday and go into effect next year, include some features that could hurt lower-income borrowers.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Progress on Mortgage Regulations', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Progress on Mortgage Regulations', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mortgages', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Banking and Financial Institutions', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Consumer Protection', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Consumer Financial Protection Bureau', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-11T02:03:48+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/9340b985-8ac7-5982-8ecb-ec6c89edd125', 'word_count': 351, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9340b985-8ac7-5982-8ecb-ec6c89edd125'}, {'abstract': 'On Friday, President Obama and President Hamid Karzai of Afghanistan will confront vastly different positions on future American troop levels and other issues.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/11/world/asia/karzai-and-obama-to-meet-to-discuss-forces-in-afghanistan.html', 'snippet': 'On Friday, President Obama and President Hamid Karzai of Afghanistan will confront vastly different positions on future American troop levels and other issues.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — The last time President Obama and President Hamid Karzai of Afghanistan spoke face to face, it was on a video conference call on Sept. 21. Mr. Obama, distracted by an election in which the Afghanistan war was barely discussed, deflected Mr. Karzai’s most probing questions about the future of the American commitment there. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/12/us/12diploweb1/12diploweb1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 378, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/01/12/us/12diploweb1/12diploweb1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 378}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/12/us/12diploweb1/12diploweb1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 644, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/12/us/12diploweb1/12diploweb1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1289, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/12/us/12diploweb1/12diploweb1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/01/12/us/12diploweb1/12diploweb1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/12/us/12diploweb1/12diploweb1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge'