their underdog role.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/11/sports/football/rout-by-patriots-gives-texans-a-quiet-motivation.html', 'snippet': 'The Texans fell to the Patriots on Dec. 10, the first loss in a late-season slide. They have refused to manufacture bravado for the rematch while embracing their underdog role.', 'lead_paragraph': 'HOUSTON — They have been derided and disrespected to such an extent that no one would have blinked if the Houston Texans had pushed back by now, letting fly a venomous tirade of trash talk at the doubters and defending their reputation. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/11/sports/texans/texans-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 647, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/11/sports/texans/texans-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1294, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Texans Shrug Off Rout, and Questions It Raised, in Hope of Avenging It', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Texans Shrug Off Rout, and Questions It Raised, in Hope of Avenging It', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Spousta, Tom', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Houston Texans', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New England Patriots', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Foster, Arian', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Playoff Games', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-11T02:07:49+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sport