limate change is not just about rising temperatures.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WORCESTER, England — Britons may remember 2012 as the year the weather spun off its rails in a chaotic concoction of drought, deluge and flooding, but the unpredictability of it all turns out to have been all too predictable: Around the world, extreme has become the new commonplace.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Heat, Flood or Icy Cold, Extreme Weather Rages Worldwide', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Heat, Flood or Icy Cold, Extreme Weather Rages Worldwide', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lyall, Sarah', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Weather', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Global Warming', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-11T02:25:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'Science', 'subsection_name': 'Environment', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sarah Lyall', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sarah', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Lyall', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e733ae11-7245-529e-947a-bf75e8bbd3b5', 'word_count': 1302, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e733ae11-7245-529e-947a-bf75e8bbd3b5'}, {'abstract': 'The drug, canagliflozin, is being developed by Johnson & Johnson and is part of a group of drugs that lowers blood sugar by causing the sugar to be excreted through urine.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/11/business/fda-advisory-panel-votes-to-approve-diabetes-drug.html', 'snippet': 'The drug, canagliflozin, is being developed by Johnson & Johnson and is part of a group of drugs that lowers blood sugar by causing the sugar to be excreted through urine.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A federal advisory panel voted 10 to 5 on Thursday to approve a diabetes drug that could be the first in a new class of drugs in the United States to treat the disease, although several members raised concerns about potential cardiovascular risks and its use in people whose kidneys are impaired.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'F.D.A. Advisory Panel Votes to Approve Diabetes Drug', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'F.D.A. Advisory Panel Votes to Approve Diabetes Drug', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Drugs (Pharmaceuticals)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Thomas, Katie', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Diabetes', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Food and Drug Administration', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Johnson & Johnson', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Janssen Pharmaceutica', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-11T02:30:18+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Katie Thomas', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Katie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Thomas', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/777dcba8-6d95-55b2-912e-12084ff539f4', 'word_count': 673, 'uri': 'nyt://article/777dcba8-6d95-55b2-912e-12084ff539f4'}, {'abstract': 'The filmmaker Laura Poitras follows the tragic return home to Yemen of a Guantánamo Bay prison detainee, Adnan Latif.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/opinion/100000001998311/death-of-a-prisoner.html', 'snippet': 'The filmmaker Laura Poitras follows the tragic return home to Yemen of a Guantánamo Bay prison detainee, Adnan Latif.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The filmma