nst David Ferrer in the Australian Open, and Serena Williams is in the same half of the draw as Victoria Azarenka.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Third-seeded Andy Murray, the Olympics and United States Open winner, landed in the same half of the draw for the Australian Open as No. 2 Roger Federer. That leaves top-seeded Novak Djokovic with the much easier task of a possible semifinal meeting against No. 4 David Ferrer. \xa0 ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Djokovic and Azarenka Are Top Seedings', 'kicker': 'Sports Briefing | Tennis', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Djokovic and Azarenka Top Seedings', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rothenberg, Ben', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tennis', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Australian Open (Tennis)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Azarenka, Victoria', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Djokovic, Novak', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Williams, Serena', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ferrer, David', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Federer, Roger', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Radwanska, Agnieszka', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sharapova, Maria', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Murray, Andy (1987- )', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-11T02:57:59+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Tennis', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ben Rothenberg', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ben', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rothenberg', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://