ck’s Sapphire.', 'web_url': 'https://mediadecoder.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/11/anheuser-busch-will-tout-two-new-products-in-super-bowl-xlvii-ads/', 'snippet': 'This year, the company has bought time on CBS for one commercial for Budweiser, two for Bud Light and three for two new beers: Budweiser Black Crown and Beck’s Sapphire.', 'lead_paragraph': '11:33 a.m. | Updated The marketer that typically buys the most commercial time during the Super Bowl each year has ambitious plans for the game this year, which include pitches for two new products.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Anheuser-Busch Will Promote Two New Products in Super Bowl XLVII Ads', 'kicker': 'Media Decoder', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ADVERTISING AND MARKETING', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Beer', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Anheuser-Busch InBev NV', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'CBS Corporation', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-11T05:01:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By Stuart Elliott', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Stuart', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Elliott', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/757f1b1d-1cfd-54eb-97bb-396fe341af2b', 'word_count': 801, 'uri': 'nyt://article/757f1b1d-1cfd-54eb-97bb-396fe341af2b'}, {'abstract': 'This word has appeared in 257 New York Times articles in the past year.', 'web_url': 'https://learning.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/11/word-of-the-day-offhand/'