fit group vanishes in Laos; answers are scarce after a Paris killing; Nokia has a pleasant surprise; Christopher Clarey predicts the future.', 'lead_paragraph': 'NEWS The disappearance of Sombath Somphone, leader of a respected nonprofit organization in Laos, who was last seen being stopped at a police checkpoint, has raised alarms that the Southeast Asian communist country’s nascent liberalization could be sliding backward. Thomas Fuller reports from Vientiane, Laos. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/11/blogs/laos-rdv/laos-rdv-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/11/blogs/laos-rdv/laos-rdv-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1367, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/11/blogs/laos-rdv/laos-rdv-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/01/11/blogs/laos-rdv/laos-rdv-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/11/blogs/laos-rdv/laos-rdv-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'IHT Quick Read: Jan. 11', 'kicker': 'IHT Rendezvous', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-01-11T07:38:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By The International Herald Tribune', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The International Herald Tribune'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/fc07e9a4-ecef-5a93-bafb-53165ae3ac60', 'word_count': 361, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fc07e9a4-ecef-5a93-bafb-53165ae3ac60'}, {'abstract': 'The report on Jimmy Savile documents more than 200 cases of sexual abuse, and prosecutors admitted that “shortcomings” in interviewing some victims allowed him to escape prosecution.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/12/world/europe/jimmy-savile-sexual-abuse-scandal-report.html', 'snippet': 'The report on Jimmy Savile documents more than 200 cases of sexual abuse, and prosecutors admitted that “shortcomings” in interviewing some victims allowed him to escape prosecution.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — Scotland Yard and Britain’s leading child welfare group drew a horrific picture of more than 200 cases of sexual abuse of victims as young as 8 by the BBC host Jimmy Savile in a report released on Friday, and prosecutors admitted for the first time that “shortcomings” in interviewing some of the victims allowed Mr. Savile to escape prosecution before his death at the age of 84 in 2011. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/12/world/europe/12savile/12savile-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 370, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/01/12/world/europe/12savile/12savile-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 370}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/12/world/europe/12savile/12savile-jumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 676, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/12/world/europe/12savile/12savile-superJumbo