graphs of muscle cars in midair, evoking classic chase scenes from 1960s and ’70s TV and cinema.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MATTHEW PORTER is shopping online for a vintage muscle car, and not just any car will do. He is tempted by a ’66 Dodge Charger but isn’t crazy about its glossy white paint job. A ’72 Plymouth Road Runner would appeal, but it’s tricked out for racing, with “43” painted on its roof and Pepsi decals all over. The ’70 Plymouth Superbird? It lacks the steroidal contours he craves. He passes on a couple of convertibles and then discovers a ’67 Ford Mustang Shelby GT 500.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/13/arts/13CARPHOTO_SPAN/13CARPHOTO_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 239, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/01/13/arts/13CARPHOTO_SPAN/13CARPHOTO_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 239}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/13/arts/13CARPHOTO_SPAN/13CARPHOTO_SPAN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 408, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/13/arts/13CARPHOTO_SPAN/13CARPHOTO_SPAN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 815, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/13/arts/13CARPHOTO_SPAN/13CARPHOTO_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/01/13/arts/13CARPHOTO_SPAN/13CARPHOTO_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLar