, with reports from our correspondents and from around the Web.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Lede is following the debate on gun violence in the wake of the shootings in Newtown, Conn., with reports from our correspondents and from around the Web. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Jan. 11 Updates on the Gun Violence Debate', 'kicker': 'The Lede', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Gun Control', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Newtown, Conn, Shooting (2012)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-11T17:00:53+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Blogs', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jennifer Preston', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jennifer', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Preston', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c9b8f955-e66e-58e9-93ca-3238552feeb6', 'word_count': 2189, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c9b8f955-e66e-58e9-93ca-3238552feeb6'}, {'abstract': 'Technology has provided new outlets for people to celebrate, or boast about, their achievements, but that hasn’t made bragging more socially acceptable than it was before.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/12/your-money/the-etiquette-of-celebrating-or-bragging-about-achievements.html', 'snippet': 'Technology has provided new outlets for people to celebrate, or boast about, their achievements, but that hasn’t made bragging more socially acceptable than it was before.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MOST of you are probably not aware that, in the last month, many seniors in high school have learned whether they have been accepted to their top-choice college.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, '