eason last summer and fall, the agency says.', 'web_url': 'https://green.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/11/shell-violated-air-permits-for-arctic-ships-e-p-a-says/', 'snippet': 'Its ships allowed excess nitrogen oxides to escape during the abbreviated 2012 drilling season last summer and fall, the agency says.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Environmental Protection Agency says that Shell committed numerous violations of the air pollution permits for its two Arctic drill ships, adding to the company’s catalog of Alaskan offshore woes.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Shell Violated Air Permits for Arctic Ships, E.P.A. Says', 'kicker': 'Green', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Air Pollution', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Offshore Drilling and Exploration', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Smith, Curtis', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Environmental Protection Agency', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Interior Department', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Royal Dutch Shell Plc', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'ALASKA', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'ARCTIC REGIONS', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Kodiak Island (Alaska)', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-11T19:43:05+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Science', 'subsection_name': 'Environment', 'byline': {'original': 'By John M. Broder', 'person': [{'firstname': 'John', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3accd013-55d8-5af0-b909-d431e0403c1b', 'word_count': 254, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3accd013-55d8-5af0-b909-d431e0403c1b'}, {'abstract': 'After traveling the globe, from Congo to Patagonia, where does Paul Theroux still want to go?', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/13/travel/paul-therouxs-travel-wish-list.html', 'snippet': 'After traveling the globe, from Congo to Patagonia, where does Paul Theroux still want to go?', 'lead_paragraph': 'WE travel for pleasure, for a door-slamming sense of “I’m outta here,” for a change of air, for edification, for the big vulgar boast of being distant, for the possibility of being transformed, for the voyeuristic romance of gawping at the exotic; and sometimes we travel because we have been banished. I was banished once, and it fortified me.', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/13/travel/13-theroux-pic-sf/13-theroux-pic-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/01/13/travel/13-theroux-pic-sf/13-theroux-pic-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/13/travel/13-theroux-pic-sf/13-theroux-pic-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 667, 'width': 1000, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/13/travel/13-theroux-pic-sf/13-theroux-pic-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 667, 'width': 1000, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/13/travel/13-theroux-pic-sf/13-theroux-pic-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'imag