/11/screams-and-curses-a-beast-nominee-gets-the-news/', 'snippet': 'Lucy Alibar, one of the writers of “Beasts of the Southern Wild,” said she started shivering when she heard the news that she had been nominated for an Oscar. Her father started cursing, but that was a good thing.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The screenwriter Lucy Alibar based parts of “Beasts of the Southern Wild” on her own relationship with her father, who lives in the rural South and never saw her one-act play, from which the indie hit and best-picture nominee was adapted. So it was particularly gratifying to have him and her mother be a part of her Oscar morning on Thursday. “I didn’t think they had a TV that worked,” she said, “but I guess they did, they were watching it.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Screams and Curses: A ‘Beast’ Nominee Gets the News', 'kicker': 'Carpetbagger', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Beasts of the Southern Wild (Movie)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Academy Awards (Oscars)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Alibar, Lucy', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-11T21:19:54+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Melena Ryzik', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Melena', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ryzik', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/14142d56-1183-5bb5-8e54-43c46f700541', 'word_count': 312, 'uri': 'nyt://article/14142d56-1183-5bb5-8e54-43c46f700541'}, {'abstract': 'Amazon’s Kindle software keeps track of where you left off in the same e-book on all your tablets and phones, but you can clear the information if it gets out of sync.', 'web_url': 'https://gadgetwise.blogs.nytimes.com/201