ealBook analyzed new loan rules and examined cuts at Morgan Stanley. Andrew Ross Sorkin said the easing of rules for banks acknowledges reality. A.I.G. weighs whether to sue the U.S. but decides against it; two hedge fund managers clashed; an ex-...', 'lead_paragraph': 'DealBook analyzed new loan rules and examined cuts at Morgan Stanley. Andrew Ross Sorkin said the easing of rules for banks acknowledges reality. A.I.G. weighs whether to sue the U.S. but decides against it; two hedge fund managers clashed; an ex-SAC analyst cooperated on an insider case; Bank of America made a deal to extend a retreat from mortgages; and banks agreed to pay $8.5 Billion to speed up foreclosure relief.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Week in Review: When Hedge Fund Managers Clash', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-01-11T21:34:05+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Eric Owles', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Eric', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Owles', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c9cab6d0-ddb0-5f61-bf00-2c855126ac76', 'word_count': 1227, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c9cab6d0-ddb0-5f61-bf00-2c855126ac76'}, {'abstract': 'The Mercedes GL350, powered by an awesome 3-liter diesel V-6, is the first rung in the redesigned GL lineup, but you’re welcome to stuff it with nearly all of the options available on the fancier models.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/13/automobiles/autoreviews/king-of-the-hill-indeed-with-a-price-to-match.html', 'snippet': 'The Mercedes GL350, powered by an awesome 3-liter diesel V-6, is the first rung in the redesigned GL lineup, but you’re welcome to stuff it with nearly all of the options available on the fa