None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/435077d3-29c1-57da-8290-a77bed66cd09', 'word_count': 925, 'uri': 'nyt://article/435077d3-29c1-57da-8290-a77bed66cd09'}, {'abstract': 'The South Street Seaport was damaged in Hurricane Sandy but nevertheless offers historic sights and an abundance of shopping.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/13/nyregion/south-street-seaport-has-begun-storm-recovery.html', 'snippet': 'The South Street Seaport was damaged in Hurricane Sandy but nevertheless offers historic sights and an abundance of shopping.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The South Street Seaport was once the bustling, raucous, polyglot center for maritime trade in the Port of New York. During its peak years, in the half century after the War of 1812, ships from all over the world docked here, with their bowsprits pointing west over South Street. But the area’s proximity to the East River led to terrible flooding during Hurricane Sandy, and the historic neighborhood, much of it built on 19th-century landfill, is only beginning to recover.', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/13/nyregion/20130113LOCALSTOPss-slide-D6XV/20130113LOCALSTOPss-slide-D6XV-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/01/13/nyregion/20130113LOCALSTOPss-slide-D6XV/20130113LOCALSTOPss-slide-D6XV-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/13/nyregion/20130113LOCALSTOPss-slide-D6XV/20130113LOCALSTOPss-slide-D6XV-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/13/nyre