13/01/12/pageoneplus/quotation-of-the-day-for-saturday-jan-12-2013.html', 'snippet': 'Quotation of the day for Saturday, Jan. 12, 2013.', 'lead_paragraph': 'If I had 1,000 AR-15’s I could sell them in a week.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Quotation of the Day for Saturday, Jan. 12, 2013', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Quotation of the Day', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-01-12T03:57:49+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Summary', 'section_name': 'Corrections', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Quote', '_id': 'nyt://article/da3f7c84-0ad6-5bec-ba11-bb632be6e80b', 'word_count': 30, 'uri': 'nyt://article/da3f7c84-0ad6-5bec-ba11-bb632be6e80b'}, {'abstract': 'Mrs. Stevenson, a loyal daughter who followed the wishes of her father, Amon G. Carter Sr., built a museum of American art.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/13/arts/ruth-carter-stevenson-of-the-amon-carter-museum-dies-at-89.html', 'snippet': 'Mrs. Stevenson, a loyal daughter who followed the wishes of her father, Amon G. Carter Sr., built a museum of American art.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Ruth Carter Stevenson, who followed her father’s last wishes in creating the Amon Carter Museum in Fort Worth, one of the nation’s pre-eminent collections of American art, died on Jan. 6 at her home in Fort Worth. She was 89.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '26', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/13/arts/STEVENSON2-OBIT/STEVENSON2-OBIT-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 709, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/13/arts/STEVENSON2-OBIT/STEVENSON2-OBIT-sup