er Row, is experiencing a resurgence with moves there by The Daily News and Condé Nast.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/13/nyregion/new-media-companies-in-old-media-companies-old-downtown-space.html', 'snippet': 'Lower Manhattan, near the old Newspaper Row, is experiencing a resurgence with moves there by The Daily News and Condé Nast.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A newspaper reporter once complimented Renzo Piano, the architect of The New York Times Building on Eighth Avenue, on his design, noting that the building reminded him of a sheet of newsprint. “It does?” Mr. Piano replied.', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/13/nyregion/13BOOK_SPAN/13BOOK_SPAN-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 406, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/01/13/nyregion/13BOOK_SPAN/13BOOK_SPAN-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 406}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/13/nyregion/13BOOK_SPAN/13BOOK_SPAN-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 693, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/13/nyregion/13BOOK_SPAN/13BOOK_SPAN-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1386, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/13/nyregion/13BOOK_SPAN/13BOOK_SPAN-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/01/13/nyregion/13BOOK_SPAN/13BOOK_SPAN-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbL