d Osman Mohamud is accused of plotting and trying to carry out a bomb attack at a Christmas tree lighting ceremony in a crowded Portland, Ore. square.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/12/us/trial-begins-for-mohamed-osman-mohamud.html', 'snippet': 'Mohamed Osman Mohamud is accused of plotting and trying to carry out a bomb attack at a Christmas tree lighting ceremony in a crowded Portland, Ore. square.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PORTLAND, Ore. — A defense lawyer for a 21-year-old Somali-American told a federal jury here on Friday that his client did in fact push a cellphone button on a night in late November 2010 believing he was detonating a truck bomb that would kill hundreds or thousands of people who had gathered to watch downtown Portland’s Christmas lights come on.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/12/us/TERROR-1/TERROR-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 554, 'width': 399, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/12/us/TERROR-1/TERROR-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 554, 'width': 399, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/12/us/TERROR-1/TERROR-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/01/12/us/TERROR-1/TERROR-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/12/us/TERROR-1/TERROR-1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'In 2010 Portland Bomb Plot, a Question of Manipulation or Violent Extremism', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'In 2010 Portland Bomb Plot, a Question of Manipulation or Violent Extremism', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mohamud, Mohamed Osman', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Johnson, Kirk', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Portland (Ore)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Terrorism', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bombs and Explosives', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Federal Bureau of Investigation', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-12T04:12:54+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kirk Johnson', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kirk', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Johnson', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0d4225fe-05f6-52cb-9ca3-5a7e8d9d0364', 'word_count': 724, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0d4225fe-05f6-52cb-9ca3-5a7e8d9d0364'}, {'abstract': 'A career C.I.A. employee who kept a low profile, she helped unmask one of the nation’s most notorious traitors, Aldrich Ames.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/13/us/jeanne-vertefeuille-who-helped-catch-aldrich-ames-dies-at-80.html', 'snippet': 'A career C.I.A. employee who kept a low profile, she helped unmask one of the nation’s most notorious traitors, Aldrich Ames.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Jeanne Vertefeuille joined the Central Intelligence Agency as a typist in 1954 and then began inching up through the ranks, obtaining postings overseas. By 1986 she had become a midlevel expert on the Soviet Union and counterintelligence. She remained a quiet agency soldier, however — purposefully nondescript and selflessly dedicated. She lived alone and walked to work. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '26', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/13/us/subJEANNE-OBIT/subJEANNE-OBIT-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/01/13/us/subJEANNE-OBIT/subJEANNE-OBIT-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/13/us/subJEANNE-OBIT/subJEANNE-OBIT-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 611, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/13/us/subJEANNE-OBIT/subJEANNE-OBIT-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 933, 'width': 1564, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/13/us/subJEANNE-OBIT/subJEANNE-OBIT-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/01/13/us/subJEANNE-OBIT/subJEANNE-OBIT-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/13/us/subJEANNE-OBIT/subJEANNE-OBIT-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Jeanne Vertefeuille, C.I.A. Official Who Helped Catch a Notorious Mole, Dies at 80', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Jeanne Vertefeuille Is Dead at 80; Helped Catch a Notorious C.I.A. Mole', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Martin, Douglas', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Vertefeuille, Jeanne', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Central Intelligence Agency', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'AMES, ALDRICH HAZEN', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'USSR (Former Soviet Union)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Obituaries)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-12T04:13:51+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Douglas Martin', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Douglas', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Martin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Obituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/3c9a6afc-a583-5419-83ab-9d47826478b1', 'word_count': 1024, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3c9a6afc-a583-5419-83ab-9d47826478b1'}, {'abstract': 'Marty Markowitz, borough president and cheerleader, keeps busy on Sundays, visiting groups of every variety.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/13/nyregion/sundays-with-marty-markowitz-brooklyn-borough-president.html', 'snippet': 'Marty Markowitz, borough president and cheerleader, keeps busy on Sundays, visiting groups of every variety.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Officially, Marty Markowitz may be Brooklyn’s borough president, but others know him as its booster-in-chief. Born three blocks from Ebbets Field and becalmed in the borough ever since, he spends every day — Sundays included — at ribbon cuttings, street renamings and political dinners, learning his constituents’ problems, doing whatever his City Charter-limited powers allow, and, always, cheering the borough. After 23 years as a state senator, he was elected to “the job I always wanted” in 2001. Now 67, he lives in a brick house in Windsor Terrace with his wife, Jamie, 54, a graphic artist; they have an African gray parrot named Beep (as in B.P.) that he calls his son.', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/13/nyregion/13ROUTINE2_SPAN/13ROUTINE2_SPAN-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/01/13/nyregion/13ROUTINE2_SPAN/13ROUTINE2_SPAN-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/13/nyregion/13ROUTINE2_SPAN/13ROUTINE2_SPAN-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/13/nyregion/13ROUTINE2_SPAN/13ROUTINE2_SPAN-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/13/nyregion/13ROUTINE2_SPAN/13ROUTINE2_SPAN-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/01/13/nyregion/13ROUTINE2_SPAN/13ROUTINE2_SPAN-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/13/nyregion/13ROUTINE2_SPAN/13ROUTINE2_SPAN-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Being Brooklyn, Aided by Cheesecake', 'kicker': 'Sunday Routine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Being Brooklyn, Aided by Cheesecake', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Markowitz, Marty', 'ra