rkers found ammunition when they removed a plug in an 18th-century cannon’s barrel, a police spokesman said, then they dialed 911.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The cannons of the British warship H.M.S. Hussar were last fired in anger during the Revolutionary War. But when Central Park Conservancy workers arrived to clean one on Friday, the police said, they found it was still loaded with gunpowder and a cannonball, ready to fire. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Antique Cannon in Central Park Found Loaded', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Antique Cannon in Central Park Found Loaded', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Firearms', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Central Park (Manhattan, NY)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Abandonment (Property)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Police Department (NYC)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ANTIQUES', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bombs and Explosives', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Revolutionary War, American (1775-83)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-12T04:56:41+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f2655051-6a03-5b1a-8795-2889052c86a8', 'word_count': 241, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f2655051-6a03-5b1a-8795-2889052c86a8'}, {'abstract': 'The court will hear cases on the free speech rights of private groups receiving federal money and the right against self-incrimination during police questioning.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/12/us/supreme-court-takes-up-first-and-fifth-amendment-cases.html', 'sni