ded by a few dozen reporters and filmed by a row of cameras — can attest that he expressed it with all the emotion of a rutabaga. ', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/13/sports/PATRIOTS/PATRIOTS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 752, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/13/sports/PATRIOTS/PATRIOTS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1505, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/13/sports/PATRIOTS/PATRIOTS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/01/13/sports/PATRIOTS/PATRIOTS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/13/sports/PATRIOTS/PATRIOTS-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'For Patriots’ Coach and Quarterback, Wins, Not Words, Add Up', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'For Patriots’ Coach and Quarterback, Wins, Not Words, Add Up', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New England Patriots', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Belichick, Bill', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Brady, Tom', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Playoff Games', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Houston Texans', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Awards, Decorations and Honors', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Montana, Joe', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-12T17:22:29+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Football', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ben Shpigel', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ben', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Shpigel', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6134202e-6bf5-5ff2-813d-697a2e2c3bc7', 'word_count': 949, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6134202e-6bf5-5ff2-813d-697a2e2c3bc7'}, {'abstract': 'As Carmelo Anthony recently displayed against the Celtics, the Knicks have a history of foolish acts and fisticuffs when the moment has demanded calm.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/13/sports/basketball/knicks-and-anthony-remain-vulnerable-to-self-sabotage.html', 'snippet': 'As Carmelo Anthony recently displayed against the Celtics, the Knicks have a history of foolish acts and fisticuffs when the moment has demanded calm.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It was almost half past 11 Friday night when Carmelo Anthony strolled into the public part of the locker room, about an hour after the Knicks’ third straight defeat to an Eastern Conference rival. This is now one of the defining measures of 21st-century N.B.A. stardom — the longer deadline-besieged reporters are kept waiting, the more important the player apparently must be.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/13/sports/YKNICKS/YKNICKS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 719, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type'