.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/13/opinion/sunday/a-hunters-education-in-the-class-of-13.html', 'snippet': 'A state-sponsored class for would-be hunters offers a glimpse at a large and growing segment of Americans.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The environmental conservation officer stood in front of my hunter-education class and said he had never seen one so big, so early in the year. Normally in January he would be speaking to about a dozen people, maybe 20, most of them Boy Scouts. Our group numbered at least 70, most of them solitary men, from young to grizzled, but also a family with children and a handful of fathers with young daughters.', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/13/sunday-review/13EDITORIAL/13EDITORIAL-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 402, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/01/13/sunday-review/13EDITORIAL/13EDITORIAL-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 402}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/13/sunday-review/13EDITORIAL/13EDITORIAL-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 767, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/13/sunday-review/13EDITORIAL/13EDITORIAL-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1535, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/13/sunday-review/13EDITORIAL/13EDITORIAL-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/01/13/sunday-review/13EDITORIAL/13EDITORIAL-thumbStandard.jpg', '