cle/cac9f3ee-5fc9-5ab3-b9c2-e937056279cd', 'word_count': 573, 'uri': 'nyt://article/cac9f3ee-5fc9-5ab3-b9c2-e937056279cd'}, {'abstract': 'Some mutual funds are allowed to take chances on just about any security, anywhere in the world. But managers aren’t seeing many golden opportunities at the moment.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/13/business/mutfund/managers-of-world-allocation-funds-are-finding-few-bargains.html', 'snippet': 'Some mutual funds are allowed to take chances on just about any security, anywhere in the world. But managers aren’t seeing many golden opportunities at the moment.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MUTUAL fund managers tend to be held on a short investing leash, but a small subset of funds lets managers run free and place bets on just about any asset class from any part of the world. As liberating as this go-anywhere mandate is, however, managers of some of the largest of these world allocation funds say that no amount of freedom is helping them today — because they aren’t finding many great opportunities. ', 'print_section': 'BU', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/13/business/13-ANYWHERE2/13-ANYWHERE2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 370, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/01/13/business/13-ANYWHERE2/13-ANYWHERE2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 370}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/13/business/13-ANYWHERE2/13-ANYWHERE2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 631, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/13/business/13-ANYWHERE2/13-ANYWHERE2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1263, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 's