ident of Houghton Mifflin Harcourt has long been an avid reader. But her career only recently turned to publishing.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/13/jobs/linda-zecher-from-geophysicist-to-publisher.html', 'snippet': 'The president of Houghton Mifflin Harcourt has long been an avid reader. But her career only recently turned to publishing.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I GREW up in Middletown in southwestern Ohio. My mother took care of my brother and me. My father had several businesses, including a trucking company. I had a paper delivery route and worked as a candy striper at the local hospital.', 'print_section': 'BU', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/13/business/13-BOSS/13-BOSS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 778, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/01/13/business/13-BOSS/13-BOSS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 778}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/13/business/13-BOSS/13-BOSS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 790, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/13/business/13-BOSS/13-BOSS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1584, 'width': 1221, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/13/business/13-BOSS/13-BOSS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/01/13/business/13-BOSS/13-BOSS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/13/business/13-BOSS/13-BOSS-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Path to Publishing', 'kicker': 'The Boss', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Path to Publishing', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Olson, Elizabeth', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Houghton Mifflin Harcourt', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Executives and Management (Theory)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Careers and Professions', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Books and Literature', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Book Trade and Publishing', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-12T22:34:52+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'SundayBusiness', 'section_name': 'Job Market', 'byline': {'original': 'By Linda K. Zecher', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Linda', 'middlename': 'K.', 'lastname': 'Zecher', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e47eee60-049c-58f3-b8ee-a5c75850292e', 'word_count': 618, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e47eee60-049c-58f3-b8ee-a5c75850292e'}, {'abstract': 'After criticism of the conditions at FedEx Field, Commissioner Roger Goodell said he would look into requiring teams to re-sod their natural grass fields.', 'web_url': 'https://fifthdown.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/12/league-may-require-teams-to-re-sod-fields/', 'snippet': 'After criticism of the conditions at FedEx Field, Commissioner Roger Goodell said he would look into requiring teams to re-sod their natural grass fields.', 'lead_paragraph': 'DENVER — Commissioner Roger Goodell said Saturday the league will look into whether it should require teams to re-sod parts of their natural grass fields after extensive criticism of the field conditions at FedEx Field in Landover, Md., last weekend. Goodell said there was no complaint after the Redskins’ regular-season finale against the Cowboys, but one week later, the Seahawks complained at length about the choppy field, which was blamed for the torn knee ligament sustained by Seahawks defensive end Chris Clemons.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'League May Require Teams to Re-Sod Fields', 'kicker': 'The Fifth Down', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Goodell, Roger', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-12T22:59:07+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Football', 'byline': {'original': 'By Judy Battista', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Judy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Battista', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e9504eb2-8974-529a-a8f3-c19498d147bb', 'word_count': 249, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e9504eb2-8974-529a-a8f3-c19498d147bb'}, {'abstract': 'Elizabeth C. Gorski’s 200th puzzle for The New York Times. How cool is that?', 'web_url': 'https://wordplay.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/12/magic-square/', 'snippet': 'Elizabeth C. Gorski’s 200th puzzle for The New York Times. How cool is that?', 'lead_paragraph': 'Administrivial Grid Numbering Alert! Due to the unusual nature of Elizabeth C. Gorski’s Sunday puzzle, the clue numbering is different in the print and electronic versions.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Magic Square', 'kicker': 'Wordplay', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'va