h he proposed changes in several areas.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Checking on the Status of State Gun Laws', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Gun Control', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cuomo, Andrew M', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York State', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-13T00:57:40+0000', 'document_type': 'multimedia', 'news_desk': 'U.S.', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Interactive Feature', '_id': 'nyt://interactive/2dd81166-8822-5fd0-a7ba-bc27119d9577', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://interactive/2dd81166-8822-5fd0-a7ba-bc27119d9577'}, {'abstract': 'Commentary and live analysis of Saturday night’s N.F.C. divisional-round playoff game between the Green Bay Packers (12-5) and the San Francisco 49ers (11-4-1).', 'web_url': 'https://fifthdown.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/12/live-packers-at-49ers/', 'snippet': 'Commentary and live analysis of Saturday night’s N.F.C. divisional-round playoff game between the Green Bay Packers (12-5) and the San Francisco 49ers (11-4-1).', 'lead_paragraph': 'Read on for commentary and live analysis from Saturday night’s N.F.C. divisional-round playoff game between the Green Bay Packers and the San Francisco 49ers as it happened. The game was a rematch of the teams’ Week 1 encounter, won by the 49ers, 30-22, but that game offered few clues about what was to come Saturday night. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Final: 49ers 45, Packers 31', 'kicker': 'The Fifth Down', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Green Bay Packers',