d_count': 973, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6dad0bcc-39dc-5975-87f2-f82eba3e953f'}, {'abstract': '“The Carrie Diaries,” a prequel to “Sex and the City,” stars AnnaSophia Robb as the young Carrie Bradshaw, in the 1980s, when her inner fashionista was just starting to blossom.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/14/arts/television/the-carrie-diaries-on-cw-from-candace-bushnells-writing.html', 'snippet': '“The Carrie Diaries,” a prequel to “Sex and the City,” stars AnnaSophia Robb as the young Carrie Bradshaw, in the 1980s, when her inner fashionista was just starting to blossom.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Seen outside the long shadow cast by “Sex and the City,” “The Carrie Diaries” is relatively inoffensive (based on its pilot episode): a fair to middling CW teenage soap opera with some nice performances, particularly by Matt Letscher as the father of the 16-year-old Carrie Bradshaw and Austin Butler as her first crush. It’s not relationship material, but you wouldn’t feel guilty about spending a night with it.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/14/arts/carrie/carrie-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 658, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/14/arts/carrie/carrie-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1317, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/14/arts/carrie/carrie-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/01/14/arts/carrie/carrie-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 