a7b0-6903797a03fa', 'word_count': 1348, 'uri': 'nyt://article/300a948e-4e9c-5d53-a7b0-6903797a03fa'}, {'abstract': 'The San Francisco Giants, visiting New York to celebrate another championship, have a soft spot for their former home, and the feeling is mutual.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/14/sports/baseball/giants-left-their-hearts-at-coogans-bluff.html', 'snippet': 'The San Francisco Giants, visiting New York to celebrate another championship, have a soft spot for their former home, and the feeling is mutual.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Once they were the darlings of Coogan’s Bluff, but now the San Francisco Giants are the darlings of a bar in New York’s East Village as well as thousands of passionate baseball fans back East who stay up late to root.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/14/sports/baseball/14vecsey-pic/14vecsey-pic-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 480, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/01/14/sports/baseball/14vecsey-pic/14vecsey-pic-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 480}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/14/sports/baseball/14vecsey-pic/14vecsey-pic-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 819, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/14/sports/baseball/14vecsey-pic/14vecsey-pic-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1638, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/14/sports/baseball/14vecsey-pic/14vecsey-pic-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType'