raph': 'Tonight the Hollywood Foreign Press Association handed out its Golden Globe awards at the Beverly Hilton Hotel. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '‘Argo,’ ‘Les Miz,’ Homeland’ and ‘Girls’ Win Big at the Golden Globes', 'kicker': 'Carpetbagger', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Golden Globes (Awards)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Hollywood Foreign Press Assn', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-13T22:25:08+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d6d66b6a-400d-589e-9e80-532d04a2677f', 'word_count': 6139, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d6d66b6a-400d-589e-9e80-532d04a2677f'}, {'abstract': 'The Paul Taylor Dance Company is to announce on Monday that it will commemorate the 25th anniversary of Mr. Taylor’s “Brandenburgs”and “Speaking in Tongues” by selling $5 tickets to the March 6 performance.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/14/arts/dance/taylor-dance-company-offers-a-bargain.html', 'snippet': 'The Paul Taylor Dance Company is to announce on Monday that it will commemorate the 25th anniversary of Mr. Taylor’s “Brandenburgs”and “Speaking in Tongues” by selling $5 tickets to the March 6 performance.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Paul Taylor Dance Company is to announce on Monday that it will commemorate the 25th anniversary of Mr. Taylor’s “Brandenburgs” (above) and “Speaking in Tongues” by selling $5 tickets to the March 6 performance of the two dances in four separate pop-up shops across Manhattan. Every seat at the David H. Koch Theater in Lincoln Center will be sold at the discounted price, and tickets will be distributed equally among all pop-up locations. Tickets must be purchased in person, with a limit of two per buyer. More information including participating sites, on-sale times and dates can be obtained by calling (212) 431-5562.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Taylor Dance Company Offers a Bargain', 'kicker': 'Arts, Briefly', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Taylor Dance Company Offers a Bargain', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dancing', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Taylor, Paul, Dance Co', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-13T22:32:17+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Dance', 'byline': {'original': 'Compiled by Adam W. Kepler', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Adam', 'middlename': 'W.', 'lastname': 'Kepler', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://article/78c41a44-e4c3-51b4-acc6-0bb8939867cb', 'word_count': 103, 'uri': 'nyt://article/78c41a44-e4c3-51b4-acc6-0bb8939867cb'}, {'abstract': 'Reports this week include retail sales for December, the Producer Price Index for December and business inventories for November.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/14/business/economy/economic-reports-for-the-week-of-jan-14.html', 'snippet': 'Reports this week include retail sales for December, the Producer Price Index for December and business inventories for November.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ECONOMIC REPORTS Data scheduled to be released includes retail sales for December, the Producer Price Index for December, and business inventories for November (Tuesday); the Consumer Price Index for December, industrial production for December and the Federal Reserve beige book (Wednesday); weekly jobless claims, housing starts for December and the Philadelphia Fed index for January (Thursday); and the Thomson Reuters/University of Michigan consumer sentiment index for January (Friday).', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Economic Reports for the Week Ahead', 'kicker': 'Looking Ahead', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Economic Reports for the Week Ahead', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Economy', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Economic Conditions and Trends', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Banking and Financial Institutions', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-13T22:42:31+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Economy', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Schedule', '_id': 'nyt://article/a6588608-0665-5ac8-a841-708b1d9b46b9', 'word_count': 259, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a6588608-0665-5ac8-a841-708b1d9b46b9'}, {'abstract': 'The vulnerability was serious enough for the Department of Homeland Security to advise all users of Microsoft Windows, Apple’s Mac OS X and Linux platforms to disable Java in their Web browsers.', 'web_url': 'https://bits.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/13/u-s-agency-warns-of-java-software-problem/', 'snippet': 'The vulnerability was serious enough for the Department of Homeland Security to advise all users of Microsoft Windows, Apple’s Mac OS X and Linux platforms to disable Java in their Web browsers.', 'lead_paragraph': '6:53 p.m. | Updated Oracle fixed a security flaw in its Java software on Sunday, after the Department of Homeland Security warned users to disable Java software completely, citing a security hole that allows hackers to take control of their machines. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [],