ot four touchdowns from their running backs, including three from Shane Vereen.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/14/sports/football/patriots-ground-game-runs-over-texans.html', 'snippet': 'New England is proving that its offense is no longer just about Tom Brady. In its A.F.C. victory over the Texans, it got four touchdowns from their running backs, including three from Shane Vereen.', 'lead_paragraph': 'FOXBOROUGH, Mass. — He figured he would at least play. That much Shane Vereen thought he could count on for the Patriots’ playoff opener Sunday against the Houston Texans. He had earned that much with his play during the regular season, hadn’t he?', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/14/sports/YAFCSIDE/YAFCSIDE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/01/14/sports/YAFCSIDE/YAFCSIDE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/14/sports/YAFCSIDE/YAFCSIDE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/14/sports/YAFCSIDE/YAFCSIDE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Vereen’s ‘Fun Game’ Puts Oomph in Patriots’ Run Game', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Vereen’s ‘Fun Game’ Puts Oomph in Patriots’ Run Game', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'May, Peter', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New England Patriots', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'