 does track sleep and it does use energy-saving Bluetooth 4.0.', 'web_url': 'https://pogue.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/14/the-fitbit-flex-improves-on-its-rivals/', 'snippet': 'At the Consumer Electronics Show, FitBit flashed the features of the FitBit Flex. It’s a silicone bracelet just like the Up and Nike bands, but with neither of the drawbacks — it does track sleep and it does use energy-saving Bluetooth 4.0.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I’m fascinated by wearable fitness trackers. By measuring your physical activity, and even comparing your efforts with your friends’, they make you constantly aware of your sad sedentary life, and always remind you to take the stairs or park farther away. The good ones also track your sleep, which is usually a completely invisible, undocumented part of your life. That window onto the invisible one-third of your existence can have a huge effect on your health, productivity and self-awareness. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/14/blogs/fitbit/fitbit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 251, 'width': 522, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/14/blogs/fitbit/fitbit-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 251, 'width': 522, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/14/blogs/fitbit/fitbit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/01/14/blogs/fitbit/fitbit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/14/blogs/fitbit/fitbit-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'su