nfluence over the direction of Herbalife’s stock price than two hedge fund managers do.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2013/01/14/fate-of-herbalifes-stock-may-lie-with-government-agencies/', 'snippet': 'The actions of the Securities and Exchange Commission and the Federal Trade Commission may have more influence over the direction of Herbalife’s stock price than two hedge fund managers do.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The fate of the stock of the nutritional supplements company Herbalife may lie not in the hands of two warring hedge fund managers but rather in the purview of various government agencies.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Fate of Herbalife’s Stock May Lie With Government Agencies', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Ponzi and Pyramid Schemes', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Regulation and Deregulation of Industry', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Securities and Commodities Violations', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Stocks and Bonds', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Federal Trade Commission', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Herbalife Ltd', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Securities and Exchange Commission', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-14T16:54:55+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Peter J. Henning', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Peter', 'middlename': 'J.', 'lastname': 'Henning', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3b1f7829-181c-5f7b-84d6-f457dafdb2fc', 'word_count': 1056, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3b1f7829-181c-5f7b-84d6-f457dafdb2fc'}, {'abstract': 'Five hearty grain salads that feel like comfort food.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/14/health/skillet-beet-and-farro-salad.html', 'snippet': 'Five hearty grain salads that feel like comfort food.', 'lead_paragraph': '“Comforting” isn’t a word I usually associate with salads, but this week I put together five grain salads that fit that bill. Over the years I have developed a number of delicious whole grain salads that combine various grains with vegetables, herbs and often nuts, tossed in a tangy dressing. I have also married many a grain and vegetable in a pilaf. I decided to bring both concepts together in hearty salads that I’m calling “skillet salads;” each one is heated through in a skillet just before serving.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/15/science/14recipehealth/14recipehealth-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/01/15/science/14recipehealth/14recipehealth-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/15/science/14recipehealth/14recipehealth-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/15/science/14recipehealth/14recipehealth-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/15/science/14recipehealth/14recipehealth-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/01/15/science/14recipehealth/14recipehealth-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/15/science/14recipehealth/14recipehealth-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Healthy Comforting Food: Warm Skillet Salads', 'kicker': 'Recipes for Health', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Medicine and Health', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Diet and Nutrition', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Recipes', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Salads', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-14T16:58:29+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Science', 'section_name': 'Health', 'byline': {'original': 'By Martha Rose Shulman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Martha', 'middlename': 'Rose', 'lastname': 'Shulman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c2264303-d84a-5697-a772-c4c515801391', 'word_count': 618, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c2264303-d84a-5697-a772-c4c515801391'}, {'abstract': 'We’re asking baby boomers for information on their travel habits.', 'web_url': 'https://intransit.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/14/attention-baby-boomers/', 'snippet': 'We’re asking baby boomers for information on their travel habits.', 'lead_paragraph': 'We’d like to hear from you. We’re gathering information on how different demographics travel. If you were born between 1946 and 1964, please let us know a few things about your travel habits. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Attention Baby Boomers!', 'kicker': 'In Transit', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-01-14T16:59:36+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Travel', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6f687d7c-2920-50f5-82f3-804e6a8ba758', 'word_count': 73, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6f687d7c-2920-50f5-82f3-804e6a8ba758'}, {'abstract': 'Fun with addition from the Julia Robinson Math Festival.', 'web_url': 'https://wordplay.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/14/sum/', 'snippet': 'Fun with addition from the Julia Robinson Math Festival.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Some of the puzzles featured here in Numberplay can be solved with a bit of quick insight. Other puzzles are meant to be explored. This can be a lot of fun — especially with friends. This week’s Insert Sum Here is a nice example of an exploring-with-friends type puzzle. The challenge is presented by Joshua Zucker, who will be featuring Insert Sum Here at an upcoming Julia Robinson Mathematics Festival to be held at the University of California, Berkeley.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/13/crosswords/JRMF-Connery-Wood/JRMF-Connery-Wood-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 286, 'width': 190, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/13/crosswords/JRMF-Connery-Wood/JRMF-Connery-Wood-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 286, 'width': 190, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/13/crosswords/JRMF-Connery-Wood/JRMF-Connery-Wood-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/01/13/crosswords/JRMF-Connery-Wood/JRMF-Connery-Wood-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/13/crosswords/JRMF-Connery-Wood/JRMF-Connery-Wood-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 118, 'width': 118, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Insert Sum Here Puzzle', 'kicker': 'Wordplay', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Creativity', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Education (Secondary)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mathematics', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Puzzles', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'University of California, Berkeley', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-14T17:00:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Crosswords & Games', 'byline': {'original': 'By Gary Antonick', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Gary', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Antonick', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e27f44b2-a78e-5be1-8ca2-1a29abfbbcaf', 'word_count': 1162, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e27f44b2-a78e-5be1-8ca2-1a29abfbbcaf'}, {'abstract': 'The musical, based on the 2003 movie about a father-son relationship and the power of mythic storytelling, will begin performances on Sept. 5 at the Neil Simon Theater with Bobby Steggert and Kate Baldwin joining Norbert Leo Butz.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/14/big-fish-to-open-on-broadway/', 'snippet': 'The musical, based on the 2003 movie about a father-son relationship and the power of mythic storytelling, will begin performances on Sept. 5 at the Neil Simon Theater with Bobby Steggert and Kate Baldwin joining Norbert Leo Butz.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Broadway-bound new musical “Big Fish,” based on the 2003 movie about a father-son relationship and the power of mythic storytelling, will begin performances on Sept. 5 at the Neil Simon Theater and include Tony Award nominees Bobby Steggert (“Ragtime”) and Kate Baldwin (“Finian’s Rainbow”) as the son and wife of the show’s previously announced star, Tony winner Norbert Leo Butz (“Catch Me If You Can”). The musical’s producers on Monday announced the full cast for “Big Fish,” which will have a Chicago tryout this spring, as well as the theater and performance dates, which include an opening night of Oct. 6.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '‘Big Fish’ to Open on Broadway in the Fall', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '‘Big Fish’ on Broadway Set for the Fall Season', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Theater', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Baldwin, Kate', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Butz, Norbert Leo', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Steggert, Bobby', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-14T17:05:40+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Patrick Healy', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Patrick', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Healy', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/332acb51-3d82-5246-b774-adf9ac2f6561', 'word_count': 260, 'uri': 'nyt://article/332acb51-3d82-5246-b774-adf9ac2f6561'}, {'abstract': 'The Golden Globes improved in the ratings, most likely thanks to the news generated by the Oscar nominations a few days earlier.', 'web_url': 'https://carpetbagger.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/14/how-the-oscar-nominations-helped-globes-ratings/', 'snippet': 'The Golden Globes improved in the ratings, most likely thanks to the news generated by the Oscar nominations a few days earlier.', 'lead_paragraph': '4:43 p.m. | Updated  LOS ANGELES – The decision by Oscar planners to move up their nominations this year – seen as an attempt to lessen the impact of the rival Globes – seemed to backfire in a big way: Ratings for Sunday’s Globes hit a six-year high, according to early Nielsen data.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'How the Oscar Nominations Helped Globes Ratings', 'kicker': 'Carpetbagger', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Golden Globes (Awards)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Broadcasting Co', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-14T17:10:19+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Brooks Barnes', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Brooks', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Barnes', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/eedf7163-ecdd-54c8-87ea-bf2ee2919107', 'word_count': 203, 'uri': 'nyt://article/eedf7163-ecdd-54c8-87ea-bf2ee2919107'}, {'abstract': 'TimesCast: French forces strike Mali to stem Islamist rebels advance. | A special report on women’s rights and sexual assaults in India. | Writer Sohaila Abdulali on overcoming the trauma of rape.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/world/100000002003635/military-intervention-in-africa.html', 'snippet': 'TimesCast: French forces strike Mali to stem Islamist rebels advance. | A special report on women’s rights and sexual assaults in India. | Writer Sohaila Abdulali on overcoming t