riting and experience with live television comedy can translate into widespread plaudits.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Golden Globes Ratings Surge', 'kicker': 'Media Decoder', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Golden Globes (Awards)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Ratings (Audience Measurement)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Fey, Tina', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Poehler, Amy', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Broadcasting Co', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-14T20:58:29+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bill Carter', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bill', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Carter', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f1a41c7c-7d16-509a-ad2b-08a0dab4de69', 'word_count': 186, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f1a41c7c-7d16-509a-ad2b-08a0dab4de69'}, {'abstract': 'Ben Affleck and his brother Casey both said they were expecting the Golden Globes for best director and best drama to go to another nominee.', 'web_url': 'https://carpetbagger.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/14/in-the-afflecks-corner-genuine-shock/', 'snippet': 'Ben Affleck and his brother Casey both said they were expecting the Golden Globes for best director and best drama to go to another nominee.', 'lead_paragraph': '4:47 p.m. | Updated The Warner Brothers/InStyle Golden Globes afterparty, held in an ornate tent off the lobby of the Beverly Hilton, is usually dimly lit, the better to encourage dancing – and it works: more than once has the Bagger found herself in some losing twist-off with the cast members of “Glee.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'In the Afflecks’ Corner, Genuine Shock', 'kicker': 'Carpetbagger', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Golden Globes (Awards)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'AFFLECK, BEN', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Affleck, Casey', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-14T21:02:36+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Melena Ryzik', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Melena', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ryzik', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/208a2598-bd12-511c-b51c-1bc78dd62129', 'word_count': 390, 'uri': 'nyt://article/208a2598-bd12-511c-b51c-1bc78dd62129'}, {'abstract': 'In George Saunders’s latest collection, the stories tend to pivot around loneliness, disappointment, frustration and the difficulty of connecting with other human beings.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/15/books/tenth-of-december-stories-by-george-saunders.html', 'snippet': 'In George Saunders’s latest collection, the stories tend to pivot around loneliness, disappointment, frustration and the difficulty of connecting with other human beings.', 'lead_paragraph': 'No one writes more powerfully than George Saunders about the lost, the unlucky, the disenfranchised, those Americans who struggle to pay the bills, make the rent, hold onto a job they might detest — folks who find their dreams slipping from their grasp as they frantically tread water, trying to keep from drowning. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'mul