rt to get longer.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As the parent of teenage boys who have to be dragged out of bed on school days, I had been looking forward to earlier sunrises once the winter solstice was past. But early January mornings seemed darker than ever while at the same time, the sky was clearly lighter around 5 p.m. ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/15/science/15SUNR-1357962946027/15SUNR-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 801, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/15/science/15SUNR-1357962946027/15SUNR-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1601, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/15/science/15SUNR-1357962946027/15SUNR-1357962946027-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/01/15/science/15SUNR-1357962946027/15SUNR-1357962946027-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/15/science/15SUNR-1357962946027/15SUNR-1357962946027-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Equation of Time Solves Mystery of Gray Mornings', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Equation of Time Solves Mystery of Gray Mornings', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Seasons and Months', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sun', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Daylight Saving Time', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Earth', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Time', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-14T23:11:31+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Science', 'section_name': 'Science', 'byline': {'original': "By John O'Neil", 'person': [{'firstname': 'John', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': "O'Neil", 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/910b91c3-32e3-588e-b660-a6257344dfaf', 'word_count': 623, 'uri': 'nyt://article/910b91c3-32e3-588e-b660-a6257344dfaf'}, {'abstract': 'Richard Pryor, Dick Cheney and Muammar el-Qaddafi are among the personalities that will be the focus of Showtime’s new documentary features.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/15/arts/television/richard-pryor-and-dick-cheney-focus-of-showtime-documentaries.html', 'snippet': 'Richard Pryor, Dick Cheney and Muammar el-Qaddafi are among the personalities that will be the focus of Showtime’s new documentary features.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The pay cable channel Showtime has been closing the gap with the rival HBO in the realm of original series — an achievement rewarded with a strong showing at Sunday’s Golden Globes ceremony — but one major distinction has remained: HBO has long been the channel with a commitment to attention-grabbing original documentaries, and Showtime the channel without.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/15/arts/jpshowtime1/jpshowtime1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/01/15/arts/jpshowtime1/jpshowtime1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank