: 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/15/world/middleeast/egypts-leader-morsi-made-anti-jewish-slurs.html', 'snippet': 'Anti-Semitic remarks that President Mohamed Morsi of Egypt made in 2010 have raised doubts about his efforts to present himself as a force for moderation.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CAIRO — Nearly three years ago, a leader of the Muslim Brotherhood delivered a speech urging Egyptians to “nurse our children and our grandchildren on hatred” for Jews and Zionists. In a television interview months later, the same leader described Zionists as “these bloodsuckers who attack the Palestinians, these warmongers, the descendants of apes and pigs.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/15/world/JP-MORSI-1/JP-MORSI-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/01/15/world/JP-MORSI-1/JP-MORSI-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/15/world/JP-MORSI-1/JP-MORSI-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 601, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/15/world/JP-MORSI-1/JP-MORSI-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 888, 'width': 1513, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/15/world/JP-MORSI-1/JP-MORSI-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/01/15/world/JP-MORSI-1/JP-MORSI-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/15/world/JP-MORSI-1/JP-MORSI-1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Morsi’s Slurs Against Jews Stir Concern', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Morsi’s Slurs Against Jews Stir Concern', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Egypt', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kirkpatrick, David D', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Morsi, Mohamed', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ANTI-SEMITISM', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Muslim Brotherhood (Egypt)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Israel', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Video Recordings and Downloads', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Youssef, Bassem', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-15T02:19:33+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By David D. Kirkpatrick', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/bf42a84d-4d25-5071-8e26-451566edb2da', 'word_count': 1061, 'uri': 'nyt://article/bf42a84d-4d25-5071-8e26-451566edb2da'}, {'abstract': 'After more than 11 weeks since the devastating storm, New York, New Jersey and Connecticut are still waiting on adequate federal aid.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/15/opinion/dont-skimp-on-hurricane-sandy-aid.html', 'snippet': 'After more than 11 weeks since the devastating storm, New York, New Jersey and Connecticut are still waiting on adequate federal aid.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Gov. Chris Christie of New Jersey made an impassioned pitch on Monday to his fellow Republicans in the House of Representatives to vote on Tuesday for almost $50 billion in Hurricane Sandy disaster relief. “New Jersey does not expect anything more than what was done for Louisiana and Alabama and Mississippi in Katrina, and what was done in Joplin, Mo., what was done in the floods in Iowa. We don’t expect anything more than that, but we will not accept anything less,” Mr. Christie said. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Don’t Skimp on Sandy Aid', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Don’t Skimp on Sandy Aid', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Christie, Christopher J', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hurricane Sandy (2012)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Federal Aid (US)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'House of Representatives', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New Jersey', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York State', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Connecticut', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-15T02:20:30+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/3f76e563-e4bf-533c-abe8-e9b02ffa5eba', 'word_count': 309, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3f76e563-e4bf-533c-abe8-e9b02ffa5eba'}, {'abstract': 'France can help, but Mali must win the fight against Islamist rebels.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/15/opinion/a-widening-war-in-mali.html', 'snippet': 'France can help, but Mali must win the fight against Islamist rebels.', 'lead_paragraph': 'France’s initial airstrikes have, so far, failed to halt the southward advance of Islamist rebels in Mali. Containing these militias, which are sheltering international terrorist groups, and the threat they pose to West Africa and the wider world is essential. But President François Hollande should resist beginning a ground assault, which would almost certainly turn into a protracted counterinsurgency campaign that France should not take on and cannot afford.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Widening War in Mali', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Widening War in Mali', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Mali', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tuareg (Ethnic Group)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'France', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hollande, Francois', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Al Qaeda in the Islamic Maghreb', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Ansar Dine', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-15T02:24:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/3c65afbe-3efe-5d8b-b56d-96bd73ecfa57', 'word_count': 424, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3c65afbe-3efe-5d8b-b56d-96bd73ecfa57'}, {'abstract': 'Thomas Weisel was Lance Armstrong’s biggest financial backer and the single individual most responsible for the money machine that propelled Mr. Armstrong’s career.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2013/01/14/armstrong-benefactor-is-holding-his-breath/', 'snippet': 'Thomas Weisel was Lance Armstrong’s biggest financial backer and the single individual most responsible for the money machine that propelled Mr. Armstrong’s career.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When Lance Armstrong’s interview with Oprah Winfrey about his suspected use of illegal performance-enhancing drugs is broadcast on Thursday, an investment banker will most likely be watching it very carefully (and nervously): Thomas Weisel.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Banker Who Put His Faith in Armstrong', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Banker Who Put Much Faith In Armstrong', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Banking and Financial Institutions', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Doping (Sports)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'ARMSTRONG, LANCE', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Weisel, Thomas', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-15T02:25:44+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andrew Ross Sorkin', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andrew', 'middlename': 'Ross', 'lastname': 'Sorkin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/881352a5-b52f-5776-9c77-c95be91bab75', 'word_count': 1030, 'uri': 'nyt://article/881352a5-b52f-5776-9c77-c95be91bab75'}, {'abstract': 'Gigi Pritzker’s OddLot Entertainment picked up the pieces when Warner Brothers’ rights to “Ender’s Game” expired and began assembling its most expensive movie to date.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/15/business/media/enders-game-is-a-bet-for-gigi-pritzkers-oddlot-entertainment.html', 'snippet': 'Gigi Pritzker’s OddLot Entertainment picked up the pieces when Warner Brothers’ rights to “Ender’s Game” expired and began assembling its most expensive movie to date.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CULVER CITY, Calif. — Back when there were only a couple of “Harry Potter” pictures, and provocative youth films like “The Hunger Games” and “Twilight” were barely a twinkle in Hollywood’s eye, Warner Brothers tried — and failed — to make a movie of Orson Scott Card’s book “Ender’s Game.”', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/15/business/PRITZKER2/PRITZKER2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/01/15/business/PRITZKER2/PRITZKER2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/15/business/PRITZKER2/PRITZKER2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 708, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/15/business/PRITZKER2/PRITZKER2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1416, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Movie Mogul Rising', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Movie Mogul Rising', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Pritzker, Gigi', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'OddLot Entertainment', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': "Ender's Game (Movie)", 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-15T02:28:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_des