ocal community colleges and high schools.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A plan to offer an array of online college classes at a California state university could, if the students are successful, open the door to teaching hundreds of thousands of California students at a lower cost via the Internet.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/15/business/SUB-JP-UDACITY/SUB-JP-UDACITY-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 313, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/01/15/business/SUB-JP-UDACITY/SUB-JP-UDACITY-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 313}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/15/business/SUB-JP-UDACITY/SUB-JP-UDACITY-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 533, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/15/business/SUB-JP-UDACITY/SUB-JP-UDACITY-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1067, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'California to Give Web Courses a Big Trial', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'California To Give Web Courses A Big Trial', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Udacity', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Markoff, John', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'California', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'E-Learning', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Colleges and Universities', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'San Jose State University', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Comm