Bronx neighborhood transformed him from a hobbyist into an obsessive.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When Ricky Flores started taking pictures as a high school senior in 1980, he did what a lot of young photographers did: he photographed his friends, family and neighbors. He captured giddy, even goofy moments, of dancers in the park, teenagers on stoops and costumed children on Halloween.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A South Bronx Family Album', 'kicker': 'Lens', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Labor and Jobs', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Newspapers', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Photography', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gonzalez, David', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Gannett Company Inc', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Times', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Bronx (NYC)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Puerto Rico', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'South Bronx (Bronx, NY)', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-15T10:00:55+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Multimedia/Photos', 'byline': {'original': 'By James Estrin', 'person': [{'firstname': 'James', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Estrin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d1e8e186-c31e-57a2-b00e-1cc63977aaca', 'word_count': 1030, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d1e8e186-c31e-57a2-b00e-1cc63977aaca'}, {'abstract': 'Well-educated women of New Delhi can be choosy, but should not wait too long, a marriage broker says.', 'web_url': 'https://india.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/15/in-delhi-women-marry-up-and-men-are-left-behind/', 'snippet': 'Well-educated women of New Delhi can be choosy, but should not wait too long, a marriage broker says.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There’s an unexpected problem in New Delhi’s high-end marriage market, according to Gopal Suri, who has been a marriage broker for two decades. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'In New Delhi, Women Marry Up and Men Are Left Behind', 'kicker': 'India Ink', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Marriages', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Women and Girls', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'India', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-15T10:22:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Anjani Trivedi', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Anjani', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Trivedi', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5be2579d-dc60-54f1-9771-84a20a2cab2e', 'word_count': 646, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5be2579d-dc60-54f1-9771-84a20a2cab2e'}, {'abstract': 'Mark Kantrowitz, an expert on financial aid, answers select reader questions about the Free Application for Federal Student Aid. Part 2.', 'web_url': 'https://thechoice.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/15/guidance-office-fafsa-2/', 'snippet': 'Mark Kantrowitz, an expert on financial aid, answers select reader questions about the Free Application for Federal Student Aid. Part 2.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Now that most college applications are in, it is time for those student applicants (and their parents) to submit what may be the most vital piece of their financial aid plans: the Free Application for Federal Student Aid, or Fafsa.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multim