ro-Democratic paper, The Free Press despised the fact that the presidency, along with “all official positions,” could now “be open to the nigger.” ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Emancipation — Then What?', 'kicker': 'Disunion', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Citizenship and Naturalization', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Civil War (US) (1861-65)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Slavery', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bates, Edward (1793-1869)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Chase, Salmon P', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Supreme Court', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-15T17:30:31+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael Vorenberg', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Vorenberg', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/296a16ff-afcd-5f1a-a859-a9639457400d', 'word_count': 2468, 'uri': 'nyt://article/296a16ff-afcd-5f1a-a859-a9639457400d'}, {'abstract': 'At Golden Globes parties over the weekend Daniel Day-Lewis was the actor other actors hoped to meet, but among directors it was Benh Zeitlin of “Beasts of the Southern Wild.”', 'web_url': 'https://carpetbagger.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/15/add-spielberg-to-the-list-of-beasts-fans/', 'snippet': 'At Golden Globes parties over the weekend Daniel Day-Lewis was the actor other actors hoped to meet, but among directors it was Benh Zeitlin of “Beasts of the Southern Wild.”', 'lead_paragraph': '12:48 p.m. | Updated  BEVERLY HILLS, Calif. — “We’re on a mission to find Daniel Day-Lewis,” said Aaron Paul, the “Breaking Bad” star. The Golden Globes had ended, and he was traversing the Beverly Hilton lobby with his fiancée, Lauren Parsekian. “I don’t want to meet him, I just want to stand next to him and act like we’re friends.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Add Spielberg to the List of ‘Beasts’ Fans', 'kicker': 'Carpetbagger', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Golden Globes (Awards)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-15T17:34:14+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Melena Ryzik', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Melena', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ryzik', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7ca55c62-bea7-54e8-ac08-d0fc8384d2da', 'word_count': 541, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7ca55c62-bea7-54e8-ac08-d0fc8384d2da'}, {'abstract': 'A 360-degree view of the 2014 Subaru Forester XT at the Detroit auto show.', 'web_url': 'https://wheels.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/15/in-the-round-2014-subaru-forester-xt/', 'snippet': 'A 360-degree view of the 2014 Subaru Forester XT at the Detroit auto show.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The 2014 Subaru Forester XT at the Detroit auto show. To control the view of the car above, click on the image and move the cursor left or right.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'In the Round: 2014 Subaru Forester XT', 'kicker': 'Wheels', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-01-15T17:45:01+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Automobiles', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/743aee9c-88c8-5cf3-8bd0-e8e1f7365369', 'word_count': 41, 'uri': 'nyt://article/743aee9c-88c8-5cf3-8bd0-e8e1f7365369'}, {'abstract': 'Grid operators are scratching their heads over how they should weigh a proposal for an undersea transmission line for electricity.', 'web_url': 'https://green.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/15/breaking-new-ground-in-grid-rules/', 'snippet': 'Grid operators are scratching their heads over how they should weigh a proposal for an undersea transmission line for electricity.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Among the “firsts” being tried by the Atlantic Wind Connection, the venture seeking to build an electric transmission line from southern Virginia to northern New Jersey, is negotiating the regulatory system. The problem is that the cable, which would be buried under the seabed, is what grid officials call a “multidriver project,” or a project that is undertaken for more than one reason — something that those officials have little experience with.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Breaking New Ground on Grid Rules', 'kicker': 'Green', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Electric Light and Power', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Regulation and Deregulation of Industry', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Wind Power', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Atlantic Wind Connection', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Federal Energy Regulatory Commission', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'PJM Interconnection', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New Jersey', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-15T17:48:59+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Science', 'subsection_name': 'Environment', 'byline': {'original': 'By Matthew L. Wald', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Matthew', 'middlename': 'L.', 'lastname': 'Wald', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7638ad4a-2195-55d3-8a17-6e149904d3e9', 'word_count': 728, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7638ad4a-2195-55d3-8a17-6e149904d3e9'}, {'abstract': 'President Obama will formally unveil his plans for reducing gun violence at a White House event Wednesday.', 'web_url': 'https://thecaucus.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/15/obama-set-to-announce-plans-to-address-gun-violence/', 'snippet': 'President Obama will formally unveil his plans for reducing gun violence at a White House event Wednesday.', 'lead_paragraph': '1:30 p.m. | Updated  President Obama will formally unveil his plans for reducing gun violence at a White House event Wednesday just before noon, standing side by side with gun control advocates, White House officials said on Tuesday.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Obama Set to Announce Plans to Address Gun Violence', 'kicker': 'The Caucus', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Gun Control', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Newtown, Conn, Shooting (2012)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Mayors Against Illegal Guns', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-15T17:49:19+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael D. Shear', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/26f226e7-2693-5f2c-b57f-021acbd5b7f4', 'word_count': 299, 'uri': 'nyt://article/26f226e7-2693-5f2c-b57f-021acbd5b7f4'}, {'abstract': 'In describing wines, some words have unjustly negative connotations. A “bitter” or “green” wine can actually be a good one.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/16/dining/in-describing-wines-5-words-not-to-fear.html', 'snippet': 'In describing wines, some words have unjustly negative connotations. A “bitter” or “green” wine can actually be a good one.', 'lead_paragraph': 'GOOD wines have stories to tell, but sadly, they are at a loss for words. As articulate as a fine wine may be, it is left to humans to supply the translation. ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/16/dining/16POUR_SPAN/16POUR-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/01/16/dining/16POUR_SPAN/16POUR-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/16/dining/16POUR_SPAN/16POUR-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 710, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/16/dining/16POUR_SPAN/16POUR-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1321, 'width': 1906, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/16/dining/16POUR_SPAN/16POUR-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/01/16/dining/16POUR_SPAN/16PO