istical support, but would not send any ground troops to Mali.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MADRID — Defense Secretary Leon E. Panetta said Tuesday that France faced a difficult task in trying to rout extremists from a vast area in northern Mali and that the Pentagon remained in talks with the French over what kind of military aid the United States would provide.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Panetta Says U.S. Still in Talks With French Over Mali Aid', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Panetta Says U.S. Still in Talks With French Over Mali Aid', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'France', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Mali', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Panetta, Leon E', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Defense Department', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-15T21:33:33+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Africa', 'byline': {'original': 'By Elisabeth Bumiller', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Elisabeth', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bumiller', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ac0c07d5-778a-5db8-b7e6-3f052056c5b2', 'word_count': 290, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ac0c07d5-778a-5db8-b7e6-3f052056c5b2'}, {'abstract': '“I, Malvolio,” a one-man show by Tim Crouch (with a little audience assistance), takes a “Twelfth Night” character out of context for the fun of it.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/16/theater/reviews/tim-crouchs-i-malvolio-at-the-duke-on-42nd-street.html', 'snippet': '“I, Malvolio,” a one-man show by Tim Crouch (with a little audience assistance), takes a “Twelfth Night” character out of context for the fun of it.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The boy from the audience has been instructed to aim for “the nirvana somewhere between comedy and pain.” So the boy, who looks to be about 10, delivers a swift kick to the rear end of the scowling fellow in soiled long johns. Pretty much everybody at the Duke on 42nd Street laughs, as people are expected to at this basic bit of slapstick.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/16/arts/16MALVOLIO/16MALVOLIO-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/01/16/arts/16MALVOLIO/16MALVOLIO-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/16/arts/16MALVOLIO/16MALVOLIO-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/16/arts/16MALVOLIO/16MALVOLIO-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/16/arts/16MALVOLIO/16MALVOLIO-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/01/16/arts/16MALVOLIO/16MALVOLIO-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 