3 National Endowment for the Arts Jazz Masters — Eddie Palmieri, Mose Allison, Lou Donaldson and Lorraine Gordon — were honored on Monday at Dizzy’s Club Coca-Cola.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/16/arts/2013-nea-jazz-masters-are-honored.html', 'snippet': 'The 2013 National Endowment for the Arts Jazz Masters — Eddie Palmieri, Mose Allison, Lou Donaldson and Lorraine Gordon — were honored on Monday at Dizzy’s Club Coca-Cola.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Eddie Palmieri was eager to share the glory when he accepted his 2013 National Endowment for the Arts Jazz Masters award, at Dizzy’s Club Coca-Cola on Monday night. Taking the podium, he recalled the first time he heard his fellow pianist McCoy Tyner, at Birdland in the mid-1960s with the John Coltrane Quartet. Mr. Palmieri, whose band was then in residence just up the block at the Palladium Ballroom, described being transfixed.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/16/arts/MASTERS1/MASTERS1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/01/16/arts/MASTERS1/MASTERS1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/16/arts/MASTERS1/MASTERS1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/16/arts/MASTERS1/MASTERS1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/16/arts/MASTERS1/MASTERS1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width'