74f95ec4d8a'}, {'abstract': 'Still deft at irking opponents, Joakim Noah of the Chicago Bulls is averaging season highs in points, assists, blocks and minutes.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/16/sports/basketball/joakim-noah-steps-up-his-game-for-the-chicago-bulls.html', 'snippet': 'Still deft at irking opponents, Joakim Noah of the Chicago Bulls is averaging season highs in points, assists, blocks and minutes.', 'lead_paragraph': 'DEERFIELD, Ill. — Of all the taunts he has heard, and there have been plenty, Joakim Noah has a favorite. It came when he was in college at the University of Florida, playing in Kentucky’s Rupp Arena. During a timeout late in the game, with his Gators handily beating the Wildcats, Noah looked into the crowd, which was a sea of blue, and screamed at the top of his lungs, “It’s quiet in here!” ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/16/sports/YBULLS/YBULLS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1006, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/16/sports/YBULLS/YBULLS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2012, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/16/sports/YBULLS/YBULLS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/01/16/sports/YBULLS/YBULLS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/16/sports/YBULLS/YBULLS-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 't