s’ Scott Gomez to resume their careers.', 'web_url': 'https://slapshot.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/15/redden-and-gomez-are-close-to-buyouts/', 'snippet': 'N.H.L. and the players’ association reached an agreement to allow teams to use one of their two compliance buyouts this season, a move that will allow the Rangers’ Wade Redden and the Canadiens’ Scott Gomez to resume their careers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The N.H.L. and the players’ association have agreed to accelerated compliance buyouts that could enable Wade Redden and Scott Gomez to resume their N.H.L. careers as soon as Saturday.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/17/sports/golf/17redden/17redden-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 731, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/17/sports/golf/17redden/17redden-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1463, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/17/sports/golf/17redden/17redden-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/01/17/sports/golf/17redden/17redden-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/17/sports/golf/17redden/17redden-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Redden and Gomez Are Close to Buyouts', 'kicker': 'Slap Shot', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Sports Briefing | Hockey', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 's