urning Fuel Particles Do More Damage To Climate Than Thought, Study Says', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rosenthal, Elisabeth', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Global Warming', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Research', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Intergovernmental Panel on Climate Change', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Greenhouse Gas Emissions', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Journal of Geophysical Research-Atmospheres', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-16T01:44:34+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'Science', 'subsection_name': 'Environment', 'byline': {'original': 'By Elisabeth Rosenthal', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Elisabeth', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rosenthal', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/03f593f8-266a-529d-a1a6-5d52ea3b7cc4', 'word_count': 828, 'uri': 'nyt://article/03f593f8-266a-529d-a1a6-5d52ea3b7cc4'}, {'abstract': 'Residents of Cholula, Mexico, known for its wealth of old churches, have organized patrols in response to the theft of religious art and the lack of official response.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/16/world/americas/looting-of-cholula-churches-stirs-locals-to-action.html', 'snippet': 'Residents of Cholula, Mexico, known for its wealth of old churches, have organized patrols in response to the theft of religious art and the lack of official response.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CHOLULA, Mexico — Three men, field laborers by day, huddle on a bench as night descends, a mess of empty bottles of hard liquor strewn nearby. Another man gets a refresher on how to ring the bell in case of emergency. One listens attentively to orders from their leader.', 'print_sect