uires that, for the next 120 days, no information about gun permit holders in a new statewide registration database is made available publicly.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/16/nyregion/new-yorks-new-gun-law-restricts-public-access-to-permit-data.html', 'snippet': 'The New York law requires that, for the next 120 days, no information about gun permit holders in a new statewide registration database is made available publicly.', 'lead_paragraph': 'New York State’s new gun law seeks to restrict ownership of certain weapons. But it also restricts something else: access to previously public information about gun permits.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Legislature Restricts Access to Gun Permit Data', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Legislature Restricts Access to Permit Data', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Haughney, Christine', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Gun Control', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Law and Legislation', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York State', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Journal News, The', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Freedom of the Press', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Freedom of Information Act', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Threats and Threatening Messages', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Privacy', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-16T01:58:29+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Christine Haughney', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Christine', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Haughney', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank'