rticle/7292f926-83b5-52a0-9492-25b29287a140'}, {'abstract': 'Following the admission by Lance Armstrong that he used performance-enhancing drugs, critics have seized on the role of sponsors who may choose to stand by quietly.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/16/sports/cycling/critics-take-a-look-upstream-in-doping-scandals.html', 'snippet': 'Following the admission by Lance Armstrong that he used performance-enhancing drugs, critics have seized on the role of sponsors who may choose to stand by quietly.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The case against Lance Armstrong by antidoping officials detailed how Armstrong, as the leader of his professional cycling team, used performance-enhancing drugs over many years to fuel his run as a seven-time Tour de France champion. It detailed the lengths that many teammates, trainers, doctors and other associates went to enable him to pull off what was called the most sophisticated doping program in the sport’s history.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/16/sports/YJPCYCLING/YJPCYCLING-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 853, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/16/sports/YJPCYCLING/YJPCYCLING-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1453, 'width': 1744, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/16/sports/YJPCYCLING/YJPCYCLING-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/01/16/sports/YJPCYCLING/YJPCYCLING-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': 