 downhill and the Australian Open.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/16/sports/20130116photoreplay-slide-XHW8/20130116photoreplay-slide-XHW8-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 614, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/16/sports/20130116photoreplay-slide-XHW8/20130116photoreplay-slide-XHW8-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1227, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/16/sports/20130116photoreplay-slide-XHW8/20130116photoreplay-slide-XHW8-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/01/16/sports/20130116photoreplay-slide-XHW8/20130116photoreplay-slide-XHW8-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/16/sports/20130116photoreplay-slide-XHW8/20130116photoreplay-slide-XHW8-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Photo Replay: January 16', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Skiing', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tennis', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Golf', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Basketball', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-16T17:09:40+0000', 'document_type': 'multimedia', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Slideshow', '_id': 'nyt://slideshow/1c9c5624-df8e-5cf5-80e2-117eb96ab5d2', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://slideshow/1c9c5624-df8e-5cf5-80e2-117eb96ab5d2'}, {'abstract': 'A Web video published by the gun rights group suggested that the president was an “elitist” because his two daughters have protection while he opposes posting armed guards at schools.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/17/us/politics/nra-attacks-obama-in-video.html', 'snippet': 'A Web video published by the gun rights group suggested that the president was an “elitist” because his two daughters have protection while he opposes posting armed guards at schools.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — The National Rifle Association provoked a furious response from the White House on Wednesday by releasing a video accusing President Obama of being an “elitist” and a “hypocrite” because he opposes posting armed guards at schools, while his daughters have Secret Service protection.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'White House Denounces Web Video by N.R.A.', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'White House Denounces Web Video By N.R.A.', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Rifle Assn', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Gun Control', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Newtown, Conn, Shooting (2012)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Video Recordings and Downloads', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-16T17:21:32+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael D. Shear', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qu