sh, my colleagues Lark Turner and Alan Cowell reported.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Video Shows Flaming Wreckage After Helicopter Crash in London', 'kicker': 'The Lede', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Aviation Accidents and Safety', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Helicopters', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'London (England)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-16T20:36:55+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Blogs', 'byline': {'original': 'By Christine Hauser', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Christine', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hauser', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5c2997f9-fba2-59b2-b3f8-8317a766467d', 'word_count': 422, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5c2997f9-fba2-59b2-b3f8-8317a766467d'}, {'abstract': 'The 2013 Guangzhou Trumpchi is based on the Alfa Romeo 166.', 'web_url': 'https://wheels.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/16/alfa-romeo-returns-to-america-via-china/', 'snippet': 'The 2013 Guangzhou Trumpchi is based on the Alfa Romeo 166.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Introduced on Tuesday, Jan. 15: 2007 Alfa Romeo 166 … check that, it’s now a 2013 Guangzhou Trumpchi', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Alfa Romeo Returns to America, via China', 'kicker': 'Wheels', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobiles', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Fiat SpA', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Detroit (Mich)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-16T20:37:12+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Aut