SB news releases, which means fewer pocket-size collectors’ items for those covering the show.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Manufacturers were still giving out flash drives containing press materials at the 2013 Detroit auto show, but not as many as at past shows. More companies are switching to either paper releases or just telling reporters to go to their media sites for the information. This just builds one’s appreciation for the drives that are handed out.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Megabytes From the Motor Show: The Final Chapter?', 'kicker': 'Wheels', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobiles', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'North American International Auto Show', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'ACURA DIVISION OF HONDA MOTOR CO', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Chevrolet Division of General Motors Corp', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Hyundai Motor Co', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Infiniti Division of Nissan Motor Co', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Jeep Division of Chrysler', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Kia Motors Corp', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Nissan Motor Co', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Volkswagen AG', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-17T00:34:33+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Automobiles', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sam Schembari', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sam', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Schembari', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0f06cf10-7808-5731-