.com/2013/01/17/double-duty-tests-serena-williamss-ankle-and-it-holds-up/', 'snippet': 'Serena Williams’s injured ankle held up well through a singles and doubles match on Thursday at the Australian Open.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MELBOURNE, Australia — There may never have been so much doubt about how a player would respond after a 6-0, 6-0 victory.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Double Duty Tests Serena Williams’s Ankle, And it Holds Up', 'kicker': 'Straight Sets', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-01-17T17:42:55+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Tennis', 'byline': {'original': 'By BEN ROTHENBERG', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ben', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'ROTHENBERG', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/effa4041-d206-55a9-b136-41db8139e642', 'word_count': 631, 'uri': 'nyt://article/effa4041-d206-55a9-b136-41db8139e642'}, {'abstract': 'Holly Hotchner announced she will step down in April, after 16 years in charge.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/17/museum-of-arts-and-design-director-announces-departure/', 'snippet': 'Holly Hotchner announced she will step down in April, after 16 years in charge.', 'lead_paragraph': 'After 16 years as the director of the Museum of Arts and Design, Holly Hotchner, 61, has announced that she will step down from her position at the end of April.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Museum of Arts and Design Director Announces Departure', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gordon, David', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hot