 the woods on a trip around this Southern city.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Take a bite of this town’s motor-to-mortar movement and play a round of golf in the woods on a trip around this Southern city.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/17/travel/36durham-slide-73B0/36durham-slide-73B0-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/17/travel/36durham-slide-73B0/36durham-slide-73B0-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/17/travel/36durham-slide-73B0/36durham-slide-73B0-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/01/17/travel/36durham-slide-73B0/36durham-slide-73B0-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/17/travel/36durham-slide-73B0/36durham-slide-73B0-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Dining, Discs and More in Durham, N.C.', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Durham (NC)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Travel and Vacations', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-17T18:19:01+0000', 'document_type': 'multimedia', 'news_desk': 'Travel', 'section_name': 'Travel', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Slideshow', '_id': 'nyt://slideshow/7a6afd87-8a09-5686-9d71-6a9fbebcf361', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://slideshow/7a6afd87-8a09-5686-9d71-6a9fbebcf361'}, {'abstract': 'In North Carolina’s re-energized Bull City, the emphasis is on culture and cuisine rather than tobacco and textiles.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/20/travel/36-hours-in-durham-nc.html', 'snippet': 'In North Carolina’s re-energized Bull City, the emphasis is on culture and cuisine rather than tobacco and textiles.', 'lead_paragraph': 'THE tobacco and textile industries left their imprint on Durham long ago, but now the historic brick mills and repurposed factories form the backdrop of North Carolina’s re-energized Bull City. Recently, artist studios and upstart galleries have multiplied in the flourishing downtown area, where new bakeries, pizzerias, tapas bars and food trucks — and trailers and buses and even the odd tricycle — seem to surface at every turn. Since Big Tobacco is dead, consider this cool mix of culture and food the new Durham blend.', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/20/travel/20HOURS_SPAN-sf/20HOURS_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 493, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/01/20/travel/20HOURS_SPAN-sf/20HOURS_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 493}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/20/travel/20HOURS_SPAN-sf/20HOURS_SPAN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 842, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/20/travel/20HOURS_SPAN-sf/20HOURS_SPAN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1684, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': '