: 'Laura Robson toppled Petra Kvitova at the Australian Open by concentrating on competing, not hitting winners.', 'web_url': 'https://straightsets.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/17/robson-does-the-dirty-work-in-beating-kvitova/', 'snippet': 'Laura Robson toppled Petra Kvitova at the Australian Open by concentrating on competing, not hitting winners.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Laura Robson of Great Britain prevailed over Petra Kvitova of the Czech Republic in an error-filled match at the Australia Open Friday that was nonetheless dramatic. In a match pitting two powerful lefthanders, each seeking to take control of the point with big first-strike tennis, Robson made the necessary adjustments to will her way to a stunning upset, 2-6, 6-3, 11-9, over Kvitova, the No. 8 seed and the 2011 Wimbledon champion. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Robson Does the Dirty Work in Beating Kvitova', 'kicker': 'Straight Sets', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-01-17T19:52:47+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Tennis', 'byline': {'original': 'By GEOFF MACDONALD', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Geoff', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'MACDONALD', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4acaff3d-547a-5e6e-82fd-6ee0404bea34', 'word_count': 474, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4acaff3d-547a-5e6e-82fd-6ee0404bea34'}, {'abstract': 'Men’s fall 2013 collections in Paris.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2013/01/17/fashion/vannoten_mens_fall2013.html', 'snippet': 'Men’s fall 2013 collections in Paris.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Men’s fall 2013 collections in Paris.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': '