mbrella,” which was shortlisted for the Man Booker Prize, a new drug helps to awaken an elderly woman in 1971 after nearly five decades in a stupor.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Ken Kesey, the author of that great American novel of mental illness “One Flew Over the Cuckoo’s Nest,” once cited with approval a precept of his father’s: “Good writing ain’t necessarily good reading.” ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '27', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/18/arts/18BOOKSELF/18BOOKSELF-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 657, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/18/arts/18BOOKSELF/18BOOKSELF-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1314, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/18/arts/18BOOKSELF/18BOOKSELF-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/01/18/arts/18BOOKSELF/18BOOKSELF-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/18/arts/18BOOKSELF/18BOOKSELF-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Swollen Stream of Consciousness', 'kicker': 'Books of The Times', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Swollen Stream Of Consciousness', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Umbrella (Book)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Garner, Dwight', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Self, Wi