 as 20 points in the first half, then held off a third-quarter rally.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/18/sports/basketball/carmelo-anthony-leads-knicks-over-pistons-in-london.html', 'snippet': 'The Knicks, feeding off Carmelo Anthony, jumped on the Pistons early, by as many as 20 points in the first half, then held off a third-quarter rally.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — It was London, but it could have been Midtown Manhattan. With Spike Lee courtside, with the Detroit Pistons not looking any more formidable in England than they do at Madison Square Garden, the Knicks rolled to a 102-87 victory Thursday that had most of the sellout crowd of 18,689 cheering in approval. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/18/sports/18knicks4/18knicks4-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 768, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/18/sports/18knicks4/18knicks4-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1536, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/18/sports/18knicks4/18knicks4-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/01/18/sports/18knicks4/18knicks4-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/18/sports/18knicks4/18knicks4-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'With Crowd on Their Side, Anthony and the Knicks Romp in London', 'kicker': 'Knicks 102, Pistons 87', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'With Crowd on Their Side, Anthony and the Knicks Romp in London', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Detroit Pistons', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cotton, Steven', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Knicks', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Basketball', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'ANTHONY, CARMELO', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-17T23:18:43+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Basketball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Steven Cotton', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Steven', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cotton', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/fe56632f-e9ee-5826-82b4-b7aba65f738f', 'word_count': 839, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fe56632f-e9ee-5826-82b4-b7aba65f738f'}, {'abstract': '“Hors Satan,” Bruno Dumont’s latest film, is set in the French countryside and uses natural sounds as a storytelling tool.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/18/movies/hors-satan-directed-by-bruno-dumont.html', 'snippet': '“Hors Satan,” Bruno Dumont’s latest film, is set in the French countryside and uses natural sounds as a storytelling tool.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In his “Notes on Cinematography,” the great French director Robert Bresson argued against the use of music in films. “Noises must become music,” he wrote. Many of Bresson’s techniques and ideas — the employment of nonprofessional actors, the adaptation of naturalistic means to spiritual ends — have taken hold among European filmmakers in the past decade or so. Perhaps nowhere more strikingly than in the work of Bruno Dumont, whose second feature, “Humanité,” won the Grand Prix in Cannes in 1999, the year of Bresson’s death.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/18/arts/18HORS_SPAN/18HORS_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/01/18/arts/18HORS_SPAN/18HORS_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/18/arts/18HORS_SPAN/18HORS_SPAN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/18/arts/18HORS_SPAN/18HORS_SPAN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/18/arts/18HORS_SPAN/18HORS_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/01/18/arts/18HORS_SPAN/18HORS_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/18/arts/18HORS_SPAN/18HORS_SPAN-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Minimalism Wrapped in a Mystery', 'kicker': 'Movie Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Minimalism Wrapped in a Mystery', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Outside Satan (Movie)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'n