Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cooper', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/fa470658-2ef4-533b-8c38-fbbf1f49b0f3', 'word_count': 872, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fa470658-2ef4-533b-8c38-fbbf1f49b0f3'}, {'abstract': 'The computer mogul Michael Dell, in talks to acquire the company he started as a teenager, has built a reputation as a shrewd investor.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2013/01/17/michael-dells-empire-in-a-buyout-spotlight/', 'snippet': 'The computer mogul Michael Dell, in talks to acquire the company he started as a teenager, has built a reputation as a shrewd investor.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The computer empire of Michael S. Dell spreads across a campus of low-slung buildings in Round Rock, Tex.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Michael Dell’s Empire in a Buyout Spotlight', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Michael Dell’s Empire In a Buyout Spotlight', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mergers, Acquisitions and Divestitures', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Dell, Michael S', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Dell Inc', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'MSD Capital LP', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-18T02:09:33+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Peter Lattman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Peter', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Lattman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/50d00ccf-a125-5359-9499-5aa3e838ec9b', 'word_count': 1189, 'uri': 'nyt://article/50d00ccf-a125-5359-9499-5aa3e838ec9b'}, {'abstract': 'Too many state lawmakers would rather bow before the gun lobby than promote public safety.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/18/opinion/the-states-confront-gun-violence.html', 'snippet': 'Too many state lawmakers would rather bow before the gun lobby than promote public safety.', 'lead_paragraph': 'State lawmakers in Wyoming didn’t need to hear President Obama’s gun-control proposals on Wednesday in order to attack them. A week ago, before the White House had even decided what actions to take, Republicans introduced a bill in the Wyoming Legislature to block any federal limitation on firearms, such as an assault weapons ban. A federal agent seeking to enforce such a ban would be guilty of a felony and face five years in prison.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '26', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The States Confront Gun Violence', 'kicker': 'Editorial | The Gun Challenge', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The States Confront Gun Violence', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Gun Control', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Law and Legislation', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'States (US)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Rifle Assn', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Series', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-18T02:14:44+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/895dc2e5-fbd3-57b5-8d96-062cb56176bc', 'word_count': 693, 'uri': 'nyt://article/895dc2e5-fbd3-57b5-8d96-062cb56176bc'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Citron’s financial actions astounded bankers and bureaucrats, and put the county in bankruptcy in 1994, and himself in prison the following year.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/18/business/robert-citron-culprit-in-california-fraud-dies-at-87.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Citron’s financial actions astounded bankers and bureaucrats, and put the county in bankruptcy in 1994, and himself in prison the following year.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Robert L. Citron, who as treasurer of Orange County, Calif., engaged in financial actions that astounded bankers and bureaucrats until his bold bets put the county in bankruptcy in 1994 and himself in prison the next year, died on Wednesday in Orange, Calif. He was 87. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '24', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/18/business/CITRON-obit/CITRON-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 340, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/01/18/business/CITRON-obit/CITRON-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 340}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/18/business/CITRON-obit/CITRON-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/18/business/CITRON-obit/CITRON-obit-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1277, 'width': 1915, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/18/business/CITRON-obit/CITRON-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/01/18/business/CITRON-obit/CITRON-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/18/business/CITRON-obit/CITRON-obit-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Robert Citron, Culprit in California Fraud, Dies at 87', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Robert Citron, 87, Culprit in California Fraud', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Citron, Robert L', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Martin, Douglas', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Orange County (Calif)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Obituaries)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-18T02:17:59+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Douglas Martin', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Douglas', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Martin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Obituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/26aa1d4c-f090-5674-bee0-0bb117f1a9b6', 'word_count': 784, 'uri': 'nyt://article/26aa1d4c-f090-5674-bee0-0bb117f1a9b6'}, {'abstract': 'Thomas Weisel, who bankrolled Lance Armstrong through seven Tour de France wins, said in his first public comment on the matter that he never personally saw an instance of doping on the team.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2013/01/17/thomas-weisel-banker-behind-armstrong-says-he-was-unaware-of-doping/', 'snippet': 'Thomas Weisel, who bankrolled Lance Armstrong through seven Tour de France wins, said in his first public comment on the matter that he never personally saw an instance of doping on the team.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The financier Thomas Weisel recently boxed up the bright-yellow cycling jerseys that lined an entire wall of his office, which overlooks San Francisco’s harbor. They were gifts from Lance Armstrong, a longtime friend whom Mr. Weisel had bankrolled through seven Tour de France wins.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Banker Behind Armstrong Says He Was Unaware of Doping', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Banker Says He Was Unaware of Doping', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bicycles and Bicycling', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Doping (Sports)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tour de France (Bicycle Race)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'ARMSTRONG, LANCE', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Weisel, Thomas', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-18T02:18:10+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Susanne Craig', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Susanne', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Craig', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0bce3108-5d65-55af-8f95-7c056330b56c', 'word_count': 1166, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0bce3108-5d65-55af-8f95-7c056330b56c'}, {'abstract': 'A powerful storm tossed the luxury cruise liner M.S. Silver Explorer, injuring four crew members and fraying the nerves of 90 students from the elite Hotchkiss School in Lakeville, Conn.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/18/nyregion/hotchkiss-students-on-antarctic-trip-encounter-whales-and-30-foot-wave.html', 'snippet': 'A powerful storm tossed the luxury cruise liner M.S. Silver Explorer, injuring four crew members and fraying the nerves of 90 students from the elite Hotchkiss School in Lakeville, Conn.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For private