309819576', 'word_count': 768, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8d8f87c1-3e2d-57d0-84d2-233309819576'}, {'abstract': 'The signature of President Hugo Chávez appeared on a government decree this week though Mr. Chávez has not been seen or heard from since undergoing cancer surgery in Cuba in December.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/18/world/americas/appearance-of-chavezs-signature-riles-critics.html', 'snippet': 'The signature of President Hugo Chávez appeared on a government decree this week though Mr. Chávez has not been seen or heard from since undergoing cancer surgery in Cuba in December.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CARACAS, Venezuela — A tempest in an ink pot has broken out over the signature of President Hugo Chávez, which suddenly appeared on a government decree this week despite his long absence from the country. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Critics Question Chávez Signature on an Official Decree', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Critics Question Chávez Signature on an Official Decree', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Venezuela', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Chavez, Hugo', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Handwriting', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Cuba', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-18T03:45:56+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Americas', 'byline': {'original': 'By William Neuman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'William', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Neuman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/22704cb5-818b-5fc0-bee9-fd811571ed20', 'word_count': 425, 'uri': 'nyt://article/22704cb5-818b-5fc0-bee9-fd811571ed20'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Gallinari helped kidnap Prime Minister Aldo Moro of Italy, who was killed after 55 days in captivity.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/18/world/europe/prospero-gallinari-member-of-red-brigades-dies-at-62.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Gallinari helped kidnap Prime Minister Aldo Moro of Italy, who was killed after 55 days in captivity.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Prospero Gallinari, who as a member of the Italian terrorist group the Red Brigades was convicted in the kidnapping and assassination in 1978 of Aldo Moro, the Italian prime minister, died Monday after collapsing at his home in Reggio Emilia, in northern Italy. He was 62. He was long believed to have been the gunman in the killing until a comrade took responsibility. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '25', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/18/world/GALLINARI-obit/GALLINARI-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/01/18/world/GALLINARI-obit/GALLINARI-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/18/world/GALLINARI-obit/GALLINARI-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 778, 'width': 778, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/18/world/GALLINARI-obit/GALLINARI-obit-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 778, 'width': 778, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/18/world/GALLINARI-obit/GALLINARI-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbna