//article/814aaa91-3ea2-5de3-bb5e-6aab552187e3', 'word_count': 770, 'uri': 'nyt://article/814aaa91-3ea2-5de3-bb5e-6aab552187e3'}, {'abstract': 'When this owner’s boutique advertising agency suggests outreach, the reaction has been one of surprise, intrigue and excitement — followed by little or no action.', 'web_url': 'https://boss.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/18/are-businesses-hesitant-to-connect-with-hispanic-consumers/', 'snippet': 'When this owner’s boutique advertising agency suggests outreach, the reaction has been one of surprise, intrigue and excitement — followed by little or no action.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As we learned in the recent presidential election, it’s always a good idea to connect with Hispanic Americans. In many parts of the country, this is as true in business as it is in politics. But for some reason, many businesses seem hesitant to try to appeal to this big and important demographic.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Are Businesses Hesitant to Connect With Hispanic Consumers?', 'kicker': 'You&#039;re the Boss', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ADVERTISING AND MARKETING', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hispanic-Americans', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Small Business', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Spanish Language', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Austin (Tex)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-18T15:36:51+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Entrepreneurship', 'byline': {'original': 'By MP Mueller', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mp', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Mueller', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3359edef-2aeb-552d-96ae-eb04ed9d512b', 'word_count': 878, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3359edef-2aeb-552d-96ae-eb04ed9d512b'}, {'abstract': 'Self-help memoirs take on not the exceptional challenge, but the everyday one.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/20/books/review/self-help-memoirs-take-on-everyday-challenges.html', 'snippet': 'Self-help memoirs take on not the exceptional challenge, but the everyday one.', 'lead_paragraph': 'About halfway through her new memoir, “Data, a Love Story,” Amy Webb pauses to address the reader. Up to this point, the author’s online hunt for a husband has yielded little but farcically bad dates. In frustration she begins an analysis involving scatter plots and word clouds to discern the laws of success in online dating. “I want to reveal what I found,” she tells us, “so that you can improve your own dating profile.” (Spoiler alert: showing skin is a plus; lengthy “About Me” sections are a turnoff.) We then follow Webb as she uses her discoveries to lure Mr. Right. And, presumably, we close the book with a sense of how to do the same.', 'print_section': 'BR', 'print_page': '27', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/20/books/review/0120-Tuhus-Dubrow/0120-Tuhus-Dubrow-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 857, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/20/books/review/0120-Tuhus-Dubrow/0120-Tuhus-Dubrow-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1109, 'width': 928, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/20/books/review/0120-Tuhus-Dubrow/0120-Tuhus-Dubrow-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail':