4db-ab47-86057b3623ce'}, {'abstract': 'Food-related events around New York.', 'web_url': 'https://dinersjournal.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/18/weekend-fare-125/', 'snippet': 'Food-related events around New York.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Zlatne Uste Golden Festival in Brooklyn celebrates Balkan and Gypsy music at Grand Prospect Hall, 263 Prospect Avenue, in Park Slope. Events will run on Friday from 7:30 p.m. to 12:30 a.m., and tickets are $35 at the door or $30 in advance online. On Saturday, the festival will run from 6 p.m. to 2 a.m., and tickets are $55 at the door and $48 in advance. Children ages 12 and under are free.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Weekend Fare', 'kicker': 'Diner&#039;s Journal', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-01-18T18:07:20+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bao Ong', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bao', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ong', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8d9070e4-0391-5964-9441-353a5f68f03c', 'word_count': 268, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8d9070e4-0391-5964-9441-353a5f68f03c'}, {'abstract': 'Bored of your iPhone or Android phone? Nokia is turning its Lumia phones into a bit of an arts-and-crafts project. You can print your own cases for them on a 3-D printer.', 'web_url': 'https://bits.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/18/nokia-print-cases/', 'snippet': 'Bored of your iPhone or Android phone? Nokia is turning its Lumia phones into a bit of an arts-and-crafts project. You can print your own cases for them on a 3-D printer.', 'lead_paragraph': ' Nokia is turning its Lumia phones into a bit of an arts-and-crafts project. Now you can print your own cases for them.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0,