 pine beetles left alone have drastically increased their uptake of nitrate, thereby protecting watersheds, a study finds.', 'web_url': 'https://green.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/18/after-a-die-off-runts-to-the-rescue/', 'snippet': 'The small trees that pine beetles left alone have drastically increased their uptake of nitrate, thereby protecting watersheds, a study finds.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It doesn’t take an expert to understand that logging and violent storms cause massive damage to forests. What is less obvious, however, is the devastating effect that the removal of trees and vegetation can have on streams and lakes. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'After a Die-Off, Runts to the Rescue', 'kicker': 'Green', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-01-18T20:29:05+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Science', 'subsection_name': 'Environment', 'byline': {'original': 'By Joanna M. Foster', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Joanna', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4032be13-af1e-5951-a146-c1592d1a90a1', 'word_count': 467, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4032be13-af1e-5951-a146-c1592d1a90a1'}, {'abstract': 'On the third day of the strike, here are three submissions, but more drawings are welcome about the strike (as well as for the last assignment, Miss America in Brooklyn).', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/18/kids-draw-the-news-bus-strike-comic-strip/', 'snippet': 'On the third day of the strike, here are three submissions, but more drawings are welcome about the strike (as well as for the last assignment, Miss America in Brooklyn).', 'lead_paragraph': 'Updated | Feb. 4, 2013 We are no accepting submissions for the Kids Draw the News assignment about