/c1e66065-4ccf-5032-af94-3d902d89a1ab'}, {'abstract': 'Leeks usually come from the market full of soil.', 'web_url': 'https://dinersjournal.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/18/the-many-ways-to-clean-a-leek/', 'snippet': 'Leeks usually come from the market full of soil.', 'lead_paragraph': 'This week’s video shows one way to clean a leek, which will come in handy if you make the farro salad recipe from my column.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Many Ways to Clean a Leek', 'kicker': 'Diner&#039;s Journal', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-01-18T21:42:24+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Melissa Clark', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Melissa', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Clark', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/bbbdddfe-480b-527c-829e-a768118cfae2', 'word_count': 136, 'uri': 'nyt://article/bbbdddfe-480b-527c-829e-a768118cfae2'}, {'abstract': 'A bar on Avenue C is an homage to the classic 1949 movie, complete with a cocktail named for the character Harry Lime.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/18/booming/a-quiet-drink-the-third-man-on-avenue-c.html', 'snippet': 'A bar on Avenue C is an homage to the classic 1949 movie, complete with a cocktail named for the character Harry Lime.', 'lead_paragraph': 'J Rosser Lomax, the head bartender at the new bar The Third Man, has just finished chopping ice from a pan the size of a bake-sale sheet cake when he strikes up a conversation. Topics on a chilly January night include the joy of Brooklyn rooftop gatherings, the bar scenes in Boston (disappointing) and Philadelphia (surprisingly robust), and the music of choice at some of the parties that have been held at The Third Man (techno, blasting).', 'sou