': 'nyt://article/e461acec-a9ff-5729-a866-e6847863bb48'}, {'abstract': 'The political committee American Future Fund and the Americans for a Strong Defense have started advertising campaigns to persuade Democratic senators to oppose Chuck Hagel’s nomination as defense secretary.', 'web_url': 'https://thecaucus.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/18/conservative-group-airs-ad-against-schumer-for-support-of-hagel/', 'snippet': 'The political committee American Future Fund and the Americans for a Strong Defense have started advertising campaigns to persuade Democratic senators to oppose Chuck Hagel’s nomination as defense secretary.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Conservative groups are piling on advertising in hopes of swaying Democratic senators against Chuck Hagel, the nominee to become defense secretary. On Friday, Americans for a Strong Defense joined in with an ad aimed at Senator Kay Hagan of North Carolina. It followed close behind the American Future Fund ad, which is aimed at Senator Charles E. Schumer of New York.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Conservative Groups Air Ads Pressuring Senators on Hagel', 'kicker': 'The Caucus', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Political Advertising', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hagel, Chuck', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Schumer, Charles E', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'American Future Fund', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York State', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-18T22:50:29+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jim Rutenberg', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jim', 'middlename': None, 'las