no-wine-bar-and-italian-tapas-in-clifton.html', 'snippet': 'Spuntino Wine Bar and Italian Tapas is owned by a company that operates some Applebee’s and Chevys franchises, but it does not have a chain-restaurant ambience.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There’s little that is lovely about the maze of dreary strip malls and big-box behemoths stretched out along Route 3 in Clifton. The same goes for the dining options in the area, which veer heavily toward the T.G.I. Friday’s end of the spectrum. But there’s an intriguing outlier a stone’s throw from a Target store in the Clifton Commons shopping center: the nine-month-old Spuntino Wine Bar and Italian Tapas.', 'print_section': 'NJ', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/20/nyregion/20DINENJ1/20DINENJ1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/01/20/nyregion/20DINENJ1/20DINENJ1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/20/nyregion/20DINENJ1/20DINENJ1-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/20/nyregion/20DINENJ1/20DINENJ1-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/20/nyregion/20DINENJ1/20DINENJ1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/01/20/nyregion/20DINENJ1/20DINENJ1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank':