won his PGA Tour debut last weekend and is three shots off the lead at the Humana Challenge.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LA QUINTA, Calif. — Rory McIlroy wielded his new Nike clubs like weed whackers, chopping his way around the Abu Dhabi Golf Club this week on his way to consecutive rounds of 75 that left him outside the cut line. Using the same equipment with much less fanfare is another 23-year-old, Russell Henley, who’s quietly off to one of the fastest starts in PGA Tour history.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/19/sports/sub-golf/sub-golf-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 950, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/19/sports/sub-golf/sub-golf-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1900, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/19/sports/sub-golf/sub-golf-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/01/19/sports/sub-golf/sub-golf-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/19/sports/sub-golf/sub-golf-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Tour Rookie May Soon Be an Unknown No Longer', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Tour Rookie May Soon Be an Unknown No Longer', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Golf', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'valu