n Chicago, has watched the Manti Te’o case unfold with great interest. What stands out to him, he said, is the level of engagement with which Notre Dame officials dug into the case, even hiring a private investigative firm to determine whether Te’o, the university’s star linebacker, had been the victim of a hoax.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/19/sports/notre/notre-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 651, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/19/sports/notre/notre-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1302, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'In Notre Dame’s Handling of Two Episodes, Some See Inconsistency', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'In Notre Dame&#8217;s Handling of Two Episodes, Some See Inconsistency ', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'University of Notre Dame', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': "Te'o, Manti", 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Suicides and Suicide Attempts', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sex Crimes', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Swarbrick, Jack', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football (College)', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hoaxes', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Seeberg, Lizzy', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-19T04:32:29+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'College Football', 'byline': {'original': 'By Scott Cacciola', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Scott', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cacciola', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7972f852-8697-501f-85c2-6cd601c81e0e', 'word_count': 808, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7972f852-8697-501f-85c2-6cd601c81e0e'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Chew, an actor best known for his roles in HBO dramas like “The Corner” and “The Wire,” was a well-regarded stage actor when he began appearing in television shows.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/19/arts/television/robert-f-chew-actor-on-the-wire-dies-at-52.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Chew, an actor best known for his roles in HBO dramas like “The Corner” and “The Wire,” was a well-regarded stage actor when he began appearing in television shows.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Robert F. Chew, an actor best known for his roles in gritty HBO dramas like “The Corner” and “The Wire,” died on Thursday at his home in Baltimore. He was 52.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/19/arts/CHEW-obit/CHEW-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 577, 'width': 400, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/19/arts/CHEW-obit/CHEW-obit-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 577, 'width': 400, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/19/arts/CHEW-obit/CHEW-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/01/19/arts/CHEW-obit/CHEW-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank':