a', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gabriel, Trip', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Uranium', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mines and Mining', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Virginia Uranium Inc', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Chatham (Va)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'State Legislatures', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McDonnell, Robert F', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Virginia', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Water', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Water Pollution', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-19T18:44:32+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Trip Gabriel', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Trip', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Gabriel', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0c19def6-23f7-5b1b-b450-3c53fc7466c9', 'word_count': 1225, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0c19def6-23f7-5b1b-b450-3c53fc7466c9'}, {'abstract': 'Brooklyn’s success under P.J. Carlesimo obscures its lack of an identity. But the Knicks, though struggling lately, have the personnel to thrive in the playoffs.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/20/sports/basketball/knicks-and-nets-recent-records-are-deceiving.html', 'snippet': 'Brooklyn’s success under P.J. Carlesimo obscures its lack of an identity. But the Knicks, though struggling lately, have the personnel to thrive in the playoffs.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Though they still cling to the East’s second best record, the Knicks (25-13) are just 7-8 over their last 15 games. In that stretch they dropped three straight to Boston, Indiana and Chicago, the kind of physical, defense-minded teams they will inevitably encounter in the postseason. At the same time, the Nets (24-16) have surged since P. J. Carlesimo replaced Avery Johnson as the coach, winning 10 of their last 12, including an impressive road victory over league-leading Oklahoma City.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/20/sports/YRIVALS1/YRIVALS1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 737, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/20/sports/YRIVALS1/YRIVALS1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1474, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/20/sports/YRIVALS1/YRIVALS1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/01/20/sports/YRIVALS1/YRIVALS1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/20/sports/YRIVALS1/YRIVALS1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Slump and Surge Aren’t Built to Last', 'kicker': 'Analysis', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Slump and Surge Aren’t Built to Last', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Knicks', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mason, Beckley', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Brooklyn Nets', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Basketball', 'rank': 4, 'm