use he is one of the few players on the team with postseason experience.', 'lead_paragraph': 'FLOWERY BRANCH, Ga. — In addition to being a cornerback for the Atlanta Falcons, Asante Samuel considers himself — at least according to the biography on his Twitter page — a “C.E.O. of many things.” Included in that list, it seems, is being the chief critic of the Falcons’ offensive game plan.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/20/sports/dog-falcons/dog-falcons-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 658, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/20/sports/dog-falcons/dog-falcons-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1315, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/20/sports/dog-falcons/dog-falcons-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/01/20/sports/dog-falcons/dog-falcons-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/20/sports/dog-falcons/dog-falcons-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Boisterous Samuel Keeps the Falcons’ Defense Laughing and Learning', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Boisterous Samuel Keeps the Falcons’ Defense Laughing and Learning', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Borden, Sam', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': '