ma” against gun control.', 'lead_paragraph': 'They turned out in the thousands with assault rifles, pistols, American flags raised and, in some cases, placards comparing gun control advocates to Nazis.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Rallies Against Gun Control', 'kicker': 'The Lede', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Gun Control', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-19T21:52:40+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Blogs', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ravi Somaiya', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ravi', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Somaiya', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/64d01cee-b145-5616-9527-30a38453f61f', 'word_count': 270, 'uri': 'nyt://article/64d01cee-b145-5616-9527-30a38453f61f'}, {'abstract': 'David Plouffe, White House senior adviser, joins the Sunday shows to talk about President Obama’s second term.', 'web_url': 'https://thecaucus.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/19/sunday-breakfast-menu-jan-20/', 'snippet': 'David Plouffe, White House senior adviser, joins the Sunday shows to talk about President Obama’s second term.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As President Obama is officially sworn in for his second term Sunday, one of his senior advisers,\xa0David Plouffe, will make the rounds of the Sunday shows to preview what’s in store for the next four years.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Sunday Breakfast Menu, Jan. 20', 'kicker': 'The Caucus', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Inaugurations', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-19T21:53:47+0000', 'docum