y of Carlotta Manaigo.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/20/photos-of-the-moment-ami-alexandre-mattiussi-2/', 'snippet': 'Scenes from the Paris fashion week photo diary of Carlotta Manaigo.', 'lead_paragraph': 'var data;function jsonSlideshowCallback(response){data = response;}NYTD.options = {source: data,cropType: \'blog480\',appendTo: \'fullScreenSlideShow\',showHeadLine: \'false\', renderstyle: "embeddedSlideShowTmag"}', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Photos of The Moment | Ami Alexandre Mattiussi', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-01-20T14:00:35+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Carlotta Manaigo', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Carlotta', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Manaigo', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e19be27d-353b-5746-a385-96a128db207b', 'word_count': 36, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e19be27d-353b-5746-a385-96a128db207b'}, {'abstract': 'I am a woman who supports abortion rights. Before having children, I would have said that reflexively. As a mother, I no longer can.', 'web_url': 'https://parenting.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/20/roe-at-40-judging-a-mothers-choice/', 'snippet': 'I am a woman who supports abortion rights. Before having children, I would have said that reflexively. As a mother, I no longer can.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It began with a knock at the door. An old friend had popped in to visit and told me out of the blue that she was pregnant. I played my giddy role and jumped up to offer her a congratulatory hug.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Roe at 40: Judging a Mother’s Choice', 'kicker': 'Motherlode', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headl