42043b-ef2a-5905-806b-7254ad922d0f'}, {'abstract': 'The Cardinals great Stan Musial was modest in every way except with a baseball bat in his hands.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/21/sports/baseball/stan-musial-substance-over-sizzle.html', 'snippet': 'The Cardinals great Stan Musial was modest in every way except with a baseball bat in his hands.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It needs to be said, over and over again, that Stan the Man was voted by The Sporting News as the best baseball player of the postwar decade, from 1946 through 1955. These were the late years of DiMaggio and Feller, the time of Williams and Robinson, the early years of Mays and Aaron. Stan the Man was considered the best, a potent mix of power and consistency.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/21/sports/baseball/21stan-pic/21stan-pic-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 618, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/21/sports/baseball/21stan-pic/21stan-pic-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1236, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/21/sports/baseball/21stan-pic/21stan-pic-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/01/21/sports/baseball/21stan-pic/21stan-pic-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/21/sports/baseball/21stan-pic/21stan-pic-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'le