cted both cities, as mere inches of snow shut down both roads and runways. After repeated years of cold and precipitation, at what point will we have to stop calling these European snowfalls “unusual”? And when will European airports and transportation authorities start greeting winter with salt and snow plows for what may be the new normal?', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/20/blogs/rdv-weather-paris-london-slide-IDLR/rdv-weather-paris-london-slide-IDLR-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 405, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/01/20/blogs/rdv-weather-paris-london-slide-IDLR/rdv-weather-paris-london-slide-IDLR-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 405}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/20/blogs/rdv-weather-paris-london-slide-IDLR/rdv-weather-paris-london-slide-IDLR-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 692, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/20/blogs/rdv-weather-paris-london-slide-IDLR/rdv-weather-paris-london-slide-IDLR-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1384, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/20/blogs/rdv-weather-paris-london-slide-IDLR/rdv-weather-paris-london-slide-IDLR-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/01/20/blogs/rdv-weather-paris-london-slide-IDLR/rdv-weather-paris-london-slide-IDLR-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 't