 Ben Schrank, revolves around a self-help author who must put his ideas into practice.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The events in “Love Is a Canoe” revolve around the 50th anniversary of the family visit that inspired a tear-tugging, inspirational book by that name. Nostalgists, optimists and masochists either love or hate such books. But the characters in Ben Schrank’s novel have more tortured reactions.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/21/arts/book/book-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 838, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/21/arts/book/book-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1489, 'width': 1218, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/21/arts/book/book-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/01/21/arts/book/book-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/21/arts/book/book-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Writer of Vintage Bromides Finds a Real-Live Lab for His Wisdom', 'kicker': 'Books of The Times', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Writer of Vintage Bromides Finds a Real-Live Lab for His Wisdom', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Writing and Writers', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Schrank, Ben', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'sub