treasury-auctions-set-for-this-week.html', 'snippet': 'The following tax-exempt fixed-income issues are scheduled for pricing this week.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The stock and bond markets will be closed on Monday in observance of Martin Luther King’s Birthday. The Treasury’s schedule of financing this week includes the regular weekly auction of new three- and six-month bills on Tuesday, and the auction of four-week bills on Wednesday. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Treasury Auctions Set for This Week', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Treasury Auctions Set for This Week', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Stocks and Bonds', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Auctions', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-20T23:56:32+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Schedule', '_id': 'nyt://article/ab40f05f-58d1-5e0a-a96d-408aacc125cc', 'word_count': 383, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ab40f05f-58d1-5e0a-a96d-408aacc125cc'}, {'abstract': 'If the issue with smoldering batteries proves more complicated, it could threaten plans to expand production of the planes, and the jobs that go with them.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/21/business/battery-fire-resolution-may-weigh-on-boeing.html', 'snippet': 'If the issue with smoldering batteries proves more complicated, it could threaten plans to expand production of the planes, and the jobs that go with them.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Until smoldering batteries forced safety regulators to ground Boeing’s new 787 Dreamliner jets last week, the aircraft manufacturer was flying high, with soaring profits and a recently regained No. 1 ranking in jet deliveries over Airbus.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'so