arly 60 percent of voters rejected any change to the traditional system of compulsory military service for all 18-year-old men, according to initial results.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/21/world/europe/austrians-appear-to-reject-changes-to-conscript-army.html', 'snippet': 'Nearly 60 percent of voters rejected any change to the traditional system of compulsory military service for all 18-year-old men, according to initial results.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BERLIN — Austria may have few enemies and no wars to fight, but a majority of its citizens believe that their country is better served by a military filled with conscripts, instead of a smaller, more mobile professional force, according to the initial results of a referendum held Sunday.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Austrians Appear to Reject Changes to Conscript Army', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Austrians Appear to Reject Changes to Conscript Army', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Eddy, Melissa', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Austria', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Voting and Voters', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Draft and Recruitment (Military)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-21T00:59:30+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Melissa Eddy', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Melissa', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Eddy', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/faa70a1d-bf06-55a4-91aa-ff1e5f040b4e', 'word_count': 513, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f