football/falcons-tumble-out-of-nfc-championship-game-against-49ers.html', 'snippet': 'Quarterback Matt Ryan could not have been more accurate for the first half of the N.F.C. Championship game. That all changed for the Falcons offense with an interception, fumble and dubious decisions on two incompletions.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ATLANTA — For two and a half quarters, Falcons quarterback Matt Ryan could not have been more accurate if his passes had been guided by GPS. His choice targets in what tight end Tony Gonzalez has termed the P.Y.P. (Pick Your Poison) offense were making catches as if the ball and their hands were magnetized. ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/21/sports/YNFCSIDE/YNFCSIDE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/01/21/sports/YNFCSIDE/YNFCSIDE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/21/sports/YNFCSIDE/YNFCSIDE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 699, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/21/sports/YNFCSIDE/YNFCSIDE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1397, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Slip, Then a Pick, and Atlanta Tumbles Out', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Slip, Then a Pick, And Atlanta Tumbles Out', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Tierney, Mike', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Atlanta Falcons', 'ran