mes.com/2013/01/21/arts/andree-putman-global-interior-designer-dies-at-87.html', 'snippet': 'The picture of a chic Parisian intellectual, Ms. Putman all but invented the boutique hotel genre when she designed Morgans in New York in 1984.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Andrée Putman, the Parisienne who rediscovered and reissued early Modernist French furniture and then went on to a renowned global career as a designer of interiors, died on Saturday at her home in Paris. She was 87.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/21/arts/putman-obit/putman-obit-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 593, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/01/21/arts/putman-obit/putman-obit-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 593}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/21/arts/putman-obit/putman-obit-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1011, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/21/arts/putman-obit/putman-obit-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1606, 'width': 1626, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/21/arts/putman-obit/putman-obit-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/01/21/arts/putman-obit/putman-obit-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/21/arts/putman-obit/putman-obit-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 1