rg of Germany won the super-G in Cortina d’Ampezzo, Italy, on a course that was shortened because of heavy snowfall.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/21/sports/skiing/viktoria-rebensburg-of-germany-wins-super-g.html', 'snippet': 'Viktoria Rebensburg of Germany won the super-G in Cortina d’Ampezzo, Italy, on a course that was shortened because of heavy snowfall.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Viktoria Rebensburg of Germany won the super-G in Cortina d’Ampezzo, Italy, with a time of 1 minute 16.45 seconds on a course that was shortened because of heavy snowfall. Nicole Schmidhofer of Austria placed second, edging the World Cup overall leader, Tina Maze of Slovenia, by one hundredth of a second.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'German Takes Super-G in Italy', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'German Takes Super-G', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ALPINE SKIING', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rebensburg, Viktoria', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Skiing', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-21T06:42:14+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Skiing', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kelley McMillan', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kelley', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'McMillan', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://article/192cf5ab-7ad6-59ff-9726-619e11a85dcb', 'word_count': 91, 'uri': 'nyt://article/192cf5ab-7ad6-59ff-9726-619e11a85dcb'}, {'abstract': 'Despite the conventional wisdom, the record on the immediate legacy of recent two-term American presidents is mixed.', 'web_url': 'https://rendezvous.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/21/obamas-second-term-not-necessarily-cursed/', 'snippe