072f0883'}, {'abstract': 'The last report on the expedition’s shipment of equipment to Chile was “arriving in port, all well.” The update now, 24 hours before team members were to board a plane, was not well at all.', 'web_url': 'https://scientistatwork.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/21/in-land-of-lithium-batteries-not-included/', 'snippet': 'The last report on the expedition’s shipment of equipment to Chile was “arriving in port, all well.” The update now, 24 hours before team members were to board a plane, was not well at all.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Jim Thomson is principal oceanographer at the Applied Physics Lab at the University of Washington. He studies ocean surface waves and coastal processes and wrote about his expedition to the North Pacific in the fall.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'In Land of Lithium, Batteries Not Included', 'kicker': 'Scientist at Work', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Batteries', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Freight (Cargo)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Lithium (Metal)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Oceans and Seas', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Ships and Shipping', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Boeing Company', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Chile', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-21T15:20:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Science', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jim Thomson', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jim', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Thomson', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c49dfa2e-b108-59f0-997f-96f9b9550745', 'word_count': 724, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c49dfa2e-b108-59f0-997f-96f9b9550745'}, {'abstract': 'Poland is pushing for stable, prosperous and democratic states in its own neighborhood and beyond.', 'web_url': 'https://rendezvous.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/21/polands-push-for-human-rights/', 'snippet': 'Poland is pushing for stable, prosperous and democratic states in its own neighborhood and beyond.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BERLIN — Without Poland, there would be no European Endowment for Democracy. The E.E.D., which I write about in my latest Letter from Europe, will become a new and much-needed source of funding for pro-democracy individuals and groups in Europe’s eastern and southern neighborhoods.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Poland’s Push for Human Rights', 'kicker': 'IHT Rendezvous', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Human Rights and Human Rights Violations', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'International Relations', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hollande, Francois', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sikorski, Radek', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Europe', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'France', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Mali', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Poland', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-21T15:31:59+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By Judy Dempsey', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Judy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Dempsey', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a0341820-a4e5-5448-adba-56945e00fe58', 'word_count': 382, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a0341820-a4e5-5448-adba-56945e00fe58'}, {'abstract': 'A lot of celery adds an extra dimension of flavor to classic minestrone.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/21/health/lentil-celery-and-tomato-minestrone.html', 'snippet': 'A lot of celery adds an extra dimension of flavor to classic minestrone.', 'lead_paragraph': 'If you did a lot of cooking over the Christmas and New Year’s holidays you may have some celery hearts lingering in your refrigerator. You needed a few branches for a stew, a stock, or a soup, so you bought a whole bunch, and here it is weeks later and the rest of the celery is wilting in the produce drawer.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/22/science/21recipehealth/21recipehealth-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/01/22/science/21recipehealth/21recipehealth-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/22/science/21recipehealth/21recipehealth-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/22/science/21recipehealth/21recipehealth-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/22/science/21recipehealth/21recipehealth-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/01/22/science/21recipehealth/21recipehealth-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thu