zona, I fantasized about ancient adobe splendor in Timbuktu. Eventually, I got there. Can it — and the rest of the country — be saved now?', 'web_url': 'https://rendezvous.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/21/the-mali-that-was/', 'snippet': 'As a kid in Tucson, Arizona, I fantasized about ancient adobe splendor in Timbuktu. Eventually, I got there. Can it — and the rest of the country — be saved now?', 'lead_paragraph': 'Alas, poor Mali. Finally it is getting some sustained world attention, only to be widely depicted as a benighted sandbox full of killers on camels.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/21/blogs/21rdv-aotm-mali-djenne-mosque/21rdv-aotm-mali-djenne-mosque-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/21/blogs/21rdv-aotm-mali-djenne-mosque/21rdv-aotm-mali-djenne-mosque-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/21/blogs/21rdv-aotm-mali-djenne-mosque/21rdv-aotm-mali-djenne-mosque-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/01/21/blogs/21rdv-aotm-mali-djenne-mosque/21rdv-aotm-mali-djenne-mosque-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/21/blogs/21rdv-aotm-mali-djenne-mosque/21rdv-aotm-mali-djenne-mosque-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Mali That Was', 'kicker': 'IHT Rendezvous', '