ach, Bruce Arena.', 'web_url': 'https://goal.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/21/donovan-to-rejoin-galaxy-coach-says/', 'snippet': 'Landon Donovan will play this season for the Los Angeles Galaxy, according to the team’s coach, Bruce Arena.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CARSON, Calif. — Bruce Arena, the head coach of the Los Angeles Galaxy, said Monday that Landon Donovan was definitely rejoining the club this season, seemingly ending speculation that the forward might retire from soccer.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/22/sports/skiing/22landon/22landon-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 723, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/22/sports/skiing/22landon/22landon-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1446, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/22/sports/skiing/22landon/22landon-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/01/22/sports/skiing/22landon/22landon-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/22/sports/skiing/22landon/22landon-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Donovan to Rejoin Galaxy, Coach Says', 'kicker': 'Goal', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Donovan to Rejoin Galaxy', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Soccer', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'ARENA, BRUCE', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Donovan, Landon', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Los Angeles Galaxy (Soccer Team)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Major League Soccer', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-21T20:31:27+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Soccer', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andrew Keh', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andrew', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Keh', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/10ae1cc6-ebde-5d26-9858-8ebde1144a26', 'word_count': 227, 'uri': 'nyt://article/10ae1cc6-ebde-5d26-9858-8ebde1144a26'}, {'abstract': 'Studies in modified mice suggest that it is harder to make new long-term memories as we age because the brain is full of old ones that are hard to erase.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/22/science/older-brain-is-willing-but-too-full-for-new-memories.html', 'snippet': 'Studies in modified mice suggest that it is harder to make new long-term memories as we age because the brain is full of old ones that are hard to erase.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Learning becomes more difficult as we age not because we have trouble absorbing new information, but because we fail to forget the old stuff, researchers say.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Older Brain Is Willing, but Too Full', 'kicker': 'Observatory', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Neuroscience: Older Brain Is Willing, but Too Full', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Quenqua, Douglas', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Memory', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Brain', 'rank': 3, 'major':