d77-9071-b6f73437d378'}, {'abstract': 'Among franchises with more than two Super Bowl victories, San Francisco has the only untarnished record.', 'web_url': 'https://fifthdown.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/21/pressure-niners-were-5-0-in-super-bowls-with-montana-and-young/', 'snippet': 'Among franchises with more than two Super Bowl victories, San Francisco has the only untarnished record.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Steve Young led the San Francisco 49ers to a Super Bowl victory over the San Diego Chargers in 1995, throwing a record-setting six touchdown passes. He was the most valuable player of the game, and of the season. He was a seven-time Pro Bowler, a three-time All-Pro and, in 2005, inducted into the Pro Football Hall of Fame.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Pressure? Niners Were 5-0 in Super Bowls With Montana and Young', 'kicker': 'The Fifth Down', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'For Kaepernick, Pressure From 49ers’ Present and Past', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Super Bowl', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kaepernick, Colin', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'San Francisco 49ers', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-21T21:21:40+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Football', 'byline': {'original': 'By Benjamin Hoffman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Benjamin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hoffman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f2d4cd70-7eaf-5765-aa78-dbf57b890440', 'word_count': 693, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f2d4cd70-7eaf-5765-aa78-dbf57b890440'}, {'abstract': 'Booking.com, a unit of the Priceline Group, is beginning a campaign to raise its profile among American travelers.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/22/business/media/from-amsterdam-a-lodging-web-site-invades-the-us-advertising.html', 'snippet': 'Booking.com, a unit of the Priceline Group, is beginning a campaign to raise its profile among American travelers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CAMPAIGNS for Web sites that offer lodging reservations usually feature colorful characters, perhaps to counter the prosaic, transactional nature of e-commerce. Among them are the Roaming Gnome, for Travelocity; the Negotiator, played by William Shatner, for Priceline; hordes of animated travelers, for Hotels.com; and a man in a crash helmet delivering Price Assurance checks, for Orbitz. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/22/business/ADCO-1/ADCO-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 341, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/01/22/business/ADCO-1/ADCO-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 341}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/22/business/ADCO-1/ADCO-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 582, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/22/business/ADCO-1/ADCO-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1043, 'width': 1835, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/22/business/ADCO-1/ADCO-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/01/22/business/ADCO-1/ADCO-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/22/business/ADCO-1/ADCO-1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'From Amsterdam, a Lodging Web Site Invades the U.S.', 'kicker': 'Advertising', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'From Amsterdam, a Lodging Web Site Invades the U.S.', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Elliott, Stuart', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Online Advertising', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Travel and Vacations', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Computers and the Internet', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ADVERTISING AND MARKETING', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Priceline', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Booking.com', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-21T21:22:43+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By Stuart Elliott', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Stuart', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Elliott', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d96ba866-4589-51df-b866-b949616a9282', 'word_count': 916, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d96ba866-4589-51df-b866-b949616a9282'}, {'abstract': 'A new study suggests that, although rare, blood clots in veins and in the arteries of the lung may be more common in pregnancies achieved by in vitro fertilization.', 'web_url': 'https://well.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/21/a-rise-in-pregnancy-clots/', 'snippet': 'A new study suggests that, although rare, blood clots in veins and in the arteries of the lung may be more common in pregnancies achieved by in vitro fertilization.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Pregnancy increases the risk of venous thrombosis, which involves blood clots in the veins, and pulmonary embolism, a blood clot in the arteries of the lungs that can be fatal. The absolute risk is low — about one in a thousand over an entire pregnancy. But a new study suggests that both kinds of clots may be more common in pregnancies achieved by in vitro fertilization.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/11/health/well_risks/well_risks-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 215, 'width': 215, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/11/health/well_risks/well_risks-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 215, 'width': 215, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/11/health/well_risks/well_risks-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/11/health/well_risks/well_risks-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/11/health/well_risks/well_risks-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Rise in Pregnancy Clots', 'kicker': 'Well', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Risks: A Rise in Pregnancy Clots', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Blood Clots', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 