 a format similar to that of “The Voice,” features contestants who are judged by four food celebrities, including Nigella Lawson.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/22/arts/television/the-taste-on-abc-featuring-celebrity-food-judges.html', 'snippet': '“The Taste,” a new ABC show using a format similar to that of “The Voice,” features contestants who are judged by four food celebrities, including Nigella Lawson.', 'lead_paragraph': 'If there were an Emmy Award for best reality show clone — and wouldn’t that reflect the substance of television better than, say, best children’s nonfiction program? — the clear front-runner for this year would be “The Taste,” the new cooking competition beginning on Tuesday night on ABC.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/22/arts/JPTASTE/JPTASTE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 316, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/01/22/arts/JPTASTE/JPTASTE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 316}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/22/arts/JPTASTE/JPTASTE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 539, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/22/arts/JPTASTE/JPTASTE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1078, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/22/arts/JPTASTE/JPTASTE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/01/22/arts/JPTASTE/JPTASTE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thum