t://article/32ef479c-b124-54cc-af63-a619cd2d5f56'}, {'abstract': 'From Brit Hume’s assessment of Beyoncé to President Obama’s last look back at the joyful crowd, television encapsulated all that was weird and wonderful about the inauguration.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/22/us/politics/tv-watch-the-silly-and-the-sublime.html', 'snippet': 'From Brit Hume’s assessment of Beyoncé to President Obama’s last look back at the joyful crowd, television encapsulated all that was weird and wonderful about the inauguration.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It said something about the déjà-vu effect that some network anchors covering Barack Obama’s second inauguration on Monday had almost as much to say about the president’s mother-in-law as they did about the president. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/22/us/politics/22tvwatch/22tvwatch-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/01/22/us/politics/22tvwatch/22tvwatch-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/22/us/politics/22tvwatch/22tvwatch-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/22/us/politics/22tvwatch/22tvwatch-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/22/us/politics/22tvwatch/22tvwatch-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumb