emonies did not disappoint.', 'web_url': 'https://runway.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/21/the-inaugural-fashion-front/', 'snippet': 'As expected, style at the inaugural ceremonies did not disappoint.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As expected, style at the inauguration ceremonies did not disappoint. Thom Browne landed a spot in the National Archives as the designer of Michelle Obama’s inaugural morning outfit, a navy silk jacquard coat and dress. Jill Biden’s large silver bow on her Lela Rose coat and Justice Antonin Scalia’s Renaissance painter-inspired hat were also topics on the tongues of fashion fans, but the president’s attire, not so much.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Inaugural Fashion Front', 'kicker': 'On the Runway', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-01-22T04:51:32+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2524c418-50fd-5978-bc08-1447bf5d3a9f', 'word_count': 125, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2524c418-50fd-5978-bc08-1447bf5d3a9f'}, {'abstract': 'A free horse program, near Twin Cities, offers women veterans a space to heal outside the company of men.', 'web_url': 'https://atwar.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/22/victims-of-sexual-trauma-harness-the-calming-power-of-horses/', 'snippet': 'A free horse program, near Twin Cities, offers women veterans a space to heal outside the company of men.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Chante Wolf, an Air Force veteran who served in the Persian Gulf war in 1991, knows all too well the torture of remembering. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Victims of Sexual Trauma Harness the Calming Power of Horses', 'kicker': 'At War', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': N