rs to pay off their contract if they will agree not to play. Michelle Pfeiffer, above with Jeff Bridges, is Susie Diamond, who helps the guys reinvent themselves as a trio. Writing in The New York Times, Janet Maslin called this film, from the director Steve Kloves, a “slow, teasing, rapturously moody romance.”', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'What’s on Tuesday', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'What’s On Today', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-01-22T05:11:08+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Television', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kathryn Shattuck', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kathryn', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Shattuck', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Schedule', '_id': 'nyt://article/c84e7cde-5540-5e52-b039-2df28d96cf45', 'word_count': 748, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c84e7cde-5540-5e52-b039-2df28d96cf45'}, {'abstract': 'In both cities, the sidewalk is for much more than just walking.', 'web_url': 'https://india.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/22/the-mumbainew-york-photo-project-on-the-sidewalks/', 'snippet': 'In both cities, the sidewalk is for much more than just walking.', 'lead_paragraph': 'This is the second installment in Nisha Sondhe’s Mumbai/New York photography project. View part one, “On the Waterfront,” here. Read more about the project here. \xa0', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Mumbai/New York Photo Project: On the Sidewalks', 'kicker': 'India Ink', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sidewalks', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'val