onday night in the Chanel studio before his spring haute couture show.', 'web_url': 'https://runway.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/22/chanel-coming-to-a-clearing/', 'snippet': '“The idea is to make the shoulders beautiful,” Karl Lagerfeld said on Monday night in the Chanel studio before his spring haute couture show.', 'lead_paragraph': '“The idea is to make the shoulders beautiful,” Karl Lagerfeld said on Monday night in the Chanel studio before his spring haute couture show. A model stood before him in a black wool suit, the neckline opened over a face-flattering white beaded yoke. “This is really molded on the shoulders.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Chanel Coming to a Clearing', 'kicker': 'On the Runway', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Couture (Fashion)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Chanel, Coco', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lagerfeld, Karl', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Chanel SA', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Christian Dior SA', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Paris (France)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-22T17:04:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Cathy Horyn', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Cathy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Horyn', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/899f7bbb-8a91-578b-8739-f3cd3b4b9299', 'word_count': 302, 'uri': 'nyt://article/899f7bbb-8a91-578b-8739-f3cd3b4b9299'}, {'abstract': 'Harvey Weinstein talks piracy and movies (contrary to popular opinion, he liked the Spiel