ck $7,200, based on the results of an auction of items that once belonged to the Studio 54 co-founder Steve Rubell. The collection, which was sold on Saturday by Palm Beach Modern Auctions in West Palm Beach, Fla., consisted of art and memorabilia that Rubell had assembled before his death in 1989, and which he had left to his former companion, Bill Hamilton. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/22/arts/rubell/rubell-jumbo.png', 'height': 496, 'width': 386, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/22/arts/rubell/rubell-superJumbo.png', 'height': 496, 'width': 386, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/22/arts/rubell/rubell-thumbStandard.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/01/22/arts/rubell/rubell-thumbStandard.png', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Disco Inferno at Fire-Sale Prices as Studio 54 Items Go On the Block', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Studio 54 Auction', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Auctions', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Capote, Truman', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cher (1946- )', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rubell, Steve', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Turner, Tina', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Vollbracht, Michael', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Warhol, Andy', 'rank