 anywhere else. When my brother and his wife invited my father to move in, the invitation was vigorously declined. And we lived in three different cities, far apart. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '21', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Last Calendar', 'kicker': 'Op-Ed Contributor', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Last Calendar', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elderly', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Death and Dying', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elder Care', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Medicine and Health', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Calendars', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-23T01:30:48+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Olivia Judson', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Olivia', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Judson', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Op-Ed', '_id': 'nyt://article/c7d52591-c406-5068-9704-1bef30f88722', 'word_count': 912, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c7d52591-c406-5068-9704-1bef30f88722'}, {'abstract': 'The suicide of a Russian dissident at a Dutch detention center raises troubling questions about the West’s support for human rights.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/23/opinion/a-cold-shoulder-for-russian-dissidents.html', 'snippet': 'The suicide of a Russian dissident at a Dutch detention center raises troubling questions about the West’s support for human rights.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MOSCOW', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '21', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Cold Shoulder for Russian Dissidents', 'kicker': 'Op-Ed Contributor', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Cold Shoulder for Ru