722c-5997-b0ae-22d8932a9ed3', 'word_count': 1434, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6c747f40-722c-5997-b0ae-22d8932a9ed3'}, {'abstract': 'A public health advocate raised questions about the ability of the Academy of Nutrition and Dietetics to challenge its big corporate sponsors on matters of health and nutrition.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/23/business/report-questions-nutrition-groups-use-of-corporate-sponsors.html', 'snippet': 'A public health advocate raised questions about the ability of the Academy of Nutrition and Dietetics to challenge its big corporate sponsors on matters of health and nutrition.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A new report by a public health advocate criticizes the Academy of Nutrition and Dietetics, a trade group presenting some 74,000 dietitians, for allowing corporate sponsorships of its organization.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Report Faults Food Group’s Sponsor Ties', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Report Faults Food Group’s Sponsor Ties', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Diet and Nutrition', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Strom, Stephanie', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Food', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Academy of Nutrition and Dietetics', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Simon, Michele', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ADVERTISING AND MARKETING', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-23T02:20:20+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Stephanie Strom', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Stephanie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Strom', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/914355ac-198c-53e1-8a30-7f7217dbbb13', 'word_count': 496, 'uri': 'nyt://article/914355ac-198c-53e1-8a30-7f7217dbbb13'}, {'abstract': 'After nearly two days of hiding from the hostage-takers at the facility in Algeria, eight workers decided their only chance at survival would come from climbing the fence and running away.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/23/world/africa/worker-at-algerian-gas-facility-describes-escape.html', 'snippet': 'After nearly two days of hiding from the hostage-takers at the facility in Algeria, eight workers decided their only chance at survival would come from climbing the fence and running away.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BERGEN, Norway — After militants stormed his remote desert workplace last week, Liviu Floria, a Romanian gas worker, locked the door and sought refuge under a desk. For five hours, as he stayed hidden, he communicated by text message with a Romanian co-worker in another part of the sprawling In Amenas gas facility.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/23/world/ESCAPE/ESCAPE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 316, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/01/23/world/ESCAPE/ESCAPE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 316}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/23/world/ESCAPE/ESCAPE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 539, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/23/world/ESCAPE/ESCAPE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1078, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type'