a Prensa in New York.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/23/theater/dolores-prida-columnist-on-hispanic-matters-dies-at-69.html', 'snippet': 'Ms. Prida was a longtime writer for The Daily News and El Diario/La Prensa in New York.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Dolores Prida, a Cuban-born journalist and playwright who wrote candidly and wittily about local and national politics, romance and other personal matters, and the joys and vexations of the Hispanic experience in America, died early Sunday in Manhattan. She was 69.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/23/arts/PRIDA-obit/PRIDA-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 866, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/01/23/arts/PRIDA-obit/PRIDA-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 866}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/23/arts/PRIDA-obit/PRIDA-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1008, 'width': 698, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/23/arts/PRIDA-obit/PRIDA-obit-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1008, 'width': 698, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/23/arts/PRIDA-obit/PRIDA-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/01/23/arts/PRIDA-obit/PRIDA-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/23/arts/PRIDA-obit/PRIDA-obit-thumbLarge.jp