 wrong, or do you question your own biases, assumptions and actions? Read some research, then write about how you’ve handled obstacles in your life.', 'web_url': 'https://learning.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/23/what-do-you-do-when-you-encounter-obstacles-to-success/', 'snippet': 'Do you typically look for external reasons why things go wrong, or do you question your own biases, assumptions and actions? Read some research, then write about how you’ve handled obstacles in your life.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When David Chang first opened the Momofuku Noodle Bar, his tiny Manhattan restaurant, “he could barely pay himself a salary. He had trouble keeping staff. And he was miserably stressed.” ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/20/sunday-review/20SUCCESS-LN/20SUCCESS-LN-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 570, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/01/20/sunday-review/20SUCCESS-LN/20SUCCESS-LN-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 570}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/20/sunday-review/20SUCCESS-LN/20SUCCESS-LN-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 972, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/20/sunday-review/20SUCCESS-LN/20SUCCESS-LN-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1945, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/20/sunday-review/20SUCCESS-LN/20SUCCESS-LN-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/01/20/sunday-review/20SUCCESS-LN/20SUCCESS-LN-thu