ear Weapons', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Embargoes and Economic Sanctions', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kim Jong-un', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Security Council (UN)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-23T10:30:32+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Choe Sang-Hun', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Choe', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sang-Hun', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/29671893-3eca-51f5-8105-41d6e6cc2d0a', 'word_count': 535, 'uri': 'nyt://article/29671893-3eca-51f5-8105-41d6e6cc2d0a'}, {'abstract': 'Leobardo Espinoza Jr., a high school senior in Kansas, says that “having a lot of scholarships to consider can be a double-edged sword.”', 'web_url': 'https://thechoice.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/23/envelope-please-leobardo-espinoza-jr-6/', 'snippet': 'Leobardo Espinoza Jr., a high school senior in Kansas, says that “having a lot of scholarships to consider can be a double-edged sword.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'Now that I’ve finished college applications, I’m transitioning to searching and applying for scholarships. The more I search, the better I’ve become at finding them and the more I realize that there is an abundance of scholarships for which I qualify.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/03/education/envpls13-leobardo-espinoza-jr/envpls13-leobardo-espinoza-jr-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 796, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/09/03/education/envpls13-leobardo-espinoza-jr/envpls13-leobardo-espinoza-jr-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargehe