1960s Las Vegas, will continue the Metropolitan Opera’s attempts to wake up its opera revivals.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/27/arts/music/rigoletto-in-rat-pack-style-at-the-met.html', 'snippet': 'Michael Mayer’s new production of “Rigoletto,” set in 1960s Las Vegas, will continue the Metropolitan Opera’s attempts to wake up its opera revivals.', 'lead_paragraph': '“THERE WAS THIS FEELING that ‘You can’t put a diva in a trunk,’\xa0” the director Michael Mayer is saying, eyes alight with triumph, during a break from rehearsals for his bold new production of “Rigoletto,” which opens on Monday evening at the Metropolitan Opera. ', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/27/arts/27RIGOLETTO1_SPAN/27RIGOLETTO1_SPAN-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/01/27/arts/27RIGOLETTO1_SPAN/27RIGOLETTO1_SPAN-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/27/arts/27RIGOLETTO1_SPAN/27RIGOLETTO1_SPAN-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/27/arts/27RIGOLETTO1_SPAN/27RIGOLETTO1_SPAN-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/27/arts/27RIGOLETTO1_SPAN/27RIGOLETTO1_SPAN-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/01/27/arts/27RIGOLETTO1_SPAN/27RIGOLETTO1_S