ednesday that they had charged the student they say fired the shots and were still searching for a possible second suspect.', 'lead_paragraph': 'HOUSTON — Law enforcement officials said Wednesday that they had not recovered the pistol used in a shooting at a community college on Tuesday that left four people hospitalized, but that they had charged the student they say fired the shots and were still searching for a possible second suspect.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/24/us/24shooting_inline/24shooting_inline-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 732, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/01/24/us/24shooting_inline/24shooting_inline-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 732}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/24/us/24shooting_inline/24shooting_inline-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1000, 'width': 820, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/24/us/24shooting_inline/24shooting_inline-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1000, 'width': 820, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/24/us/24shooting_inline/24shooting_inline-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/01/24/us/24shooting_inline/24shooting_inline-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/24/us/24shooting_inline/24shooting_inline-thumbLarge.jpg