d a safe space for his subjects, victims of rape in the military.', 'web_url': 'https://carpetbagger.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/23/a-documentarian-focused-on-trauma-in-its-many-forms/', 'snippet': 'Kirby Dick, whose “Invisible War” is up for a documentary Oscar, says that he had to build a safe space for his subjects, victims of rape in the military.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Today, members of the House Armed Services Committee are scheduled to meet in full session for a hearing on sexual assault in the military. That they are doing so is in large part a tribute to one of the five movies nominated this month for the Academy Award for best feature-length documentary, Kirby Dick’s “Invisible War.”', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/24/arts/invisiblewar/invisiblewar-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 348, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/01/24/arts/invisiblewar/invisiblewar-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 348}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/24/arts/invisiblewar/invisiblewar-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 594, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/24/arts/invisiblewar/invisiblewar-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1189, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/24/arts/invisiblewar/invisiblewar-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/01/24/arts/invisiblewar/invisiblewar-thumbStandard-v2.jpg',