.R. Takes 25% Stake in Firm That Invests in Natural Disasters', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Earthquakes', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hedge Funds', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hurricanes and Tropical Storms', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Insurance', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mergers, Acquisitions and Divestitures', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kravis, Henry R', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Kohlberg Kravis Roberts & Co', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-23T22:17:11+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael J. de la Merced', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': 'J.', 'lastname': 'de la Merced', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1f50d202-7ae4-5b26-9265-0fb56fc62e8a', 'word_count': 387, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1f50d202-7ae4-5b26-9265-0fb56fc62e8a'}, {'abstract': '“The Jammer,” by Rolin Jones, follows a young man as he follows his dreams to the roller derby.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/24/theater/reviews/the-jammer-by-rolin-jones-at-atlantic-theater-company.html', 'snippet': '“The Jammer,” by Rolin Jones, follows a young man as he follows his dreams to the roller derby.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Slap on some wheels and chase your dream, or stay stock still and remain true to the girl you love? That’s the hard choice faced by Jack Lovington (Patch Darragh), the would-be skating star and Everyman hero of “The Jammer,” the slightly tattered comic book of a play by Rolin Jones presented by the Atlantic Theater Company at the troupe’s smaller stag