 'nyt://article/725b04be-dbdd-5dca-9aed-e10397d5a763'}, {'abstract': 'Eddie Huang, the chef and co-owner of BaoHaus in the East Village, considers himself more of a writer, but he’s also a television personality with a hip-hop style.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/24/fashion/eddie-huang-defies-description.html', 'snippet': 'Eddie Huang, the chef and co-owner of BaoHaus in the East Village, considers himself more of a writer, but he’s also a television personality with a hip-hop style.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The firebrand chef Eddie Huang took\xa0over a table at Hot Kitchen, a Sichuan restaurant in the East Village, and commandeered the remote control. It was a Saturday night, and the Orlando Magic was losing to the New York Knicks. As Carmelo Anthony worked his way to 40 points, Mr. Huang’s body jerked in sympathetic rebound.', 'print_section': 'E', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/24/fashion/24UPCLOSE_SPAN/0125-STL-Cov5-Huang-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/01/24/fashion/24UPCLOSE_SPAN/0125-STL-Cov5-Huang-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/24/fashion/24UPCLOSE_SPAN/0125-STL-Cov5-Huang-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/24/fashion/24UPCLOSE_SPAN/0125-STL-Cov5-Huang-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/24/fashion/24UPCLOSE_SPAN/0125-STL