yers Wear and Why.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Bob Dylan once sang of “Boots of Spanish Leather,” though these days soccer boots, cleats, shoes (your choice of nomenclature) are more likely to be made of the finest synthetics concocted in the laboratories of Beaverton, Ore.,\xa0 (Nike) and Herzogenaurach, Germany (Adidas and Puma).', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Things We Love … Shoes Glorious Shoes', 'kicker': 'Goal', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Shoes and Boots', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Soccer', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-23T23:00:06+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Soccer', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jack Bell', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jack', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bell', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/30f80ba5-2f4e-5cf2-9769-122183b5d2d1', 'word_count': 206, 'uri': 'nyt://article/30f80ba5-2f4e-5cf2-9769-122183b5d2d1'}, {'abstract': 'A letter from Gen. Martin E. Dempsey to Secretary of Defense Leon Panetta proposing removing the restrictions on women from many positions in the infantry and artillery.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/interactive/2013/01/23/us/23military-dempsey-letter.html', 'snippet': 'A letter from Gen. Martin E. Dempsey to Secretary of Defense Leon Panetta proposing removing the restrictions on women from many positions in the infantry and artillery.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A letter from Gen. Martin E. Dempsey to Secretary of Defense Leon Panetta proposing removing the restrictions on women from many positions in the infantry and artillery.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Letter From Gen. Martin E. Dempsey', 'kic