'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/24/fashion/attention-narcissists-you-too-can-be-on-the-best-dressed-list.html', 'snippet': 'Vanity Fair is opening its Best-Dressed List to the public, allowing readers to upload pictures online — and garnering some publicity for the magazine in the process.', 'lead_paragraph': 'GO ON, ADMIT IT. What fashion-conscious person hasn’t fantasized at some point in the last 70-some years of finding themselves on the International Best-Dressed List? ', 'print_section': 'E', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/24/fashion/24ROW/24-Z-ROW-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 698, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/01/24/fashion/24ROW/24-Z-ROW-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 698}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/24/fashion/24ROW/24-Z-ROW-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 881, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/24/fashion/24ROW/24-Z-ROW-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1545, 'width': 1328, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/24/fashion/24ROW/24ROW-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/01/24/fashion/24ROW/24ROW-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/24/fashion/24ROW/24ROW-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thu