anization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9602c2ab-bb65-50f2-bee5-a062ddcdabed', 'word_count': 1080, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9602c2ab-bb65-50f2-bee5-a062ddcdabed'}, {'abstract': 'Could the outcome revive moribund peace talks?', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/24/opinion/israels-election.html', 'snippet': 'Could the outcome revive moribund peace talks?', 'lead_paragraph': 'The political opponents of Prime Minister Benjamin Netanyahu of Israel were ecstatic at his apparent losses in Tuesday’s elections. Haaretz, the left-leaning newspaper, called it a vote of no confidence that showed Mr. Netanyahu has “failed in the political sphere, the foreign policy sphere and the socioeconomic sphere.” ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '26', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Israel’s Election', 'kicker': 'Editorial ', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Israel’s Election', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Israel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elections', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Netanyahu, Benjamin', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lapid, Yair', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bennett, Naftali', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Palestinians', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-23T23:11:11+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/043f5e69-2a3b-5553-96c0-5898c472b931', 'word_count': 568, 'uri': 'nyt://article/043f5e69-2a3b-5553-96c0-5898c472b931'}, {'abstract': 'Lyle Kessler’s “Collision,” presented by the Amoralists troupe, follows a college student’s efforts to enlist others in a plot.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/24/theater/reviews/lyle-kesslers-collision-at-rattlestick-theater.html', 'snippet': 'Lyle Kessler’s “Collision,” presented by the Amoralists troupe, follows a college student’s efforts to enlist others in a plot.', 'lead_paragraph': 'At some point during rehearsals “Collision,” Lyle Kessler’s new play about a college roommate from hell, underwent a metamorphosis, or at least a branding change. A press representative for the show announced last week that its creators, the Off Broadway troupe the Amoralists, “are now billing the play as a drama, not a black comedy as originally announced.”', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/24/arts/24COLLISION/24COLLISION-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 652, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/01/24/arts/24COLLISION/24COLLISION-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 652}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/24/arts/24COLLISION/24COLLISION-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 942, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/24/arts/24COLLISION/24COLLISION-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1747, 'width': 1607, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/24/arts/24COLLISION/24COLLISION-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/01/24/arts/24COLLISION/24COLLISION-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thum