ucating girls in Egypt, India and elsewhere, have enlisted nonprofit groups to get the word out.', 'web_url': 'https://carpetbagger.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/23/making-a-film-a-philanthropic-event/', 'snippet': 'The backers of “Girl Rising,” about educating girls in Egypt, India and elsewhere, have enlisted nonprofit groups to get the word out.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PARK CITY, Utah – “Girl Rising” is rapidly becoming one of the hottest “cause” documentaries in years, and it’s not even finished yet.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Making a Film a Philanthropic Event', 'kicker': 'Carpetbagger', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-01-23T23:33:27+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Brooks Barnes', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Brooks', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Barnes', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c925c643-b52f-525f-8528-ab11760dd1ff', 'word_count': 269, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c925c643-b52f-525f-8528-ab11760dd1ff'}, {'abstract': 'Awards season puts the wind at the back of “Beasts of the Southern Wild” and its cast and crew members.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/24/movies/awardsseason/for-beasts-of-the-southern-wild-accolades-aplenty.html', 'snippet': 'Awards season puts the wind at the back of “Beasts of the Southern Wild” and its cast and crew members.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PARK CITY, Utah — It was almost exactly one year ago that Quvenzhané Wallis, the star of “Beasts of the Southern Wild,” made her bad little self known to the world. After the premiere of the movie here at the Sundance Film Festival, Ms. Wallis, then 8, took to the stage with her cast mates and film crew. She received a standing ovation. Handed a mike, she introduc