se known for its films, but music is a big component of the festival.', 'web_url': 'https://carpetbagger.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/23/video-when-park-city-becomes-music-central/', 'snippet': 'Sundance is of course known for its films, but music is a big component of the festival.', 'lead_paragraph': '“This ain’t Hollywood, this is Park City!” Nas shouted from the stage on Saturday night. He was performing in a pop-up club at the base of a ski lift on Main Street here (“I’m usually at Tao in Vegas or New York City. This is Tao in Utah. How real is that?”), one of many musical acts to appear in the Sundance orbit. Here, a sampling of the nonfilm shows around town during the festival. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Video: When Park City Becomes Music Central', 'kicker': 'Carpetbagger', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sundance Film Festival (Park City, Utah)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-23T23:45:39+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Melena Ryzik', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Melena', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ryzik', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/601de50e-e3b4-5021-b65c-d4b5bffd9004', 'word_count': 77, 'uri': 'nyt://article/601de50e-e3b4-5021-b65c-d4b5bffd9004'}, {'abstract': 'Richard Wright, the Chicago auction house owner, goes shopping for modern designs produced from a region that he says deserves extra attention: Scandinavia.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/interactive/2013/01/24/garden/20120124-SHOPPING.html', 'snippet': 'Richard Wright, the Chicago auction house owner, goes shopping for modern designs produced from a region that he say