as-south-street-linen-and-others.html', 'snippet': 'Discounts on glassware, linens and more.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Canvas is discounting all colored glass as much as 50 percent, through Sunday (the Ash ball-stemmed goblet, shown, originally about $12, is about $8; the Bario bubble goblet, originally $10, is about $6); 199 Lafayette Street (Kenmare Street), (646) 873-6698 and 123 West 17th Street (Avenue of the Americas), (212) 372-7706, canvashomestore.com.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/24/garden/24DEALS/24DEALS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 812, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/01/24/garden/24DEALS/24DEALS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 812}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/24/garden/24DEALS/24DEALS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 877, 'width': 648, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/24/garden/24DEALS/24DEALS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 877, 'width': 648, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/24/garden/24DEALS/24DEALS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/01/24/garden/24DEALS/24DEALS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/24/garden/24DEALS/24DEALS-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}