d-not-have-armed-guards.html', 'snippet': 'The companies operating the site that was attacked last week chose not to deploy armed guards, leading security analysts to question whether the assault could have been slowed by tighter security.', 'lead_paragraph': 'HOUSTON — The companies operating the gas facility in the Sahara that was attacked last week had chosen not to deploy armed guards inside the sprawling compound, leading security analysts to question whether the assault by more than 30 Islamist militants might have been slowed if security had been tighter.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Algeria Gas Compound Lacked Armed Guards', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Algeria Gas Compound Lacked Armed Guards', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'ALGERIA', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Krauss, Clifford', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Sonatrach', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kulish, Nicholas', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Statoil ASA', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'BP Plc', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Oil (Petroleum) and Gasoline', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Security and Warning Systems', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hostages', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-24T01:16:48+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Africa', 'byline': {'original': 'By Clifford Krauss and Nicholas Kulish', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Clifford', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Krauss', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Nicholas', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kulish', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/54e7edd3-f7ec-5e07-95c5-17c707317341', 'word_count': 981, 'uri': 'nyt://article/54e7edd3-f7ec-5e07-95c5-17c707317341'}, {'abstract': 'We need reasonably priced, globally competitive, ubiquitous communications infrastructure so that Americans can compete and innovate.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/24/opinion/how-to-get-high-speed-internet-to-all-americans.html', 'snippet': 'We need reasonably priced, globally competitive, ubiquitous communications infrastructure so that Americans can compete and innovate.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ON Monday, President Obama said that during his second term, Americans would act together to “build the roads and networks and research labs that will bring new jobs and businesses to our shores” and that “we cannot cede to other nations the technology that will power new jobs and new industries — we must claim its promise.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '27', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/24/opinion/0124OPEDrementer/0124OPEDrementer-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 355, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/01/24/opinion/0124OPEDrementer/0124OPEDrementer-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 355}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/24/opinion/0124OPEDrementer/0124OPEDrementer-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 606, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/24/opinion/0124OPEDrementer/0124OPEDrementer-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1212, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumb