t uninterrupted minutes. His response does much to illuminate his personal philosophy.', 'web_url': 'https://goal.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/24/klinsmann-explains-and-keeps-explained-his-use-of-247/', 'snippet': 'Jurgen Klinsmann, coach of the United States men’s soccer team, elaborated on the subject of “24/7″ for eight uninterrupted minutes. His response does much to illuminate his personal philosophy.', 'lead_paragraph': 'TORRANCE, Calif. — Earlier this week I sat down with Jurgen Klinsmann, coach of the United States men’s soccer team, for a lengthy chat about the coming World Cup qualifiers. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/25/sports/soccer/25jurgen/25jurgen-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/01/25/sports/soccer/25jurgen/25jurgen-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/25/sports/soccer/25jurgen/25jurgen-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/25/sports/soccer/25jurgen/25jurgen-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/25/sports/soccer/25jurgen/25jurgen-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/01/25/sports/soccer/25jurgen/25jurgen-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', '