Further film study, medical evaluations, pro day workouts and the combine will all have a major say when it comes to the ultimate destinations of these N.F.L. prospects.', 'web_url': 'https://fifthdown.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/24/senior-bowls-surprises-polarizing-prospects-and-small-school-standouts/', 'snippet': 'Further film study, medical evaluations, pro day workouts and the combine will all have a major say when it comes to the ultimate destinations of these N.F.L. prospects.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MOBILE, Ala — Much will be written about the players who have helped or hurt themselves the most with their Senior Bowl week performances. In truth, it’s far too early in the process to form an accurate opinion on where players are likely to be drafted. Further film study, medical evaluations, pro day workouts and the combine will all have a major say when it comes to the ultimate destinations of these prospects.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Senior Bowl’s Surprises, Polarizing Prospects and Small-School Standouts', 'kicker': 'The Fifth Down', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-24T11:00:54+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Football', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jene Bramel and Matt Waldman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jene', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bramel', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Matt', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Waldman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d357ad2a-b76b-52ae-84c3-79b66759ca0f', 'word_count': 1734, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d357ad2a-b76b-52ae-84c3-79b66759ca0f'}, {'abstract': 'But c