: None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/deb01215-e47b-538d-922d-b1323ab81384', 'word_count': 1006, 'uri': 'nyt://article/deb01215-e47b-538d-922d-b1323ab81384'}, {'abstract': 'Victims of child pornography can now collect damages directly from those convicted of possessing their images. But how much can restitution help them repair their lives?', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/27/magazine/how-much-can-restitution-help-victims-of-child-pornography.html', 'snippet': 'Victims of child pornography can now collect damages directly from those convicted of possessing their images. But how much can restitution help them repair their lives?', 'lead_paragraph': 'The detective spread out the photographs on the kitchen table, in front of Nicole, on a December morning in 2006. She was 17, but in the pictures, she saw the face of her 10-year-old self, a half-grown girl wearing make-up. The bodies in the images were broken up by pixelation, but Nicole could see the outline of her father, forcing himself on her. Her mother, sitting next to her, burst into sobs.', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/27/magazine/27restitution1/27restitution1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/01/27/magazine/27restitution1/27restitution1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/27/magazine/27restitution1/27restitution1-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/27/magazine/27restitution1/27restitution1-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'h