n the Lessons of the Financial Crisis', 'kicker': 'Economix', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Books and Literature', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Economics (Theory and Philosophy)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Blinder, Alan S', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-24T15:00:24+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Economy', 'byline': {'original': 'By Binyamin Appelbaum', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Binyamin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Appelbaum', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/78087d29-66eb-5644-98ba-5e2158097171', 'word_count': 1112, 'uri': 'nyt://article/78087d29-66eb-5644-98ba-5e2158097171'}, {'abstract': 'Adele is added to the lineup of Oscar performers, as the Bagger and just about everyone else predicted.', 'web_url': 'https://carpetbagger.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/24/adele-joins-the-ranks-of-tom-jones-and-a-ha/', 'snippet': 'Adele is added to the lineup of Oscar performers, as the Bagger and just about everyone else predicted.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Well, we called it (as did anyone with a smidgen of pop culture savvy): Adele will be performing at the Oscars. She’ll sing her nominated song, “Skyfall,” the first Bond theme to be an Oscar nominee since “For Your Eyes Only” in 1981.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Adele Joins the Ranks of Tom Jones and a-ha', 'kicker': 'Carpetbagger', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Academy Awards (Oscars)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Adele (Singer)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-24T15:00:2