inley', 'qualifier': 'Jr', 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a2d12609-3aac-5a14-94d4-c1ca7949e917', 'word_count': 154, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a2d12609-3aac-5a14-94d4-c1ca7949e917'}, {'abstract': 'The actress celebrates her new film at Sundance in a furry shell and leather pencil skirt.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/24/look-of-the-moment-kate-bosworth-4/', 'snippet': 'The actress celebrates her new film at Sundance in a furry shell and leather pencil skirt.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Look: Snow Bunny. A furry shell and leather pencil skirt get a one-two punch with hits of white accessories. Glossy hair, lips and clutch combat all that matte.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Look of The Moment | Kate Bosworth', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bosworth, Kate', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Calvin Klein Inc', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Park City (Utah)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-24T18:08:15+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Edward Barsamian', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Edward', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Barsamian', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/38086638-9b91-51d6-a28e-4b2bd3319f5b', 'word_count': 55, 'uri': 'nyt://article/38086638-9b91-51d6-a28e-4b2bd3319f5b'}, {'abstract': 'Getty Images and Luminate, a company that specializes in making digital images interactive, are working together to embed information about Web sites, Twitter feeds and articles in Getty photographs.', 'web_url': 'https://mediadecoder.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/24/partnership-gives-web-surfers-more-than-just-images/', 'snippet': 'Getty Images and Luminate, a company that specializes in making digital images interactive, are working together to embed information about Web sites, Twitter feeds and articles in Getty photographs.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Just viewing images of celebrities like Kim Kardashian might satisfy some Web surfers, but a new partnership between Getty Images and Luminate, a company that specializes in making digital images interactive, is bringing a new experience to more inquisitive viewers.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Partnership Gives Web Surfers More Than Just Images', 'kicker': 'Media Decoder', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ADVERTISING AND MARKETING', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Computers and the Internet', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Photography', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hilton, Perez', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kardashian, Kim', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Getty Images', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Twitter', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-24T18:09:29+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By Tanzina Vega', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Tanzina', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Vega', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2872aff1-19bf-5c68-b3d5-8fa4ed71617c', 'word_count': 269, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2872aff1-19bf-5c68-b3d5-8fa4ed71617c'}, {'abstract': 'Data retrieved from an All Nippon Airways jet that was forced to make an emergency landing last week suggested the battery had not been charged beyond its maximum design voltage, the authorities said.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/24/business/global/boeing-787-battery-wasnt-overcharged-japanese-investigators-say.html', 'snippet': 'Data retrieved from an All Nippon Airways jet that was forced to make an emergency landing last week suggested the battery had not been charged beyond its maximum design voltage, the authorities said.', 'lead_paragraph': 'TOKYO — The Japanese investigation into a battery that overheated and prompted the emergency landing of a Boeing 787 airliner last week has found no evidence that the battery was overcharged, a top aviation safety official said Wednesday, casting doubts on one recent explanation put forward by Japanese investigators and clouding the U.S. aircraft maker’s efforts to get its planes back in the air.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Boeing 787 Battery Wasn’t Overcharged, Japanese Investigators Say', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Boeing Company', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'ALL NIPPON AIRWAYS', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Batteries', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'AIRLINES AND AIRPLANES', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Accidents and Safety', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-24T18:16:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Global Business', 'byline': {'original': 'By Hiroko Tabuchi', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Hiroko', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Tabuchi', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization'