_count': 842, 'uri': 'nyt://article/926787ed-e1bb-569e-931c-1862b19183b7'}, {'abstract': 'The Pentagon’s decision shatters the second of two modern military myths.', 'web_url': 'https://takingnote.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/24/women-in-combat/', 'snippet': 'The Pentagon’s decision shatters the second of two modern military myths.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Pentagon’s decision to end the official ban on women in combat positions shatters the second of the two modern military myths. The first was that gay people were not serving in the military; they were, but they had to hide and lie. The other was that women were not already in combat; they were, but their role was not fully acknowledged.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Women in Combat', 'kicker': 'Taking Note', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Same-Sex Marriage, Civil Unions and Domestic Partnerships', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Defense Department', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-24T19:06:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andrew Rosenthal', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andrew', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rosenthal', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/aa1dbf4b-c919-5468-88bd-f3770f62ee67', 'word_count': 456, 'uri': 'nyt://article/aa1dbf4b-c919-5468-88bd-f3770f62ee67'}, {'abstract': 'Several livery cab companies in New York have reported an increase in business as students and parents must find new ways to get to school.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/25/nyregion/as-new-york-school-bus-drivers-strike-livery-cabs-profit.html', 'snippet': 'Several livery cab companies in New York have reported an increase in business as 