545c-a711-8c225a1c33ea'}, {'abstract': 'The German soprano Dorothea Röschmann, accompanied by Malcolm Martineau, performed Goethe songs by Schubert and Wolf at Zankel Hall.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/25/arts/music/dorothea-roschmann-at-zankel-hall.html', 'snippet': 'The German soprano Dorothea Röschmann, accompanied by Malcolm Martineau, performed Goethe songs by Schubert and Wolf at Zankel Hall.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Sublimity is a term that should never be used lightly. Still, it was unavoidable in the best moments — and there were plenty — of a recital that the German soprano Dorothea Röschmann presented at Zankel Hall on Wednesday evening. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/25/arts/25DOROTHEA_SPAN/25DOROTHEA_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/01/25/arts/25DOROTHEA_SPAN/25DOROTHEA_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/25/arts/25DOROTHEA_SPAN/25DOROTHEA_SPAN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/25/arts/25DOROTHEA_SPAN/25DOROTHEA_SPAN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/25/arts/25DOROTHEA_SPAN/25DOROTHEA_SPAN-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/01/25/arts/25DOROTHEA_SPAN/25DOROTHEA_SPAN-thumbStandard-