-5f88-b6ed-3e2b02c90381'}, {'abstract': 'Citing injury concerns, the Yankees are dubious about letting the veteran left-hander pitch in the world Baseball Classic.', 'web_url': 'https://bats.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/24/torre-not-sure-if-pettitte-will-pitch-for-u-s/', 'snippet': 'Citing injury concerns, the Yankees are dubious about letting the veteran left-hander pitch in the world Baseball Classic.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Andy Pettitte may still be added to United States roster for the World Baseball Classic before the Feb. 20 deadline, according to Joe Torre, the manager of the team. Torre said he and Pettitte had been discussing the possibility of Pettitte pitching in the tournament for almost a year, but the Yankees recently expressed their concern after it was first reported that Pettitte would pitch.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Torre Not Sure if Pettitte Will Pitch for U.S.', 'kicker': 'Bats', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'World Baseball Classic', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Pettitte, Andy', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Torre, Joe', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Yankees', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-25T01:24:44+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By David Waldstein', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Waldstein', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/fe514e5d-b59f-58a9-b51b-282bfd58c478', 'word_count': 390, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fe514e5d-b59f-58a9-b51b-282bfd58c478'}, {'abstract': 'After a misdiagnosis and an amputation of both legs, Connie Spears found it difficult to find a malpractice lawyer and may now be liable for thousands of dollars because of tort reform.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/25/us/even-with-counsel-texas-amputee-is-hindered-by-state-tort-laws.html', 'snippet': 'After a misdiagnosis and an amputation of both legs, Connie Spears found it difficult to find a malpractice lawyer and may now be liable for thousands of dollars because of tort reform.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SAN ANTONIO —\xa0When Connie Spears arrived at a Christus Santa Rosa hospital emergency room in 2010 with severe leg pain, she told medical staff members about her history of blood clots. Doctors sent her home with a far less serious diagnosis. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '23A', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/25/us/25ttTort1/25ttTort1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 409, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/01/25/us/25ttTort1/25ttTort1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 409}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/25/us/25ttTort1/25ttTort1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 699, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/25/us/25ttTort1/25ttTort1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1397, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/25/us/25ttTort1/25ttTort1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/01/25/us/25ttTort1/25ttTort1-thumbSta