n, the maximum sought by federal prosecutors. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Planner of Mumbai Attacks Is Given a 35-Year Sentence', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Planner of Mumbai Attacks Is Given a 35-Year Sentence', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Headley, David Coleman', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Yaccino, Steven', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sentences (Criminal)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'India', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Terrorism', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-25T01:30:19+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Steven Yaccino', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Steven', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Yaccino', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e9684b7c-69d6-5798-b413-b6500430ee7b', 'word_count': 394, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e9684b7c-69d6-5798-b413-b6500430ee7b'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Selman, who was said to have a low I.Q. but was an active fund-raiser for multiple causes, was the subject of the 2002 documentary “The Collector of Bedford Street.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/25/nyregion/larry-selman-a-shepherd-of-greenwich-village-dies-at-70.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Selman, who was said to have a low I.Q. but was an active fund-raiser for multiple causes, was the subject of the 2002 documentary “The Collector of Bedford Street.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'Larry Selman weighed three pounds when he was born on April 2, 1942, and was not expected to survive the day. He rallied, though, grew to become a friendly, husky boy and attended public school until he was about 16, when a teacher explained to him that he would probably never earn a high school diploma because, by all measures, Larry was — in the parlance of the 1950s — mentally retarded. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/26/sports/Selman2/Selman2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 437, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/01/26/sports/Selman2/Selman2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 437}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/26/sports/Selman2/Selman2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 745, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/26/sports/Selman2/Selman2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 985, 'width': 1353, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/26/sports/Selman2/Selman2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/01/26/sports/Selman2/Selman2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/26/sports/Selman2/Selman2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Larry Selman, Who Aided Others $1 at a Time, Dies at 70', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Larry Selman Dies at 70; Aided Others $1 at a Time', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Vitello, Paul', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Selman, Larry', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'The Collector of Bedford Street (Movie)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Greenwich Village (Manhattan, NY)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Obituaries)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-25T01:34:07+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Paul Vitello', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Paul', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Vitello', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Obituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/fcacc719-53f5-5668-8de2-4be86cc02cb8', 'word_count': 729, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fcacc719-53f5-5668-8de2-4be86cc02cb8'}, {'abstract': 'Werner Herzog’s “Happy People: A Year in the Taiga” is a seasonal portrait focusing on fur trappers in the vast Siberian taiga.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/25/movies/werner-herzogs-happy-people-a-year-in-the-taiga.html', 'snippet': 'Werner Herzog’s “Happy People: A Year in the Taiga” is a seasonal portrait focusing on fur trappers in the vast Siberian taiga.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A consummate explorer-filmmaker, Werner Herzog endeavors in his documentaries to take us into places (and states) we didn’t know we could go to: the Chauvet cave, the Antarctic, the last days of a bear enthusiast. In “Happy People: A Year in the Taiga,” Mr. Herzog airdrops us into the vast Siberian taiga (a sprawling region of subarctic forest) for a seasonal portrait focusing on fur trappers. Rather than his customary foray into the abyss, this film is a quaint throwback to the illustrated chronicles of television nature documentaries or, for that matter, “Nanook of the North.”', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'mult