'abstract': 'North Korea issues more threats, a prince runs for president of the Czech Republic, and sumo wrestling is dominated by non-Japanese competitors.', 'web_url': 'https://rendezvous.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/25/iht-quick-read-jan-25/', 'snippet': 'North Korea issues more threats, a prince runs for president of the Czech Republic, and sumo wrestling is dominated by non-Japanese competitors.', 'lead_paragraph': ' NEWS  A blunt and explicit threat on Thursday from North Korea that its weapons programs would “target” the United States, and that it would proceed with a third and “higher-level” nuclear test, poses a stark challenge to the Obama administration at a time when it hoped to focus its major diplomatic effort on restraining Iran’s less-advanced nuclear program. David E. Sanger reports from Washington and Choe Sang-Hun from Seoul.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/25/world/africa/25militant/25militant-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 402, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/01/25/world/africa/25militant/25militant-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 402}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/25/world/africa/25militant/25militant-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 686, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/25/world/africa/25militant/25militant-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1371, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/25/world/africa/25militant/25militant-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbn