'uri': 'nyt://article/81d34421-1845-585a-9d27-d62f18d2a94e'}, {'abstract': 'Alison Brady’s images — of contorted bodies, hidden faces and oddly familiar rooms — are unsettling, an effort to explore the fear that is triggered when our reality is uncomfortably distorted.', 'web_url': 'https://lens.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/25/familiar-rooms-hidden-faces/', 'snippet': 'Alison Brady’s images — of contorted bodies, hidden faces and oddly familiar rooms — are unsettling, an effort to explore the fear that is triggered when our reality is uncomfortably distorted.', 'lead_paragraph': 'If looking at Alison Brady’s photographs makes you inexplicably uncomfortable, then she has accomplished her goal. Her images are carefully structured to blend the familiar with the unknown — antique furniture and vintage fabrics juxtaposed with unnaturally twisted body forms — with the hope of getting viewers to ask one question: “I know these objects, but why does this all feel so foreign?” ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Familiar Rooms, Hidden Faces', 'kicker': 'Lens', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-01-25T10:00:54+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Multimedia/Photos', 'byline': {'original': 'By Whitney Richardson', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Whitney', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Richardson', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a1d6056d-4c94-5429-b95c-f4f68621d268', 'word_count': 761, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a1d6056d-4c94-5429-b95c-f4f68621d268'}, {'abstract': 'What was the reason? Was it too expensive? Was it against your parents’ values?', 'web_url': 'https://learning.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/25/have-you-ever-wanted-a-toy-really-badly-but-werent-allowed-to-get-it/', 'snippet': 'What was the reason? Was it too expensive? Was it against your parents’ values?', 'lead_paragraph': 'Was there a toy you coveted as a child, but couldn’t have because it was too impractical or expensive, because your parents were philosophically opposed to it, or for some other reason? What was it, and why did you want it so much?', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/16/nyregion/16doll-span-LN/16doll-span-LN-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/01/16/nyregion/16doll-span-LN/16doll-span-LN-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/16/nyregion/16doll-span-LN/16doll-span-LN-jumbo-v4.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/16/nyregion/16doll-span-LN/16doll-span-LN-superJumbo-v4.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/16/nyregion/16doll-span-LN/16doll-span-LN-thumbStandard-v5.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/01/16/nyregion/16doll-span-LN/16doll-span-LN-thumbStandard-v5.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/16/nyregion/16doll-span-LN/16doll-span-LN-thumbLarge-v5.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Was There a Toy You Wanted as a