ckman responded to comments by Carl C. Icahn. | James P. Gorman, the chief executive of Morgan Stanley, is expected to take another pay cut,...', 'lead_paragraph': 'ACKMAN VS. ICAHN, THE REMATCH \xa0|\xa0 A high-profile feud on Wall Street went another round on Thursday, when the hedge fund manager William A. Ackman responded to comments by Carl C. Icahn. In a scathing news release, Mr. Ackman questioned his opponent’s integrity after Mr. Icahn publicly criticized Mr. Ackman’s method in betting against Herbalife, a nutritional supplements company.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Ackman Vs. Icahn, the Rematch', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-01-25T13:39:19+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By William Alden', 'person': [{'firstname': 'William', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Alden', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6564e89d-b7cd-5971-993a-f8e9edac5478', 'word_count': 2054, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6564e89d-b7cd-5971-993a-f8e9edac5478'}, {'abstract': 'It was the first deadly confrontation in more than a month of antigovernment protests by mostly Sunni opponents of Prime Minister Nuri Kamal al-Maliki.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/26/world/middleeast/clashes-turn-deadly-after-iraqi-forces-open-fire-on-protesters.html', 'snippet': 'It was the first deadly confrontation in more than a month of antigovernment protests by mostly Sunni opponents of Prime Minister Nuri Kamal al-Maliki.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BAGHDAD — At least seven protesters and two soldiers were killed Friday in clashes that started after Iraqi Army forces opened fire on demonstrators who had pelted them with rocks on the outskirts of Falluja, w