 'Andy Murray defeated Roger Federer for the first time in a slam event and has advanced to face Novak Djokovic in the final.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/26/sports/tennis/murray-outduels-federer-and-heads-to-australian-open-final.html', 'snippet': 'Andy Murray defeated Roger Federer for the first time in a slam event and has advanced to face Novak Djokovic in the final.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MELBOURNE — It was quite a night of tennis and ultimately a rough night for Roger Federer, who not only swore in the direction of Andy Murray but was also beaten in a Grand Slam tournament for the first time by Murray.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/26/sports/tennis/26iht-net26-murray/26iht-net26-murray-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 808, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/01/26/sports/tennis/26iht-net26-murray/26iht-net26-murray-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 808}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/26/sports/tennis/26iht-net26-murray/26iht-net26-murray-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 760, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/26/sports/tennis/26iht-net26-murray/26iht-net26-murray-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1520, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/26/sports/tennis/26iht-net26-murray/26iht-net26-murray-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/01/26/sports/tennis/26iht