ased, was hit by a private charter bus while crossing East 105th Street near Avenue K in Brooklyn around 7:15 a.m.', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/25/woman-killed-by-a-bus-in-canarsie/', 'snippet': 'A woman, whose name was not released, was hit by a private charter bus while crossing East 105th Street near Avenue K in Brooklyn around 7:15 a.m.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A woman was struck and killed by a private charter bus while crossing a street in Canarsie, Brooklyn, on Friday morning, the police said. No charges were filed against the driver, the police said. The woman, whose name was not released, was hit while crossing East 105th Street near Avenue K around 7:15 a.m. She is in her 40s, the police said. Her husband told NBC 4 New York that she was crossing the street to catch a city bus when the private bus turned left off Avenue K and struck her.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Woman Fatally Struck by a Bus in Canarsie', 'kicker': 'City Room', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Traffic Accidents and Safety', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Canarsie (Brooklyn, NY)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-25T16:21:20+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andy Newman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Newman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f94c2593-b0d4-5e7d-a59c-25ef4c4a5657', 'word_count': 92, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f94c2593-b0d4-5e7d-a59c-25ef4c4a5657'}, {'abstract': 'Go diving off the coast of Malaysia to experience what Jacques Cousteau called “an untouched piece of art.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/travel/100000002024533/watery-wonders.html', 'snippet': 'Go diving off the coast of Malaysia to experience what Jacques Cousteau called “an untouched piece of art.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'Go diving off the coast of Malaysia to experience what Jacques Cousteau called “an untouched piece of art.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/27/travel/27-journeys-video-still/27-journeys-video-still-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 450, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/01/27/travel/27-journeys-video-still/27-journeys-video-still-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 450}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/27/travel/27-journeys-video-still/27-journeys-video-still-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 480, 'width': 640, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/27/travel/27-journeys-video-still/27-journeys-video-still-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 480, 'width': 640, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/27/travel/27-journeys-video-still/27-journeys-video-still-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/01/27/travel/27-journeys-video-still/27-journeys-video-still-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/27/travel/27-journeys-video-still/27-journeys-video-still-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline