son’s 1994 murder, Al Valentin worked for stricter laws. But that work took a toll on him, and he wonders if the public realizes the price of advocacy.', 'lead_paragraph': '“FOR SALE BY OWNER” declares a sign on the porch of Al Valentin’s house on Ellis Avenue in the Bronx. Inside the spotless brick home, he shows off the place like the seasoned real estate pro that he is. Soft light. Solid floors. And not only one basement level, but two – and all done according to code. In the back, where a pool once was, a barbecue pit.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/25/nyregion/25cityroom-sidestreet/25cityroom-sidestreet-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 446, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/01/25/nyregion/25cityroom-sidestreet/25cityroom-sidestreet-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 446}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/25/nyregion/25cityroom-sidestreet/25cityroom-sidestreet-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 762, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/25/nyregion/25cityroom-sidestreet/25cityroom-sidestreet-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1524, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/25/nyregion/25cityroom-sidestreet/25cityroom-sidestreet-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/01/25/nyregion/25cityroom-sidestreet/25cityroom-sidestreet-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 7