Middle East are not exotic or abstract destinations for David Muehlke and Patricia Choi. They are, in fact, places where Mr. Muehlke, a foreign service officer at the State Department, and Ms. Choi, a public health adviser at the Department of Health and Human Services, have staked their futures and that of the family that they hope to have one day. ', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/27/fashion/weddings/27VOWS1_SPAN/27VOWS1_SPAN-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 385, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/01/27/fashion/weddings/27VOWS1_SPAN/27VOWS1_SPAN-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 385}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/27/fashion/weddings/27VOWS1_SPAN/27VOWS1_SPAN-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 657, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/27/fashion/weddings/27VOWS1_SPAN/27VOWS1_SPAN-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1313, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/27/fashion/weddings/27VOWS1_SPAN/27VOWS1_SPAN-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/01/27/fashion/weddings/27VOWS1_SPAN/27VOWS1_SPAN-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/27/fashion/weddings/27VOWS1_SPAN/27VOWS1_SPAN-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subTyp