_id': 'nyt://article/20c4ef7c-d73f-5e4b-9972-7343204a02c6', 'word_count': 377, 'uri': 'nyt://article/20c4ef7c-d73f-5e4b-9972-7343204a02c6'}, {'abstract': 'A painting by Charles Le Brun, one of the masters of 17th-century French art, hung for decades at the Hôtel Ritz Paris before art experts recently recognized it for what it was, the auction house Christie’s announced.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/25/a-17th-century-masterpiece-discovered-at-the-ritz-in-paris/', 'snippet': 'A painting by Charles Le Brun, one of the masters of 17th-century French art, hung for decades at the Hôtel Ritz Paris before art experts recently recognized it for what it was, the auction house Christie’s announced.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PARIS – The Hôtel Ritz Paris, famous for its bar, its swimming pool and its assignations, had a treasure hiding in plain sight, an exceptional painting that had been hanging on a wall for decades without anyone paying it the least attention.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/25/arts/artsspecial/25LEBRUN1/25LEBRUN1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 822, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/01/25/arts/artsspecial/25LEBRUN1/25LEBRUN1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 822}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/25/arts/artsspecial/25LEBRUN1/25LEBRUN1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 748, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/25/arts/artsspecial/25LEBRUN1/25LEBRUN1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1495, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbn