ization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7f598a54-e617-5383-88d7-e9c323843b52', 'word_count': 12, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7f598a54-e617-5383-88d7-e9c323843b52'}, {'abstract': 'Some protesters dressed from head to toe in black, covered their faces with bandannas or kerchiefs and brandished black flags as they skirmished with security forces.', 'web_url': 'https://thelede.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/25/a-black-bloc-emerges-in-egypt/', 'snippet': 'Some protesters dressed from head to toe in black, covered their faces with bandannas or kerchiefs and brandished black flags as they skirmished with security forces.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Last Updated, Saturday, 10:17 a.m. While using Twitter to narrate events in Tahrir Square on Friday, people in Egypt described tires burning in the street, protesters blocking traffic and hurling rocks, and police officers launching tear gas in an effort to break up crowds that had gathered to protest against the Muslim Brotherhood and the country’s new Islamist president.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A ‘Black Bloc’ Emerges in Egypt', 'kicker': 'The Lede', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Middle East and North Africa Unrest (2010- )', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Cairo (Egypt)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Egypt', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-26T00:13:16+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Blogs', 'byline': {'original': 'By Colin Moynihan', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Colin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Moynihan', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d96031aa-1f35-534d-938a-d29a6733d899', 'word_count': 658, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d96031aa-1f35-534d-938a-d29a6733d899'}, {'abstract': 'A minor furor erupted Friday after Yankees General Manager Brian Cashman said in a radio interview on WFAN that it was possible Alex Rodriguez could miss the entire season, which is true. But it is not the expected outcome, he said.', 'web_url': 'https://bats.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/25/could-rodriguez-miss-season-yes-is-it-likely-no-cashman-says/', 'snippet': 'A minor furor erupted Friday after Yankees General Manager Brian Cashman said in a radio interview on WFAN that it was possible Alex Rodriguez could miss the entire season, which is true. But it is not the expected outcome, he said.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Brian Cashman, the Yankees’ general manager, said it was “not likely” that Alex Rodriguez would miss the 2013 season because of his hip surgery.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/29/sports/baseball/29alex/29alex-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 414, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/01/29/sports/baseball/29alex/29alex-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 414}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/29/sports/baseball/29alex/29alex-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 707, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/29/sports/baseball/29alex/29alex-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1414, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/29/sports/baseball/29alex/29alex-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'im