Rainer, a founder of the experimental collective Judson Dance Theater, revives a 50-year-old piece from the Judson era, and two newer works that reflect on age.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Judson Now, Danspace Project’s series celebrating the 50th anniversary of the first concerts by the experimental collective Judson Dance Theater, ended in December. But on Thursday it got a coda, the rescheduling of a program that had been canceled because of Hurricane Sandy. The program was Yvonne Rainer’s, and Ms. Rainer cannot be skipped.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/26/arts/26RAINER/26RAINER-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 387, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/01/26/arts/26RAINER/26RAINER-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 387}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/26/arts/26RAINER/26RAINER-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 660, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/26/arts/26RAINER/26RAINER-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1319, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/26/arts/26RAINER/26RAINER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/01/26/arts/26RAINER/26RAINER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/26/arts/26RAINER/26RAINER-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 15