'https://kristof.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/26/getting-more-women-in-leadership/', 'snippet': 'A few more thoughts to go with my column on why we don’t see more women leaders — and how we change that.', 'lead_paragraph': 'My Sunday column is from Davos and uses Sheryl Sandberg’s forthcoming book to look at the persistent gender gap in the US and around the world. Sandberg’s book is going to rub some women the wrong way, because she says that part of the problem is women not being assertive enough. But I think it’s an excellent and important book that spotlights a good point that has to be part of the conversation — as long as it doesn’t distract us from a relentless focus on making the workplace more accommodating to women and families.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Getting More Women in Leadership', 'kicker': 'Nicholas Kristof', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Discrimination', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Women and Girls', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Davos (Switzerland)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-26T20:12:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nicholas Kristof', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nicholas', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kristof', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/eaa5f328-6b73-553b-8c8f-132ba418ec6e', 'word_count': 381, 'uri': 'nyt://article/eaa5f328-6b73-553b-8c8f-132ba418ec6e'}, {'abstract': 'In good times and bad, Apple’s stock has often gone its own way. But shares of I.B.M., whose market value isn’t as high, still appear to have more influence on the overall market.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/27/your-money/apple-stock-isnt-a-bellwether-even-if-its-big.html', 'snippet': 'In good times and bad, Apple’s stock has often gone its own way. But shares of I.B.M., whose market value isn’t as high, still appear to have more influence on the overall market.', 'lead_paragraph': 'THE rise of Apple shares over the last few years was meteoric. Their fall over last few days has been traumatic. But these gyrations may not matter much to the overall stock market.', 'print_section': 'BU', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/27/business/27-STRA/27-STRA-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 270, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/01/27/business/27-STRA/27-STRA-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 270}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/27/business/27-STRA/27-STRA-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 461, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/27/business/27-STRA/27-STRA-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 922, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/27/business/27-STRA/27-STRA-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/01/27/business/27-STRA/27-STRA-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/27/business/27-STRA/27-STRA-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}]