'word_count': 837, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9251e57f-2cfc-5e67-aff9-f4dc22220c23'}, {'abstract': 'Deron Williams scored 20 points in the first quarter but was held to 7 points the rest of the game, and the Nets struggled to contain Houston early.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/27/sports/basketball/deron-williams-starts-strong-but-nets-dont-follow-in-loss-to-rockets.html', 'snippet': 'Deron Williams scored 20 points in the first quarter but was held to 7 points the rest of the game, and the Nets struggled to contain Houston early.', 'lead_paragraph': 'HOUSTON — There was a point Saturday when Deron Williams’s shooting touch was so scorching that his teammates flatly avoided him, the way they might recede from a bowler edging toward a 300 game. As the first quarter ended, and Williams still had not missed, there was a sense he might be on the verge of something spectacular.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/27/sports/basketball/27nets-1/27nets-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/01/27/sports/basketball/27nets-1/27nets-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/27/sports/basketball/27nets-1/27nets-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/27/sports/basketball/27nets-1/27nets-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/27/sports/baske