earned information declines with age, but it was not clear why. A new study may provide part of the answer.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Aging in Brain Found to Hurt Sleep Needed for Memory', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Aging in Brain Found to Hurt Sleep Needed For Memory', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sleep', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Carey, Benedict', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Memory', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Nature Neuroscience (Journal)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Brain', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Medicine and Health', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-27T18:18:27+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'Health', 'byline': {'original': 'By Benedict Carey', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Benedict', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Carey', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0292b4cb-5ad9-5a91-bc26-cf754d42caf1', 'word_count': 712, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0292b4cb-5ad9-5a91-bc26-cf754d42caf1'}, {'abstract': '“Fuse News,” a daily show reporting on the music world and its personalities, will make its debut on Feb. 6. Fuse will also broadcast a live special at the red carpet of the Grammy Awards on Feb. 10.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/27/fuse-channels-music-news-show-fuse-news-to-start-in-february/', 'snippet': '“Fuse News,” a daily show reporting on the music world and its personalities, will make its debut on Feb. 6. Fuse will also broadcast a live special at the red carpet of the Grammy Awards on Feb. 10.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As the recording indus