, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Magazines', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-28T01:13:37+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Television', 'byline': {'original': 'By Robert D. McFadden', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Robert', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Obituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/8aa9075e-c4b7-5fbb-9fa6-b1083c0c3807', 'word_count': 1080, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8aa9075e-c4b7-5fbb-9fa6-b1083c0c3807'}, {'abstract': 'The midwife put a cut in the top of a piece of paper and pulled. The paper ripped cleanly in half. “That’s what happens to a woman’s perineum when you do an episiotomy,” she explained.', 'web_url': 'https://parenting.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/27/what-you-dont-know-about-episiotomies-can-hurt-you/', 'snippet': 'The midwife put a cut in the top of a piece of paper and pulled. The paper ripped cleanly in half. “That’s what happens to a woman’s perineum when you do an episiotomy,” she explained.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When Cyndi Sellers’s son was born at a hospital in southern Oregon, the obstetrician on call rushed in with wet hair wearing a tie-dye T-shirt, as if she had just been swimming. After only a few minutes in the room, the doctor then cut an episiotomy so long that Cyndi’s mother — who was watching the birth — later described it as “horrifying.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'What You Don’t Know About Episiotomies Can Hurt You', 'kicker': 'Motherlode', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Doctors', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Midwives', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Parenting', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Pregnancy and Childbirth', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Vagina', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-28T01:15:32+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jennifer Margulis', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jennifer', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Margulis', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/acfd0365-1f98-5642-8543-317a2c93f5f5', 'word_count': 932, 'uri': 'nyt://article/acfd0365-1f98-5642-8543-317a2c93f5f5'}, {'abstract': 'Golf’s governing bodies won’t decide until the spring whether belly putters should be disallowed, but just the threat of a change has golfers choosing other putters instead.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/28/sports/golf/proposed-golf-rule-changes-pushes-long-putters-out-of-style.html', 'snippet': 'Golf’s governing bodies won’t decide until the spring whether belly putters should be disallowed, but just the threat of a change has golfers choosing other putters instead.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ORLANDO, Fla. — A buzz surrounded the variety of belly-length and long putters found throughout the showroom floor at last year’s annual PGA Merchandise Show at Orange County Convention Center. But at this year’s event, the biggest buzz around these overlength clubs was their destiny.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/28/sports/YPUTTERS/YPUTTERS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 938, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/01/28/sports/YPUTTERS/YPUTTERS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 938}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/28/sports/YPUTTERS/YPUTTERS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 655, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/28/sports/YPUTTERS/YPUTTERS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1310, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/28/sports/YPUTTERS/YPUTTERS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/01/28/sports/YPUTTERS/YPUTTERS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/28/sports/YPUTTERS/YPUTTERS-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Makers of Long Putters Await Verdict on Rules', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Makers of Long Putters Await Verdict on Rules', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Golf', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United States Golf Assn', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Royal and Ancient Golf Club', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-28T01:17:08+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Golf', 'byline': {'original': 'By Lisa D. Mickey', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Lisa', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/eb9d8845-8296-5465-ac71-dcc8250bd8fb', 'word_count': 783, 'uri': 'nyt://article/eb9d8845-8296-5465-ac71-dcc8250b