incoln.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'LOS ANGELES — The Screen Actors Guild chose the acting ensemble of “Argo” for its top prize, continuing the recent sweep that Ben Affleck’s film has been enjoying on the road to the Oscars. Mr. Affleck, a star and the director of the movie, thanked its multilingual cast in his speech.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '‘Argo,’ Daniel Day-Lewis and Jennifer Lawrence Win at SAGs', 'kicker': 'Carpetbagger', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Actors Guild Likes ‘Argo’ Actors', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Baldwin, Alec', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cranston, Bryan', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Danes, Claire', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Day-Lewis, Daniel', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Fey, Tina', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hathaway, Anne', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jones, Tommy Lee', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lawrence, Jennifer', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Screen Actors Guild', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-28T03:14:24+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Melena Ryzik', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Melena', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ryzik', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/755ee432-bcce-52c9-bffb-f4594866dbf7', 'word_count': 185, 'uri': 'nyt://article/755ee432-bcce-52c9-bffb-f4594866dbf7'}, {'abstract': 'Aaron Liberman, a freshman at Northwestern and an Orthodox Jew, is 6 feet 10 inches of lean muscle, topped on and off the court by a skullcap.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/28/sports/ncaabasketball/northwesterns-aaron-liberman-studies-xs-os-and-torah.html', 'snippet': 'Aaron Liberman, a freshman at Northwestern and an Orthodox Jew, is 6 feet 10 inches of lean muscle, topped on and off the court by a skullcap.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CHICAGO — On a dark and cold morning last month, 19-year-old Aaron Liberman woke at his apartment and walked a block and a half to a two-story, redbrick synagogue in West Rogers Park, a predominantly Orthodox Jewish neighborhood in northwest Chicago. Inside, he was met by the hum of worship and a smattering of older men — some in black hats, some wrapped in prayer shawls — seated at long tables, surrounded by shelves packed with books, Hebrew letters on their spines.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/28/sports/YORTHODOX1/YORTHODOX1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/01/28/sports/YORTHODOX1/YORTHODOX1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/28/sports/YORTHODOX1/YORTHODOX1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/28/sports/YORTHODOX1/YORTHODOX1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/28/sports/YORTHODOX1/YORTHODOX1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_n