ughter, Whitney Houston, nearly a year ago. Eventually joined by her son Michael Houston, she recounts what she knew about her daughter’s drug use, how she felt about her marriage to the R&B singer Bobby Brown and the real story behind her relationship with her best high school friend, Robyn Crawford. Her book “Remembering Whitney: My Story of Love, Loss, and the Night the Music Stopped” will be released Tuesday. “Remembering Whitney: The Oprah Interview,” a two-hour interview from “The Oprah Winfrey Show” in September 2009, in which Whitney Houston discussed her drug abuse and marriage, and performed “I Didn’t Know My Own Strength,” is rebroadcast at 8.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'What’s on Monday', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'What’s On Today', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-01-28T05:15:08+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Television', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kathryn Shattuck', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kathryn', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Shattuck', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Schedule', '_id': 'nyt://article/efec146c-80dd-58e9-b4e0-2d9f2e166b5b', 'word_count': 730, 'uri': 'nyt://article/efec146c-80dd-58e9-b4e0-2d9f2e166b5b'}, {'abstract': 'A framework developed by a bipartisan group of senators outlines four basic legislative pillars for comprehensive immigration reform.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/interactive/2013/01/23/us/politics/28immigration-principles-document.html', 'snippet': 'A framework developed by a bipartisan group of senators outlines four basic legislative pillars for comprehensive immigration reform.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A framework developed by a bipartisan group of senators outlines four basic legis