s major involvement.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/29/world/africa/timbuktu-mali-france-conflict.html', 'snippet': 'The rapid advance to Timbuktu, a day after French and African troops took control of the rebel stronghold of Gao, may spell the beginning of the end of France’s major involvement.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SÉGOU, Mali — French paratroopers arrived in the ancient desert oasis of Timbuktu on Monday, securing its airport and main roads as thousands of residents poured out of its narrow, mud-walled streets to greet French and Malian troops, waving the two countries’ flags, with whoops, cheers and shouts.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/29/world/africa/29Mali2_cnd/29Mali2_cnd-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 406, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/01/29/world/africa/29Mali2_cnd/29Mali2_cnd-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 406}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/29/world/africa/29Mali2_cnd/29Mali2_cnd-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 693, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/29/world/africa/29Mali2_cnd/29Mali2_cnd-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1386, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/29/world/africa/29Mali2_cnd/29Mali2_cnd-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/01/29/world/africa/29Mali2_cnd/29Mali2_cnd-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumb