111-5306-510f-b84b-9cd0ec3edffb'}, {'abstract': 'The violent mob frenzies that broke out in response to epidemics of the 19th century are long gone. Now, managing panic is as challenging as fighting disease.', 'web_url': 'https://opinionator.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/28/a-brief-history-of-panic/', 'snippet': 'The violent mob frenzies that broke out in response to epidemics of the 19th century are long gone. Now, managing panic is as challenging as fighting disease.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In September of 1873, United States Senator J.R. West of Louisiana received a telegram from his home state whose terse lines spoke of abject desperation:', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Brief History of Panic', 'kicker': 'Anxiety', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Anxiety and Stress', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Epidemics', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Preventive Medicine', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Swine Influenza', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-28T12:00:54+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Amy L. Fairchild, David Merritt Johns and Kavita Sivaramakrishnan', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Amy', 'middlename': 'L.', 'lastname': 'Fairchild', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': 'Merritt', 'lastname': 'Johns', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}, {'firstname': 'Kavita', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sivaramakrishnan', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 3}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7ad6123f-b92e-5b09-82e5-8022fbf30039', 'word_count': 1587, 'uri': 'nyt://a