lifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/fc1be228-63c1-52cf-b4e6-68093aa5494b', 'word_count': 1095, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fc1be228-63c1-52cf-b4e6-68093aa5494b'}, {'abstract': 'Even people who don’t care about football should be cheered that the Super Bowl is back at the Superdome.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/29/sports/for-new-orleans-bowl-is-a-happy-return-leading-off.html', 'snippet': 'Even people who don’t care about football should be cheered that the Super Bowl is back at the Superdome.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Let us be the first to welcome you officially to Super Bowl week, the annual gathering of N.F.L. worship that invades our planet and this year is destined to fill the streets of New Orleans with overindulged people imitating Ray Lewis’s celebration dance. There is nothing that can be done about this. We have already called Super Bowl week customer service. They said we just had to deal with it.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/29/sports/football/29leadingpic/29leadingpic-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/01/29/sports/football/29leadingpic/29leadingpic-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/29/sports/football/29leadingpic/29leadingpic-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/29/sports/football/29leadingpic/29leadingpic-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legac