/article/87510071-51a3-50ed-ab80-74eaf02cac87'}, {'abstract': 'For the Saints owner Tom Benson, who ultimately did not move his team after Hurricane Katrina, hosting the Super Bowl represents a crowning moment in New Orleans’s renaissance.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/29/sports/football/recovery-is-complete-for-saints-owner-tom-benson.html', 'snippet': 'For the Saints owner Tom Benson, who ultimately did not move his team after Hurricane Katrina, hosting the Super Bowl represents a crowning moment in New Orleans’s renaissance.', 'lead_paragraph': 'NEW ORLEANS — Tom Benson took his wife, Gayle, to Commander’s Palace last week, choosing that Garden District restaurant for dinner on the night when his basketball team was rebranded and a few days after his football team was reborn. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/29/sports/29benson/29benson-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/01/29/sports/29benson/29benson-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/29/sports/29benson/29benson-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/29/sports/29benson/29benson-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/29/sports/29benson/29benson-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail