ect of an agreement on overhauling immigration that could include a pathway to American citizenship for 11 million illegal immigrants', 'lead_paragraph': 'As my colleague Julia Preston reports, a bipartisan group of senators announced on Monday that they have agreed to work toward overhauling the immigration system with the aim of providing a pathway to American citizenship for 11 million illegal immigrants.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Online Reaction to Immigration Overhaul Plan', 'kicker': 'The Lede', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dream Act (Development, Relief and Education for Minors Act)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Immigration and Emigration', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Senate', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-28T23:03:20+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Blogs', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jennifer Preston', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jennifer', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Preston', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/00fa89be-7f91-5d92-ae8e-506d021d1feb', 'word_count': 382, 'uri': 'nyt://article/00fa89be-7f91-5d92-ae8e-506d021d1feb'}, {'abstract': 'The Bolshoi Ballet carries on even as a scandal swirls around it following an acid-throwing attack on its artistic director, possibly ordered by a rival.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/29/arts/dance/bolshoi-ballet-carries-on-amid-acid-attack-scandal.html', 'snippet': 'The Bolshoi Ballet carries on even as a scandal swirls around it following an acid-throwing attack on its artistic director, possibly ordered by a rival.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MOSCOW — At 7 p.m. on Sunday, the vast and intricate machine that is the Bolshoi Ballet swung into motion here. A fan switched on, sending the sacred flame that is the centerpiece of Act I flickering upward; the ropy vines of a primeval forest were pulled down taut with weights. Dancers peeled off layers of wool and took their positions with fixed professional smiles, rib cages pumping the air, as if everything were normal.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/29/arts/BOLSHOI/BOLSHOI-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 377, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/01/29/arts/BOLSHOI/BOLSHOI-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 377}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/29/arts/BOLSHOI/BOLSHOI-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 644, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/29/arts/BOLSHOI/BOLSHOI-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1288, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/29/arts/BOLSHOI/BOLSHOI-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/01/29/arts/BOLSHOI/BOLSHOI-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/29/arts/BOLSHOI/BOLSHOI-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Shaken but Determined, the Bolshoi Dances On', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Shaken but Determined, the Bolshoi Dances On', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dancing', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Bolshoi Ballet', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Filin, Sergei', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Assaults', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-28T23:03:52+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Dance', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ellen Barry', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ellen', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Barry', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f5399de2-06dd-553e-a6e4-aca6d802da17', 'word_count': 1370, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f5399de2-06dd-553e-a6e4-aca6d802da17'}, {'abstract': 'In a transitional time for the Miami City Ballet, with the departure of the artistic director Edward Villella, the performers look fine in works by Balanchine and Liam Scarlett.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/29/arts/dance/miami-city-ballet-in-liam-scarlett-work-at-kravis-center.html', 'snippet': 'In a transitional time for the Miami City Ballet, with the departure of the artistic director Edward Villella, the performers look fine in works by Balanchine and Liam Scarlett.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WEST PALM BEACH, Fla. — Miami City Ballet, one of America’s most beloved dance companies, is in an interim condition. Its repertory for the 2012-13 season was chosen by its departed artistic director, Edward Villella, but the company is led by his successor, Lourdes Lopez. While it’s too early to tell how the change in leadership will affect the company’s style, a recent visit showed the dancers in fine fettle.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', '