 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c8c6de00-217d-5144-9b90-e7a561628094', 'word_count': 301, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c8c6de00-217d-5144-9b90-e7a561628094'}, {'abstract': 'Dead or not, courtship was never all it’s cracked up to be, and there’s no one playbook for pairing off.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/29/opinion/bruni-manti-and-the-mating-game.html', 'snippet': 'Dead or not, courtship was never all it’s cracked up to be, and there’s no one playbook for pairing off.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As we wring our hands over the impulsive hookups and Internet hoaxes of modern romance, let us pause a moment and travel back to the days long before text messages, Photoshop and all other manner of digital bedlam. Let us return to a halcyon world of agrarian ways and contemplate the unflustered situation of a fertile lass on the cusp of womanhood centuries ago.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '23', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/03/opinion/frank-bruni/frank-bruni-articleLarge.png', 'height': 300, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/04/03/opinion/frank-bruni/frank-bruni-articleLarge.png', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 300}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/03/opinion/frank-bruni/frank-bruni-jumbo.png', 'height': 512, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/03/opinion/frank-bruni/frank-bruni-superJumbo.png', 'height': 1000, 'width': 2000, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/03/opinion/