f modern and contemporary art from her native India, will sell a portion of her collection at Sotheby’s in New York on March 19th, in the first single-owner evening sale of Indian art held at Sotheby’s in more than a decade.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/28/works-from-a-major-indian-art-collection-to-be-auctioned-at-sothebys/', 'snippet': 'Amrita Jhaveri, a former Christie’s art expert who is now a writer and a major collector of modern and contemporary art from her native India, will sell a portion of her collection at Sotheby’s in New York on March 19th, in the first single-owner ...', 'lead_paragraph': 'For more than a decade now Amrita Jhaveri has been quietly buying the best examples of modern and contemporary art from her native India. Ms. Jhaveri, a former Christie’s expert who is now a collector and writer, has decided to sell a portion of her collection at Sotheby’s in New York on March 19. It will be the first single-owner evening sale of Indian art held at Sotheby’s in more than a decade. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Works From a Major Indian Art Collection to Be Auctioned at Sotheby’s', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Sotheby’s to Offer Modern Indian Art', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Auctions', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Collectors and Collections', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Davidge, Christopher M', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mehta, Tyeb', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': "Christie's", 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': "Sotheby's", 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'India', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value':