World Health Organization’s focus on preventive medicine and vaccinations for children, but was criticized for mismanagement.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/29/world/asia/hiroshi-nakajima-leader-of-world-health-organization-dies-at-84.html', 'snippet': 'Dr. Nakajima enlarged the World Health Organization’s focus on preventive medicine and vaccinations for children, but was criticized for mismanagement.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Dr. Hiroshi Nakajima, a Japanese physician who as leader of the World Health Organization started campaigns to fight malaria and other infectious diseases but whose tenure, from 1988 to 1998, was marred by repeated accusations of mismanagement, died on Saturday in Poitiers, France. He was 84. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/29/world/NAKAJIMA-obit/NAKAJIMA-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 867, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/01/29/world/NAKAJIMA-obit/NAKAJIMA-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 867}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/29/world/NAKAJIMA-obit/NAKAJIMA-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 709, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/29/world/NAKAJIMA-obit/NAKAJIMA-obit-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1861, 'width': 1288, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/29/world/NAKAJIMA-obit/NAKAJIMA-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/01/29/wo