926-b8f9-2d91e87a61db'}, {'abstract': 'Relatively few businesses that can take the home-office deduction have been doing so. But that could change.', 'web_url': 'https://boss.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/29/new-home-office-deduction-is-simpler-but-smaller/', 'snippet': 'Relatively few businesses that can take the home-office deduction have been doing so. But that could change.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The new simplified home-office deduction that the Obama administration unveiled earlier this month comes with a trade-off: While more of the very smallest businesses will probably opt to deduct home-office expenses for the first time, using a new streamlined form, many will get a much smaller deduction than they would if they filled out the standard form.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'New Home Office Deduction Is Simpler, but Smaller', 'kicker': 'You&#039;re the Boss', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Small Business', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tax Credits, Deductions and Exemptions', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mills, Karen', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Internal Revenue Service', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Small Business Administration', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-29T06:00:44+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Entrepreneurship', 'byline': {'original': 'By Robb Mandelbaum', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Robb', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Mandelbaum', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/30482373-3e73-55a7-860f-7ff6c70772d3', 'word_count': 727, 'uri': 'nyt://article/30482373-3e73-55a7-860f-7ff6c70772d3'},