 part of broader effort to bolster the oil company’s share price.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Elliott Management is calling for a board shake-up at the Hess Corporation.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Elliott Management Calls for Board Shake-Up at Hess', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-01-29T13:38:16+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dealbook', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dealbook', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/43364f87-d32e-5acd-af1e-645c5a466dd3', 'word_count': 427, 'uri': 'nyt://article/43364f87-d32e-5acd-af1e-645c5a466dd3'}, {'abstract': 'Michael R. Bloomberg has been mocked for the workmanlike Spanish that he uses after finishing public remarks in English, but he is determined to improve.', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/29/for-mayor-a-in-spanish-is-still-on-the-horizonte/', 'snippet': 'Michael R. Bloomberg has been mocked for the workmanlike Spanish that he uses after finishing public remarks in English, but he is determined to improve.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BALTIMORE — Mayor Michael R. Bloomberg’s shaky, determined and unembarrassed stabs at the Spanish language have earned him the admiration of the city’s nonnative speakers and the mocking of a Twitter parody account, @ElBloombito.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'For Mayor, A+ in Spanish Is Still on the Horizonte', 'kicker': 'City Room', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Language and Languages', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Spanish Language',