 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dave Itzkoff', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dave', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Itzkoff', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e396ca9b-53cd-57e6-a099-986ba7731547', 'word_count': 351, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e396ca9b-53cd-57e6-a099-986ba7731547'}, {'abstract': 'Insurgents and the government accused each other in the killing of at least 50 people, most of them men in their 20s and 30s, whose bodies were found in a suburb of Aleppo.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/30/world/middleeast/syria-crisis.html', 'snippet': 'Insurgents and the government accused each other in the killing of at least 50 people, most of them men in their 20s and 30s, whose bodies were found in a suburb of Aleppo.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BEIRUT, Lebanon — Scores of muddied and waterlogged gunshot victims, most of them men in their 20s and 30s, were found dead in a suburb of Syria’s contested northern city of Aleppo on Tuesday. Insurgents and the government accused one another of carrying out the killings in what appeared to be the latest civil war atrocity.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/29/world/middleeast/29syria_cnd/29syria_cnd-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 351, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/01/29/world/middleeast/29syria_cnd/29syria_cnd-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 351}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/29/world/middleeast/29syria_cnd/29syria_cnd-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 599, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/29/world/middleeast/29syria_cnd/29syria_cnd-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1198, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/29/world/middleeast/29syria_cnd/29syria_cnd-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/01/29/world/middleeast/29syria_cnd/29syria_cnd-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/29/world/middleeast/29syria_cnd/29syria_cnd-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Adversaries in Syria Trade Blame for Scores of Killings in Aleppo', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Adversaries in Syria Trade Blame for Scores of Killings in Aleppo', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mourtada, Hania', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Middle East and North Africa Unrest (2010- )', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Human Rights and Human Rights Violations', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Assad, Bashar al-', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United Nations', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'ALEPPO (SYRIA)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Syria', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-29T14:10:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By Hania Mourtada and A