48e401fd-1121-55b4-8db9-8c8626659944'}, {'abstract': 'A new morning show is the first of several building blocks for the struggling cable news channel, led by Jeff Zucker, who revived the “Today” show for NBC.', 'web_url': 'https://mediadecoder.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/29/abcs-chris-cuomo-is-said-to-jump-to-cnn/', 'snippet': 'A new morning show is the first of several building blocks for the struggling cable news channel, led by Jeff Zucker, who revived the “Today” show for NBC.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Two decades ago, a young producer named Jeff Zucker helped a down-on-its-luck “Today” show regain its ratings mojo and start what became a 16-year winning streak. More recently, he was a sounding board for Ben Sherwood, the president of ABC News, as Mr. Sherwood’s “Good Morning America” finally ended the “Today” show’s streak.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'CNN President Tries to Repeat Success in Morning News', 'kicker': 'Media Decoder', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'CNN President Tries to Repeat Success in A.M. News', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'News and News Media', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Ratings (Audience Measurement)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cuomo, Christopher', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Zucker, Jeff', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'ABC INC', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'CNN', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-29T14:11:46+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By Brian Stelter', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Brian', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Stelter', 'qualifier': None, 'title':