/article/d8427656-cf76-57d3-964a-9296b3c3b4de'}, {'abstract': 'Ambiorix Rodriguez, who was the head custodian at a Brooklyn middle school until his arrest in 2011, was also found guilty of repeatedly sexually abusing the eighth grader.', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/29/ex-janitor-convicted-of-raping-girl-in-school-basement-repeatedly/', 'snippet': 'Ambiorix Rodriguez, who was the head custodian at a Brooklyn middle school until his arrest in 2011, was also found guilty of repeatedly sexually abusing the eighth grader.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A former Brooklyn middle-school janitor was convicted Tuesday of repeatedly raping and sexually abusing an eighth-grade girl, the district attorney’s office said.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Ex-Janitor Convicted of Raping Girl in School Basement Repeatedly', 'kicker': 'City Room', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Child Abuse and Neglect', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sex Crimes', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rodriguez, Ambiorix', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Education Department (NYC)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Brooklyn (NYC)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-29T22:32:55+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Edna Ishayik', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Edna', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ishayik', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/dbc64223-f7cd-5279-80b3-6b25c21af85d', 'word_count': 177, 'uri': 'nyt://article/dbc64223-f7cd-5279-80b3-6b25c21af85d'}, {'abstract': '“Hikikomori and the Rental Sister” is about a married New Yorker who has locked himself in a bedroom in his apartment and the Asian “rental sister” hired by his wife to coax him out.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/30/books/hikikomori-and-the-rental-sister-by-jeff-backhaus.html', 'snippet': '“Hikikomori and the Rental Sister” is about a married New Yorker who has locked himself in a bedroom in his apartment and the Asian “rental sister” hired by his wife to coax him out.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It takes extensive puppeteering to get Jeff Backhaus’s debut novel where he wants it to go. The first thing that “Hikikomori and the Rental Sister” must do is come up with an American hermit and agoraphobe with a set of traits that are much more common in Japan. This book needs a man who has withdrawn from society and will not leave his room, although Mr. Backhaus cannot replicate the subtle ways Japanese society enables traumatized young adults to try to erase themselves that way. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/30/arts/BOOK/BOOK-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 437, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/01/30/arts/BOOK/BOOK-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 437}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/30/arts/BOOK/BOOK-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 527, 'width': 724, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/30/arts/BOOK/BOOK-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 527, 'width': 724, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/30/arts/BOOK/BOOK-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'su