'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/abaf0ab0-b942-510f-89ef-2bbee384d53b', 'word_count': 851, 'uri': 'nyt://article/abaf0ab0-b942-510f-89ef-2bbee384d53b'}, {'abstract': 'There’s more to the story of what makes raising children more difficult as a single parent than just the lack of a partner.', 'web_url': 'https://parenting.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/29/does-championing-marriage-exclude-single-parents/', 'snippet': 'There’s more to the story of what makes raising children more difficult as a single parent than just the lack of a partner.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Institute for American Values has issued a fairly remarkable “Call for a New Conversation on Marriage.” Its president, David Blankenhorn, is perhaps best known as the expert who testified against gay marriage in the Proposition 8 trial in California, and then changed his mind, publicly, with an Op-Ed article in The New York Times. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Does Championing Marriage Exclude Single Parents?', 'kicker': 'Motherlode', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Families and Family Life', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Marriages', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Parenting', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Same-Sex Marriage, Civil Unions and Domestic Partnerships', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Blankenhorn, David', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Institute for American Values', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-29T23:37:36+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': "By Kj Dell'Antonia", 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kj', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': "Dell'Antonia", 'qualifier': None