'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/30/sports/football/super-bowl-at-media-day-spotlight-on-head-injuries-grows.html', 'snippet': 'Players at Super Bowl media day discussed how football is being affected by head injuries and the mounting evidence that long-term brain damage can be linked to injuries sustained on the field.', 'lead_paragraph': 'NEW ORLEANS — It has become a staple of Super Bowl week, as much a part of the pregame to the N.F.L.’s biggest event as the annual media day: a discussion of how football is being affected by head injuries and the mounting evidence that long-term brain damage can be linked to injuries sustained on the field. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'At Media Day, Spotlight on Head Injuries Grows', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'At Media Day, Spotlight On Head Injuries Grows', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Pollard, Bernard', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Concussions', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Super Bowl', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'San Francisco 49ers', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Baltimore Ravens', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sports Injuries', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Chronic Traumatic Encephalopathy', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-30T03:39:49+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Football', 'byline': {'original': 'By Benjamin Hoffman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Benjamin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hoffman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of