}, {'abstract': 'The 49ers’ Tramaine Brock is the first student from Belhaven University, a liberal arts school in Jackson, Miss. with about 2,600 on-campus students, ever to play in the N.F.L.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/30/sports/football/49ers-tramaine-brock-goes-from-naia-to-nfls-biggest-stage.html', 'snippet': 'The 49ers’ Tramaine Brock is the first student from Belhaven University, a liberal arts school in Jackson, Miss. with about 2,600 on-campus students, ever to play in the N.F.L.', 'lead_paragraph': 'NEW ORLEANS — While Sunday’s Super Bowl will feature two quarterbacks from colleges with relatively unheralded football programs, it would be incorrect to say that either Baltimore’s Joe Flacco, who went to Delaware, or San Francisco’s Colin Kaepernick, who played at Nevada-Reno, have the most modest college pedigree in the game.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/30/sports/YBELHAVEN2/YBELHAVEN2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 484, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/01/30/sports/YBELHAVEN2/YBELHAVEN2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 484}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/30/sports/YBELHAVEN2/YBELHAVEN2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 826, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/30/sports/YBELHAVEN2/YBELHAVEN2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1523, 'width': 1887, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/30/sports/YBELHAVEN2/YBELHAVEN2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width':