uries.', 'lead_paragraph': 'GREENBURGH, N.Y. — Jason Kidd and Tyson Chandler missed practice Tuesday as injuries continue to cast doubt on the Knicks’ ability to sustain their performance in the second half of the season.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'With So Many Ailing, Knicks Focus on Plan B', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'With So Many Ailing, Knicks Focus on Plan B', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Knicks', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kidd, Jason', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Chandler, Tyson', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sports Injuries', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Basketball', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-30T04:21:32+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Basketball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Zach Schonbrun', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Zach', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Schonbrun', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/07c45450-5e46-516e-876f-3bc3348fe8be', 'word_count': 423, 'uri': 'nyt://article/07c45450-5e46-516e-876f-3bc3348fe8be'}, {'abstract': 'Mayor Thomas M. Menino of Boston was hospitalized in October and little seen for the rest of the year, but he appeared vigorous in his annual address.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/30/us/mayor-menino-of-boston-draws-cheers-at-speech.html', 'snippet': 'Mayor Thomas M. Menino of Boston was hospitalized in October and little seen for the rest of the year, but he appeared vigorous in his annual address.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BOSTON — It was the 20th time that Thomas M. Menino, Boston’s longest-serving mayor, had delivered an annual address to t