Dorm in Texas? No problem. Now, you can do an internship without ever setting foot in the office.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/02/03/education/edlife/virtual-internships.html', 'snippet': 'Job in New York? Dorm in Texas? No problem. Now, you can do an internship without ever setting foot in the office.', 'lead_paragraph': 'FOR her social media internship at Do Something, a nonprofit organization in New York aimed at youth activism, Felicia Fitzpatrick checks in with her boss before getting started on the day’s tasks. The twist? She reports to work by e-mail or Skype from her dorm room at the University of Texas, Austin.', 'print_section': 'ED', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/02/03/education/03REMOTE/03REMOTE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/02/03/education/03REMOTE/03REMOTE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/02/03/education/03REMOTE/03REMOTE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/02/03/education/03REMOTE/03REMOTE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1642, 'width': 1642, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/02/03/education/03REMOTE/03REMOTE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/02/03/education/03REMOTE/03REMOTE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbL