n. In the last year there have been signs that the two\xa0 had resumed dating: they collaborated on songs and appeared in public together several times.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/30/arts/30artsbeat-rihanna/30artsbeat-rihanna-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 474, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/01/30/arts/30artsbeat-rihanna/30artsbeat-rihanna-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 474}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/30/arts/30artsbeat-rihanna/30artsbeat-rihanna-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 810, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/30/arts/30artsbeat-rihanna/30artsbeat-rihanna-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1110, 'width': 1404, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/30/arts/30artsbeat-rihanna/30artsbeat-rihanna-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/01/30/arts/30artsbeat-rihanna/30artsbeat-rihanna-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/30/arts/30artsbeat-rihanna/30artsbeat-rihanna-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Rihanna Says She Is Back With Chris Brown', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Brown, Chris', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rihanna', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-30T16:34:49+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By James C. McKinley Jr', 'person': [{'firstname': 'James', 'middlename': 'C.', 'lastname': 'McKinley', 'qualifier': 'Jr', 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/641ac2df-8040-5c94-b24f-cdddba6c9123', 'word_count': 256, 'uri': 'nyt://article/641ac2df-8040-5c94-b24f-cdddba6c9123'}, {'abstract': 'More than 100 years ago, one of America’s greatest poets offered his reflection of the nation’s shifting population and in particular the role of people of Hispanic origin.', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/30/as-immigration-takes-center-stage-thoughts-from-walt-whitman/', 'snippet': 'More than 100 years ago, one of America’s greatest poets offered his reflection of the nation’s shifting population and in particular the role of people of Hispanic origin.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The issue of what to do about the 11 million illegal immigrants living in the United States has taken center stage with President Obama and Congress firing the opening salvo in their efforts to overhaul the nation’s immigration laws. The discussion has focused on making efforts to better secure the country’s border with Mexico a priority. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/31/nyregion/30cityroom-whitman/30cityroom-whitman-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 820, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/01/31/nyregion/30cityroom-whitman/30cityroom-whitman-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 820}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/31/nyregion/30cityroom-whitman/30cityroom-whitman-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 750, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/31/nyregion/30cityroom-whitman/30cityroom-whitman-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1833, 'width': 1342, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/31/nyregion/30cityroom-whitman/30cityroom-whitman-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/01/31/nyregion/30cityroom-whitman/30cityroom-whitman-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/31/nyregion/30cityroom-whitman/30cityroom-whitman-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'As Immigration Takes Center Stage, Thoughts From Walt Whitman', 'kicker': 'City Room', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hispanic-Americans', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Illegal Immigrants', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Immigration and Emigration', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Law and Legislation', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Poetry and Poets', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Whitman, Walt', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-30T16:40:10+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7d048a4a-2353-5476-9625-a550febb8598', 'word_count': 311, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7d048a4a-2353-5476-9625-a550febb8598'}, {'abstract': 'How a European banking family made a fortune off Southern cotton.', 'web_url': 'https://opinionator.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/30/the-cotton-bond-bubble/', 'snippet': 'How a European banking family made a fortune off Southern cotton.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It’s a story recognizable to anyone who dealt with toxic derivatives in the early 21st century: on Jan. 29, 1863, the Confederate Congress secretly authorized the Paris-based bankers at Erlanger et Cie. – which rivaled Rothschild for European royalty connections – to underwrite $15 million of Confederate bonds, denominated in British pounds or French francs. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Cotton Bond Bubble', 'kicker': 'Disunion', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Banking and Financial Institutions', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Civil War (US) (1861-65)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cotton', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Stocks and Bonds', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Davis, William C', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Times', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'France', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-30T16:41:36+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Phil Leigh', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Phil', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Leigh', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://art