 executive of the online video Web site said this week that the channel will look at options for charging for its content. Currently, it is mostly an advertising-driven service.', 'web_url': 'https://mediadecoder.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/30/youtube-expected-to-experiment-with-paid-subscriptions-for-some-channels/', 'snippet': 'An executive of the online video Web site said this week that the channel will look at options for charging for its content. Currently, it is mostly an advertising-driven service.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MIAMI — YouTube continues to inch toward a paid subscription option for some of the professionally produced channels, employees of the online video Web site said this week.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'YouTube Expected to Experiment With Paid Subscriptions for Some Channels', 'kicker': 'Media Decoder', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Computers and the Internet', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Prices (Fares, Fees and Rates)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Video Recordings and Downloads', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Web-Original Programming', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'ADVERTISING AGE', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'AMAZON.COM INC', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Google Inc', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Hulu.com', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'YouTube.com', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Miami (Fla)', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-30T16:53:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By Brian Stelter', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Brian', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Stelter', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/64c8b7da-20e4-561b-8e31-84e18660c563', 'word_count': 379, 'uri': 'nyt://article/64c8b7da-20e4-561b-8e31-84e18660c563'}, {'abstract': 'The writer is back in training camp with the U.S. women’s national team.', 'web_url': 'https://goal.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/30/in-national-team-camp-treasuring-the-opportunity/', 'snippet': 'The writer is back in training camp with the U.S. women’s national team.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MONTCLAIR, N.J. — On Monday I saw a fun historical fact on Twitter about the United States women’s national team : Six years ago to the day, I received my first cap against England in the Four Nations Tournament in China. At the time, Greg Ryan was the coach. When Pia Sundhage took over, I was hopeful that I’d make a place for myself as a regular on the team. All these years later, I am thankful to have been to many training camps, participated in the World Cup qualifying tournament, and have 16 caps and one goal.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'In National Team Camp, Treasuring the Opportunity', 'kicker': 'Goal', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Soccer', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Averbuch, Yael', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sermanni, Tom', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': "United States Women's National Soccer Team", 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-30T16:56:00+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Soccer', 'byline': {'original': 'By Yael Averbuch', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Yael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Averbuch', 'qualifier': None, 'title': 