 absence.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As the N.B.A. season approaches its second act, the Chicago Bulls are busy anticipating the return of All-Star point guard Derrick Rose from the knee injury that knocked him out last spring. Despite Rose’s absence, they sit in third place in the Eastern Conference with what appears to be a primrose path back to the playoffs and for that, they can largely thank Jimmy Butler.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/31/sports/basketball/31butler/31butler-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 876, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/01/31/sports/basketball/31butler/31butler-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 876}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/31/sports/basketball/31butler/31butler-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 702, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/31/sports/basketball/31butler/31butler-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1403, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/31/sports/basketball/31butler/31butler-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/01/31/sports/basketball/31butler/31butler-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/31/sports/basketball/31butler/31butler-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}