most owners put off getting a valuation until a sale is imminent. But there are financial benefits to doing so earlier.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/31/business/smallbusiness/valuing-a-small-business-in-advance-with-cloud-software.html', 'snippet': 'Amid the day-to-day demands of running a small business, most owners put off getting a valuation until a sale is imminent. But there are financial benefits to doing so earlier.', 'lead_paragraph': 'At 53, Joe Ritz is old enough to remember a time when many of the classic cars that now pull into his specialized repair shop were new. “It’s one field where it pays to be a senior citizen,” he said. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/31/business/31sbiz-web/31sbiz-web-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/01/31/business/31sbiz-web/31sbiz-web-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/31/business/31sbiz-web/31sbiz-web-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/31/business/31sbiz-web/31sbiz-web-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/31/business/31sbiz-web/31sbiz-web-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/01/31/business/31sbiz-web/31sbiz-web-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight