om/2013/01/30/with-a-smile-ray-lewis-denies-extract-allegations/', 'snippet': 'The Ravens linebacker Ray Lewis denied that had ever taken a deer antler extract that contained a growth hormone banned by the N.F.L.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A day after swiftly brushing off a report that he had used a banned performance enhancing substance this season to help recover from a torn triceps, Ravens linebacker Ray Lewis strongly rebuffed the allegations on Wednesday.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'With a Smile, Ray Lewis Denies Extract Allegations', 'kicker': 'The Fifth Down', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': "Lewis's Stronger Response", 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lewis, Ray', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Baltimore Ravens', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Football League', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-30T22:09:41+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Football', 'byline': {'original': 'By Justin Sablich', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Justin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sablich', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3ba4475f-cc4d-5841-8005-9bea425781c0', 'word_count': 329, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3ba4475f-cc4d-5841-8005-9bea425781c0'}, {'abstract': 'Raspberry Pi, a tiny computer that sells for $35, was created to teach students how computers work.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/01/31/technology/personaltech/raspberry-pi-a-computer-tinkerers-dream.html', 'snippet': 'Raspberry Pi, a tiny computer that sells for $35, was created to teach students how computers work.', 'lead_paragraph'