 Myanmar is surging in Asia, Taiwan is the most free, and Thailand is performing badly.', 'web_url': 'https://rendezvous.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/31/report-shows-press-freedom-under-assault-in-asia/', 'snippet': 'In its Press Freedom Index 2013, the media group Reporters Without Borders finds that Myanmar is surging in Asia, Taiwan is the most free, and Thailand is performing badly.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BEIJING — If the world were divided into six regions where the press is most free and where it’s least free, Asia, where nearly 60 percent of the world’s people live, would come in fourth, Reporters Without Borders says in its Press Freedom Index 2013.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/31/world/asia/31FreedomRDV/31FreedomRDV-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 398, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/01/31/world/asia/31FreedomRDV/31FreedomRDV-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 398}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/31/world/asia/31FreedomRDV/31FreedomRDV-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 680, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/31/world/asia/31FreedomRDV/31FreedomRDV-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1360, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/31/world/asia/31FreedomRDV/31FreedomRDV-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/01/31/world/asia/31FreedomRDV/31FreedomRDV-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {