tress. Here are five strategies to help you best prepare for the SAT.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Shaan Patel, who scored a perfect 2400 on the SAT, is the author of “SAT 2400 in Just 7 Steps” and a co-creator of an SAT prep course for Veritas Prep. He is a medical student at the University of Southern California.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/17/education/choice-tipsheet-75/choice-tipsheet-75-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/17/education/choice-tipsheet-75/choice-tipsheet-75-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/17/education/choice-tipsheet-75/choice-tipsheet-75-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/09/17/education/choice-tipsheet-75/choice-tipsheet-75-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Tip Sheet: 5 Study Strategies for the SAT', 'kicker': 'The Choice', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-01-31T10:51:29+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Shaan Patel', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Shaan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Patel', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1596beed-d538-5bd8-a493-f005ffcefc76', 'word_count': 611, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1596beed-d538-5bd8-a493-f005ffcefc76'}, {'abstract': 'The 49ers have been consistently among the best, and the Ravens are hot. We’ve seen this movie before, but luck can’t be counted on to continue.', 'web_url': 'https://fifthdown.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/31/super-bowl-probability-excellence-versus-momentum/', 'snippet': 'The 49ers have been consistently among the best, and the Ravens are hot. We’ve seen this movie before, but luck can’t be counted on to continue.', 'lead_paragraph': 'This year’s Super Bowl provides a familiar narrative. One team is as complete as a team can be, very strong on both sides of the ball. The other team got hot at the right time, having upset two of the best teams in the league en route to the big game.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Super Bowl Probability: Excellence Versus Momentum', 'kicker': 'The Fifth Down', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Super Bowl', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Baltimore Ravens', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'San Francisco 49ers', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-31T11:00:57+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Football', 'byline': {'original': 'By Brian Burke', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Brian', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Burke', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2414e517-23e7-5491-b4a8-fb890aa1acf1', 'word_count': 521, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2414e517-23e7-5491-b4a8-fb890aa1acf1'}, {'abstract': 'Think of the cost of the first car as the tuition for your Introduction to Classic Car Collecting 101.', 'web_url': 'https://wheels.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/31/advice-for-car-collectors-from-first-rides-to-last-rites/', 'snippet': 'Think of the cost of the first car as the tuition for your Introduction to Classic Car Collecting 101.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Newcomers buying a classic car face a potentially confusing first-time experience: What car should I buy? Where should I buy it? How do I know I’m paying the right price? ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Advice for Car Collectors: From First Rides to Last Rites', 'kicker': 'Wheels', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-01-31T11:00:57+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Automobiles', 'byline': {'original': 'By Larry Edsall', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Larry', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Edsall', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8148a690-88d5-530c-a110-46ded9c2d91e', 'word_count': 702, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8148a690-88d5-530c-a110-46ded9c2d91e'}, {'abstract': 'Tehran has told the United Nations nuclear watchdog of plans to install new equipment at the Natanz plant, a diplomat said.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/02/01/world/middleeast/iran-is-said-to-be-set-to-accelerate-uranium-enrichment.html', 'snippet': 'Tehran has told the United Nations nuclear watchdog of plans to install new equipment at the Natanz plant, a diplomat said.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — Iran has told the United Nations nuclear supervisory body that it plans to install more sophisticated equipment at its principal nuclear enrichment plant, a diplomat said Thursday, enabling it to greatly accelerate processing of uranium in a move likely to worry the United States, Israel and the West.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Iran Said to Be Set to Hasten Uranium Enrichment', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Iran Is Said to Be Set to Accelerate Uranium Enrichment', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Iran', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Uranium', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'International Atomic Energy Agency', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Nuclear Weapons', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-31T11:04:10+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By Alan Cowell', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Alan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cowell', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6401a30f-86d5-5a7a-b2df-8e94b729a201', 'word_count': 849, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6401a30f-86d5-5a7a-b2df-8e94b729a201'}, {'abstract': 'I’m taking leave of my column for a few months to work on a new book. Speaking of which, title suggestions welcome….', 'web_url': 'https://kristof.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/01/31/off-on-a-book-leave/', 'snippet': 'I’m taking leave of my column for a few months to work on a new book. Speaking of which, title suggestions welcome….', 'lead_paragraph': 'Today’s column is my last one for a number of months. I’m taking a book leave from my column to work with my wife, Sheryl WuDunn, on a new book. The theme is the benefits to ourselves when we engage in a cause larger than ourselves, and, given that, how we can engage in a way that actually works. In other words: the emerging science of how to make a difference. We do need a title, so ideas most welcome.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Off on a Book Leave…', 'kicker': 'Nicholas Kristof', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'na