hen Schwarzman of Blackstone discussed the private equity industry’s public image, which he said could benefit from a re-branding.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2013/01/31/rethinking-the-term-private-equity/', 'snippet': 'On a conference call on Thursday, Stephen Schwarzman of Blackstone discussed the private equity industry’s public image, which he said could benefit from a re-branding.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Is the private equity industry ready for a name change?', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Rethinking the Term ‘Private Equity’', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Private Equity', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Schwarzman, Stephen A', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'The Blackstone Group', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-31T18:41:47+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By William Alden', 'person': [{'firstname': 'William', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Alden', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5da43270-6f66-5a75-a267-65e04f1c4282', 'word_count': 240, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5da43270-6f66-5a75-a267-65e04f1c4282'}, {'abstract': 'Sure, you can ski nearby. But the “capital” of the Austrian Alps pulses to everything après, from upscale dining to all-night dance clubs.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/02/03/travel/36-hours-in-innsbruck-austria.html', 'snippet': 'Sure, you can ski nearby. But the “capital” of the Austrian Alps pulses to everything après, from upscale dining to all-night dance clubs.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Alps might be for skiing, but the self-styled “capital” of the Austrian Alps, Innsbruck, lives for just about everything après — \xa0eating, drinking, shopping and partying. Despite its founding as the capital of the Tyrol in the Middle Ages, the city on the Inn River maintains a consistently youthful attitude, thanks in part to 30,000 university students in a population of just 120,000 residents, while a new interest in world-class modern architecture by the likes of David Chipperfield, Dominique Perrault and Zaha Hadid is starting to compete for attention with the Renaissance-era buildings and labyrinthine lanes of Old Town. By all means, enjoy the nearby slopes, like those at the Stubai Glacier. But don’t be surprised if the lifts you enjoy most are the ones that take you to the city’s many rooftop bars, upscale restaurants and dance clubs that go all night.', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/02/03/travel/03HOURS1_SPAN/03HOURS1_SPAN-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 364, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/02/03/travel/03HOURS1_SPAN/03HOURS1_SPAN-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 364}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/02/03/travel/03HOURS1_SPAN/03HOURS1_SPAN-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 622, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/02/03/travel/03HOURS1_SPAN/03HOURS1_SPAN-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1243, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/02/03/travel/03HOURS1_SPAN/03HOURS1_SPAN-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStand