highlight 17th-century composers who wrote music in Stylus Fantasticus, an early Baroque style.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/02/01/arts/music/quicksilver-period-instrument-ensemble-at-gilder-lehrman-hall.html', 'snippet': 'The period-instrument ensemble Quicksilver used a program to highlight 17th-century composers who wrote music in Stylus Fantasticus, an early Baroque style.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Matthias Weckmann, Johann Schmelzer, Johann Kaspar Kerll and Antonio Bertali have been largely confined to historical footnotes. But these 17th-century composers received a vivid airing in the Morgan Library & Museum’s Gilder Lehrman Hall on Tuesday evening. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/02/01/arts/01EARLY/01EARLY-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/02/01/arts/01EARLY/01EARLY-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/02/01/arts/01EARLY/01EARLY-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/02/01/arts/01EARLY/01EARLY-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/02/01/arts/01EARLY/EARLY-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/02/01/arts/01EARLY/EARLY-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge