ry dance performance, will leave the company she founded because of health problems.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Trisha Brown, a dance experimentalist of the 1960s and ’70s who went on to help define contemporary dance performance, has decided to withdraw from leading the company she founded because of health problems but has given her blessing to its continued existence, her associates said on Thursday.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Health Troubles Cause Trisha Brown to Leave Her Dance Company', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Health Troubles Cause Trisha Brown to Leave Her Dance Company', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Wakin, Daniel J', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dancing', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Brown, Trisha', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-31T22:51:58+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Dance', 'byline': {'original': 'By Daniel J. Wakin', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Daniel', 'middlename': 'J.', 'lastname': 'Wakin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d2c6c262-228c-53ee-8f62-7fd82615a571', 'word_count': 515, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d2c6c262-228c-53ee-8f62-7fd82615a571'}, {'abstract': 'The Trisha Brown Dance Company’s program at the Brooklyn Academy of Music on Wednesday evening featured four works from this choreographer that span 45 years.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/02/01/arts/dance/trisha-brown-dance-company-at-brooklyn-academy-of-music.html', 'snippet': 'The Trisha Brown Dance Company’s program at the Brooklyn Academy of Music on Wednesday evening featured four works from this choreographer that span 45 years.', 'lead_paragraph': 'At the end of Wednesday’s opening night performance by the Trisha Brown Dance Company at the Brooklyn Academy of Music there was no curtain call from Trisha Brown herself. She announced in December that two of the four works on the program are to be her last new dances. Inevitably there was a sense of loss. But who would have known that from the audience in the Howard Gilman Opera House? Cheers were hearty for all four pieces.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/02/01/arts/dance/01BROWN_SPAN/01BROWN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/02/01/arts/dance/01BROWN_SPAN/01BROWN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/02/01/arts/dance/01BROWN_SPAN/01BROWN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/02/01/arts/dance/01BROWN_SPAN/01BROWN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/02/01/arts/dance/01BROWN_SPAN/01BROWN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/02/01/arts/dance/01BROWN_SPAN/01BROWN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/02/01/arts/dance/01BROWN_SPAN/01BROWN-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', '