edf'}, {'abstract': '“Belle’s,” a new sitcom on TV One about a black family that owns a restaurant, uses familiar devices.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/02/01/arts/television/belles-a-new-tv-one-sitcom.html', 'snippet': '“Belle’s,” a new sitcom on TV One about a black family that owns a restaurant, uses familiar devices.', 'lead_paragraph': '“Belle’s,” a new comedy on TV One about a family-owned restaurant in Atlanta, serves its black-eyed peas with a heaping side of television history. It’s part of a direct line of descent that includes “The Mary Tyler Moore Show,” “Taxi” and “The Cosby Show.” As sitcom bloodlines go, that’s hard to beat.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/02/01/arts/BELLE/BELLE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 338, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/02/01/arts/BELLE/BELLE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 338}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/02/01/arts/BELLE/BELLE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 576, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/02/01/arts/BELLE/BELLE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1152, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/02/01/arts/BELLE/BELLE-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/02/01/arts/BELLE/BELLE-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'ty