e_of_material': 'Schedule', '_id': 'nyt://article/6d377d7d-8f0a-549a-a5f5-b2aad72bc5b4', 'word_count': 2814, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6d377d7d-8f0a-549a-a5f5-b2aad72bc5b4'}, {'abstract': 'At old master auctions at Sotheby’s and Christie’s, Botticelli, Batoni and Memling works sold at new highs, while paintings by Goya and Guercino languished.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/02/01/arts/design/botticelli-and-batoni-fetch-fetch-record-auction-prices.html', 'snippet': 'At old master auctions at Sotheby’s and Christie’s, Botticelli, Batoni and Memling works sold at new highs, while paintings by Goya and Guercino languished.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There were record prices for artists like Fra Bartolommeo, Sandro Botticelli, Pompeo Batoni and Hans Memling at the old master painting auctions held on Wednesday and Thursday at Christie’s and Sotheby’s in New York. But there were also scores of works by artists like Goya, Bassano and Guercino that went unsold without so much as a bid.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '23', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/02/01/arts/01VOGEL_SPAN/01VOGEL-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 434, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/02/01/arts/01VOGEL_SPAN/01VOGEL-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 434}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/02/01/arts/01VOGEL_SPAN/01VOGEL-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 742, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/02/01/arts/01VOGEL_SPAN/01VOGEL-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1483, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': Non