ohn (Rob Mayes), in any case, and is either entirely spoiler-proof or completely self-spoiling. It lays waste to linear narration, thematic coherence, psychological plausibility and just about everything else you might expect to encounter. It zigs, zags and trips over its own feet and on its own home-brewed hallucinogens. It’s a ridiculous, preposterous, sometimes maddening experience, but also kind of a blast. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Addictive ‘Soy Sauce’ With Ruinous Power', 'kicker': 'Movie Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Addictive ‘Soy Sauce’ With Ruinous Power', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Coscarelli, Don', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'John Dies at the End (Movie)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-01-31T23:09:17+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Movies', 'byline': {'original': 'By A.O. Scott', 'person': [{'firstname': 'A.', 'middlename': 'O.', 'lastname': 'Scott', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/379495d3-0af1-5a0c-9483-dca65ccedbd6', 'word_count': 506, 'uri': 'nyt://article/379495d3-0af1-5a0c-9483-dca65ccedbd6'}, {'abstract': 'A selected guide to dance in the New York area.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/02/01/arts/dance/dance-listings-for-feb-1-7.html', 'snippet': 'A selected guide to dance in the New York area.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Dance', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Dance Listings for Feb. 1-7', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Listings', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords